<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">ONN</book>
  <para style="h">Madiyu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Awalu Sulu Nafulu Madiyuhe Selelu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Madiyu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mad</para>
  <para style="mt2">Awalu Sulu Nafulu</para>
  <para style="mt">Madiyuhe Selelu</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesu helefealu iwi ligia, kegele E mololu amone, awalu sulu nafulu selelu dobu amone, bugo biniba aleba ami, agelemo, bugo Madiyu ewe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bugo eweda seleba ufulu inolo amo, ehe ene wi seleba ufuluale. Auluso, amakele ilihe bugo ewene wi ofelesiamo, dagese dilo inolo Madiyuhe bugo ewe selelububa hilisesia, ili Awalu Sulu Nafulu Madiyu Seleluba wi ufulu. Dagese dilo inolo Madiyumone sadalu bugo ewene, lalolu 9.9-13 selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">Bugo ewe awasiamo, Maliahe Yesu seba disia mololu amone maugaba awafe. Aufia, Madiyuhe sadalu amo awalabia abia, ilihe Yesu dufa olalu amone awafe. Aufia, ehe Yesumo haiba degefia balilu dana afasia, ene dameneda afasia, hebene lago maiyo aasi awaba elolu.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">Kegele bule no, Madiyuhe idele inolo bugo eweda alegafe ili amofea waleyo hamefe amo, ewe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Baibolo Maugaba Seleiya (Olpela Kontrak) ami, Godehe oloba huliale sulu wedinale saaba ufulu. Saaba ofa sulu wedinale ami selelu amo, Yesufea wakaliba hugafe. Madiyuhe saaba ufulu sulu amo auba wakaliba hugafeba walesiamo, e selesia, Godehe idele inolo gasiba dafelagoba diyone inolo Kelisoba iminiba ufulu amo, Yesu E-ba gaduba selefe. Sulu selelu haisi amo ewe bamale. Madiyu 1.22-23, aufia 2.4-6, aufia 2.14-15, aufia 2.23, aufia 4.13-16, aufia 8.16-17, aufia 12.15-21, aufia 13.34-35, aufia 21.2-5, aufia 21.16, aufia 26.24, aufia 26.31, aufia 26.54, aufia 27.6-10 ami bamale.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">Kegele bule no, Madiyuhe idele inolo bugo eweda alegafe ili amofea waleyo hamefe amo, ewe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesune dabalu mololufea alefasia, Gode E idele inolo sunia yasifia luba ligia, ine Saminilo koleba miliyo hamefe. Aulugulu, Madiyuhe Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adafealo saaba sulu wedinale selelu.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">Madiyuhe bugo ewe seleba ofelesiamo, sulu selale bia Yesu solu amoda selelu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Agelemo, bugo ewene lalolu 5-7 selelu dobu. Yesu sulu selale amo hele gale uleno felafia, ana ami ligia solu. Sulu amohe nini Godene mosomu idele inolo halaguba miliyobiba walefe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sulu selale aganebomo, lalolu 10 selelu dobu. Sulu amomo Yesuhe Ene walelu faibili ilifea solu. Yesune sulu idele inolo noolofea saeyone abia, kegele noolo ilihe molomesine solu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sulu selale osolomo, lalolu 13 selelu dobu. Sulu amimo, Yesuhe idele inolofea Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia, Saminilo Adamone besi sulu noolo walesia solu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sulu selale binibomo, lalolu 18 selelu dobu. Sulu amimo, Yesuhe idele inolo Ene walelu faibilida miliyo hamefe ili amofea mana eweguba kuliba malaleba walelu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aufia, afelesia, sulu selale bimo, lalolu 24-25 selelu dobu. Sulu amimo, Yesuhe kegele noolo aleba elosia holobagaeyobafe amone solu.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Kelisone saladegelu ine wi selelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Lugu 3.23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 17:11">1Sto 17.11</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:18">Stt 22.18</ref></char>
    </note> Yesu <char style="w">Keliso</char> E-mo, <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> saladegelu alefasia seba dulu alolu. Deibidi e-mo, <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamane</char> saladegelu alefasia, seba dulu alolu. Yesu Ene enauwadaline saladegelu amone selelabia mulumo, ine wimo eweguba selelu dobu.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Abalahama e-mo, Aisegene enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:2">Aisege e-mo, <char style="w" lemma="Yekobo">Yekobone</char> enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:2">Yekobo e-mo, Yudada, ene elewodalida, ine enao.<verse eid="MAT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 38:27-30">Stt 38.27-30</ref>; <ref loc="RUT 4:18-22">Rut 4.18-22</ref></char>
    </note>Yuda e-mo, Felesedai, Seladai, aine enao. Aine enaemo, Dama.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:3">Felese e-mo, Hesolonone enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:3">Hesolono e-mo, Lamane enao.<verse eid="MAT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Lama e-mo, Aminadabane enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:4">Aminadaba e-mo, Nasonone enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:4">Nasono e-mo, Salemonone enao.<verse eid="MAT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="RUT 4:13-17">Rut 4.13-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Salemono e-mo, Boasane enao. Boasane enaemo, <char style="w">Lahabo</char>.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:5">Boasa e-mo, Obedene enao. Obedene enaemo, Ludi.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:5">Obede e-mo, <char style="w" lemma="Yesi">Yesine</char> enao.<verse eid="MAT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 12:24">2Sml 12.24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesi e-mo, kini Deibidine enao.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 1:6" />
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:6">Deibidi e-mo, <char style="w" lemma="Solomono">Solomonone</char> enao. Solomonone enaemo, Ulaiane eamono amo e.<verse eid="MAT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Solomono e-mo, Lehoboamone enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:7">Lehoboamo e-mo, Abiyane enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:7">Abiya e-mo, Asane enao.<verse eid="MAT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa e-mo, Yehosafadene enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:8">Yehosafade e-mo, Yeholamone enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:8">Yeholamo e-mo, Usiane enao.<verse eid="MAT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Usia e-mo, Yodamone enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:9">Yodamo e-mo, Ahasane enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:9">Ahasa e-mo, Hesekiane enao.<verse eid="MAT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hesekia e-mo, Manasene enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:10">Manase e-mo, Amonone enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:10">Amono e-mo, Yosaiane enao.<verse eid="MAT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 22-24">2Kin 22–24</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2Sto 36.10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:20">Jer 27.20</ref></char>
    </note>Yosaia e-mo, Yehoiaginida, ene elewodalida, ine enao. Fogo amohe gisa ilihe Isolaele ili <char style="w">Babilono</char> ami dibolo luba dia dedalelu.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 3:2">Esr 3.2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Babilono dibolo dafasia, Yehoiagini e-mo, Saladielene enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:12">Saladiele e-mo, Selubabelene enao.<verse eid="MAT 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Selubabele e-mo, Abiudune enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:13">Abiudu e-mo, Eliakimune enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:13">Eliakimu e-mo, Asolone enao.<verse eid="MAT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Asolo e-mo, Sadokone enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:14">Sadoko e-mo, Akimune enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:14">Akimu e-mo, Eliudune enao.<verse eid="MAT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliudu e-mo, Eleasane enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:15">Eleasa e-mo, Madanene enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:15">Madane e-mo, Yekobone enao.<verse eid="MAT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yekobo e-mo, <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[2]], Malia, Yesune enae amone aino e">Yosebene</char> enao.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="MAT 1:16">Yosebe e-mo, <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[1]], Yesune enae">Maliane</char> aino. Aufia, Malia ehe Yesu seba dulu, amomo ilihe Kelisoba sodo.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Aulugulu, Abalahama amifia inigia, Deibidifea alegalabia inigia elolumo, saladegelu alegalumo, daabuluba ulefia biniba (14) alolu. Aufia, Deibidifeafia alegalabia inigia, Isolaele Babilono dibolo daaiya ami elolumo, saladegelu alegalumo, daabuluba ulefia biniba (14) alolu. Aufia, fogo ili Babilono dibolo daaiya amifia alegalabia inigia, Keliso seba duluiya ami elolumo, saladegelu alegalumo, daabuluba ulefia biniba (14) alolu.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maliahe Yesu Keliso seba dulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Lugu 2.1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:27">Lug 1.27</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 1:35">35</ref></char>
    </note>Yesu Keliso seba dulune awalu amo eweguba. Ene enae <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[1]], Yesune enae">Maliamo</char>, e-mo <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[2]], Malia, Yesune enae amone aino e">Yosebefea</char> saaba melu ido asulu. Auluso, fogo aalu aso ule adesiale labihe, Maliamo faibe saabi abulu. <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> E-su mololune, Malia faibe asulu. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Ene aino Yosebemo, e <char style="w">isolu galagololu</char> inologulu, ehe Maliamo idele inolo si saabia yuamesi moloyo hamelualene, ehe e muguba afiyoba asigi diba sefia daiyalu.<verse eid="MAT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Yosebe e auba aso hiliseba labi, <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">Saminilone sulu dia ano</char> uleno udia ami efea holobagafia selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> enauwa, Yosebe ga, gahe Malia ge idoba diyomo sagilimabiyo. Doma, Faibe e libo saabe ogomo, Asubane Noekenemohe efea melu. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:31">Lug 1.31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:21">2.21</ref></char></note>Ehe inolo faibe seba diyobafe. Faibe amofea, gahe ene wimo Yesu homale. Mau enebamo, Ehe ene mosomu ine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolufeafia</char> <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba diyobafe</char>.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yesu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">wi amone kiwi sisa ewe: Idele inolo gasiba dafelagoba dilo inolo.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Kegele ewe sunia, Saminilo samini <char style="w" lemma="Saaba ofolo">saaba ofolone</char> mofeofeafia sulu saaba ufulumone, wakaliba sugamesine holobagalu. Sulu saaba ufulu amo eweguba. <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Ais 7.14</ref></char></note><char style="qt">“Doma. Ido buda uleno inolodai haneluale amohe, faibe asefasia, inolo faibe seba diyobafe. Ausi, ilihe ene wimo, Emanueleba saeyobafe.”</char> Sulu amone sisamo eweguba, Gode ninidai labe. <figure style="fig" alt="Angel and Joseph" file="C053.jpg" size="col" loc="1.20" copy="© 1997 New Tribes Mission/Foreign Mission Board, Southern Baptist Convention." ref="1.20-23">Godene sulu dia ano uleno udia ami Yosebefea sulu selefe.</figure><verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Ausi, Yosebe e hanelu degesiamo, ehe Saminilone sulu dia anohe efea soluguba molosia, Maliamo ene idoba luba dulu. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:21">Lug 2.21</ref></char></note>Auluso, e aso edai hele daabale labisu, abia Maliahe inolo faibe seba disi elolu. Faibe amone wimo, ehe Yesuba wi ufulu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Sigabine mana dawalolu inolo noolohe Yesu babiyo mulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1-2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.1-2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 24:17">Nam 24.17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[1]], Buleba sodo e">Helodo</char> kini labi, fogo amohe, Yesumo disiligi Yudia Bedeleheme dauno ami seba dulu. Aufia labi, dufia sigabine mana dawalolu inolo noolo halo holobagalofealofia inigia, Yelusalame goafia, ilihe eweguba doba bebelesia selesia, “Faibe subobo <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> kini miliyobafemo, e wagi dobu? Ninihe ene sigabimo halo holobagalofealo ami holobagasi baafia, nini efea guluguluyone mulu.”<figure style="fig" alt="Magi travel on camels" file="IB04104.tif" size="col" loc="2.1" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="2.1-12">Sigabine mana dawalolu inolo noolohe Yesu babiyo aafe.</figure> <verse eid="MAT 2:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Ausi, kini Helodo sulu amo dofasia, e wedinale keleba hiliselu. Aufia, Yelusalame idele inolo noolo ilida aubasu keleba hiliselu. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Ausi, Helodohe <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, <char style="w">muguli manane dawalolu inolo</char> nooloda, ili sunia weba gagaiyolu. Ili sunia gagaiyofia labi, ehe ilifea wanesia, “<char style="w">Keliso</char> seba diyobafe, hele amo wagi?” <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Ili obegeba selesia, “Amo Bedeleheme dauno Yudia ami. Maumo, Godene Bugo usu, eweguba saaba seleba ufulu dobu.<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mai 5.2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:42">Yon 7.42</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">‘Bedeleheme, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">
    <char style="qt">Yudia helea ufulu dauno-o!</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">
    <char style="qt">Ga Yudia helea dauno wida labe aleba amone faisale labe. Aubale koleba.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">
    <char style="qt">Mau enebamo, gafea alefasia yasilo uleno holobagaeyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">
    <char style="qt">Ehe Ne <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomu amo yasiba luba miliyobafe.’ ”</char><verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Helodohe sulu selefe amo dofasia, ehe sigabine mana dawalolu inolo muguba wefasia, ilifea nafuluba wanesia, “Fogo halaiyago koleba, sigabi ewe holobagaso?” <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Ili sulu obegefia labi, ehe ili Bedeleheme malasia selesia, “Gili daafia, faibe amo nafuluba isamale. Aufia, gilihe e baafiamo, nafea sulu obegeba saeyo milale. Aufia, nada daafia, efea guluguluyoba.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Kini sulu auba selefe amo dofasia, ili daalu. Ili aasimo, sigabi ili halo holobagalofealo labi abulumo, amodale ili saminiba daaba labeofia, faibeda dobia molo saabia ami, ama kalugaafia alolu. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Ili sigabi amo bisigiamo, ili nokene koleba henelu. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 72:10-15">Sng 72.10-15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:6">Ais 60.6</ref></char></note>Molosu suga daafia, ilihe faibedai, Ene enae <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[1]], Yesune enae">Maliadai</char>, abulu. Aufia, ili emo hugulumo sagafia, hele saabia sauba fufunalofia, faibe amofea gulugululu. Aufia, ine samolo fisigafia, ilihe beleme amoda, kasineda kegele noolo amoda, i mile ibi amoda, ulu kegelegulu efea melu. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Aufia nigiliba, ili udiasia, ilifea haguguba selesia, gili Helodo labea obegeba malabiyoba selesi dubulu. Auba dofasia, ili ine helea obegeba abia, eno nolobalo maiyo daalu.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosebeda, Maliada, aalu faibedai hele Isibi ami fisaba daalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Sigabine dawalolu inolo ilimo daafia labi, <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">Saminilone sulu dia ano</char> e <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[2]], Malia, Yesune enae amone aino e">Yosebe</char> labea, udia holobagafia selesia, “Ga degema! Faibedai, enaedai, luba difasia, hele Isibi ami fisaba maiyo mala. Nahe saabia no sulu gafea selesimo dubiyone yasisia, Isibi ugi melale. Maumo, <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[1]], Buleba sodo e">Helodohe</char> faibe ogo dufa dafiyofia isafe.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Ausi, e degefia, faibeda, enaeda, luba difasia, nigiliba hamagi ehe ili Isibi luba dibia maiyo daalu. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Hos 11.1</ref></char></note>Helodo e olamesi yasisia, Yosebeda ili Isibi waagi alolu. Auba aulumo, sulu ule Saminilohe <char style="w" lemma="Saaba ofolo">saaba ofolone</char> mofeofeafia eweguba solumone wakaliba sugalu. <char style="qt">“Ne Faibemo Isibi labi, Nahe e-mo hele amifia milaba wesi, E mulu.”</char><figure style="fig" alt="Flight to Egypt" file="C058.JPG" size="col" loc="2.14" copy="© 1997 New Tribes Mission/Foreign Mission Board, Southern Baptist Convention." ref="2.13-15">Yosebeda, Maliada, aalu faibedai hele Isibi ami fisaba aafe.</figure><verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kini Helodohe inolo faibe deseine dufa danemalelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Ausi, sigabi mana dawalolu inolo ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[1]], Buleba sodo e">Helodo</char> e gegelububa eloba baafia, ene libomo kanoba dafulu koleba. Aufia, ehe inolo noolo Bedeleheme dauno amida, mosomu noolo aniba amida dedalemalefia, inolo faibe hamu osoloada aso sunialualemo sunia yasoba dafalimalelu. Helodohe faibe hamu osoloada sunialuale iminilu, maumo sigabi hili holobagalumo hamu aida samodolububa selesi dubulu. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Auba molosi, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Yelemaia">Yelemaia</char> samini solu auba wakaliba sugalu. E eweguba solu.<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:15">Jer 31.15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 35:19">Stt 35.19</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">“Lama dauno ami, wedinale kuanoba yegiliba labi, gala dobelefe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">
    <char style="qt">Amo <char style="w">Leisolo</char> ehe, ene faibe subobo danelune yagunagaba yeefe.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">2.18 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Amakelemo, Yekobone eamono </char>
      <char style="fq">Leisolo</char> amo Bedeleheme dauno ami olalu. Aulugulu, Leisolone wi amo, Bedeleheme dauno iminife.</note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">
    <char style="qt">Ene faibe ili sunia saabalene, ili noolohe ene libo nafuluba homesiale habofe.”</char><verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosebeda, Maliada, faibedai obegeba mulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19-20" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[1]], Buleba sodo e">Helodo</char> olafia labi, Isibi ami Saminilone sulu dia ano ulenohe <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[2]], Malia, Yesune enae amone aino e">Yosebe</char> labea udia holobagafia, selesia, “Inolo faibeda dufa olaeyo hamelumo ili olaba yaalu. Aulugulu, ga degefia, faibedai, enaedai, luba difasia, <char style="w">Isolaele</char> obegeba malale.”<verse eid="MAT 2:19-20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Ausi, e degefasia, faibeda, enaeda, luba difasia, Isolaele mosomu helea obegeba daalu. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Abiamo, ehe dobelesia, Akelausumo ene enao Helodone fogo difasia, Yudiane kini labeba solu dubulu. Aulugulu, e amolo maiyomo sagililu. Aufia, udia haguguba saaba mesi, Yosebeda ili Galili disiligifealo daalu. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:1">Ais 11.1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 53:2">53.2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:39">Lug 2.39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:45">Yon 1.45</ref></char></note>Ili ami daafia, dauno Nasaledeba soiya ami asulumo, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> noolo sulu eweguba solumone wakaliba sugasia aulu. <char style="qt">“Ilihe E Nasaledeneba wi saeyobafe.”</char><verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Hano gelo Yonehe sulu mana waleba alolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:2-8">Maga 1.2-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Lugu 3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yone 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Hamu wedinale daafasia labimo, <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Hano Gelo Yone</char> milifasia, ehe isale hele falaiya Yudia disiligi ami, idele inolofea sulu mana waleyone siba alolu. <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:17">Mad 4.17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:15">Mag 1.15</ref></char></note>E selesia, “Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo mulu hagoale labegulu, gili nolofia, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besima</char>.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Ais 40.3</ref></char></note> Inolo, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Aisaia">Aisaiahe</char> sulu saaba ofa solu amo, Yone amo e. Aisaiahe e iminisia, eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 3:3" />
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">
    <char style="qt">“Isale hele falaiya ami, inolo uleno mofeyo eweguba wuaaba selaba miliyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">
    <char style="qt">‘<char style="w">Saminilo</char> E milesine eno isoba felaba madenema!’ ”</char><verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 1:8">2Kin 1.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yonehe dofene <char style="w" lemma="Kamele">kamelene</char> alumo fagulogulu moloba kaafia, madibuda amone bado ofolo. Ene naiyomo, galiawadai, age hanodai, amosu naba ado. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Yone isale helea ami, sulu mana waleba labi, Yelusalamefiada, Yudia heleafiada, hano Yodenefealo fogoba asuliyafiada, idele inolo sunia ili Yone e labea milibaifia, gagaiyolu. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Ine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> fogaba selesi, Yonehe ili hano Yodene ami <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geba</char> waalelu.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mad 12.34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23.33</ref></char>
    </note>Auba ligia, <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo nooloda, <char style="w">Sadiyusi</char> inolo nooloda, ili e <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geba</char> waaleba labea saabi baafia, ehe ilifea selesia, “Soiye wolu aiyanene edo, gili labe! Kanolo gilifea miyobafemo elaba daafia malabamo, inolo ulenohe gilifea haguguba selesi, gili na labea milibaisela?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Falisi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">inolo ilimo mosomu ule labe. Ibi mosomuale. Ili Godene muguli mana kuliba maiyone ine mana dobu amosu kuliba ano. Auba kuliba abiamo, ili hilisesia, nini Godene si saabia olaibo ligia, isolububa hiliselo. Ilihe Yesudai hegelu sulu wedinale solu. </char><char style="fq">Sadiyusi</char> inolo ili mosomu amogulu labe. </note> <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Gili seale <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besiluba</char> walesiamo, gine mana alefasia, asigi besilu loluba, sebe walemale. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Yon 8.33</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 8:39">39</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:12">Lom 4.12</ref></char></note>Aga gili gine meleba eweguba selefe, ‘<char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamamo</char> nine nauwa labene, nini kanolo elaba daafia maiyobasu.’ Auluso, auba hilisemabiyo. Na gilifea selesu, Godehe abane waalebu ewefeafia, Abalahamane enauwa hagaea waagi moloba ufiyodolu labe. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Mad 7.19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:6-9">Lug 13.6-9</ref></char></note>I kuliyone kabimo, ama i mau madeneba diba waalelu dobu. Aufia, sebe nafuluda helelebuale i amo sunia, ilihe kolofasia, de saidafaliba ilogoyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:26-27">Yon 1.26-27</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:5">HD 1.5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:1-13">2.1-13</ref></char>
    </note>Nahe gili asigi besiluba hano balu geba walesu. Auluso, dufia inolo uleno na faisa miyobafemo, ene kiwigagalumohe, ne kiwigagalumo wasolu. Na Edai lilibuale. Na-mo, Ene dabalu moloba ofolo miliyone imini ololuale. Aulugulu, na wida male koleba ligia, Ene samaga huiyone lilibuale. Inolo amo Ehe, gili <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemodai</char>, dedai, geba waaleyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />E inigiamo, ene sonehe fogeda selu miyobafemo, faso sunia <char style="w" lemma="Widi">widifea</char> dobumone, diba dafaliyone miyobafe. Aufia, Ehe Ene widi sebemo gagaiyofasia, Ene widi molo usu diba waaleyobafe. Auluso, waa afolumo, Ehe de usulalemo soba dagiyobafe.” Hano Gelo Yone auba solu.<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yonehe Yesu hano geba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maga 1.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Lugu 3.21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Fogo amoyamo, Yesu E-mo Galili afasia, Yodene saiya goafia, <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yonehe</char> E <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geba</char> homesisia mulu. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Yone e auba auyalefia selesia, “Ga koleba, na hano geba ufiyo dobu. Halagubane ne sone ga geba homesi, Ga na labea mulu?”<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Auluso, Yesuhe efea obegeba selesia, “Hama, aga ga koleba Na selefeguba moloma. Auba molosihe, ani mana isolu amone liliyobafe.” Ausi, Yonehe e selefeguba mololu.<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:32">Yon 1.32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu E hano gefasia, holobagaba lagosi, bosolufalumo, alebale <char style="w">hebene</char> sogoba ofelesi, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane</char> haga maliabugulu huga inigia, E saabia yoba aselesi abulu. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sng 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Ais 42.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">Mad 12.18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:5">17.5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Lug 9.35</ref></char></note>Hebenefia sulu goo uleno eweguba sabaisi dubulu. “Ewe ne Naalo, E-mo, Ne yaguso koleba! Na Efea bule koleba henesu.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Henanehe Yesu dedeba abulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maga 1.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Lugu 4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 2:18">Hib 2.18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:15">4.15</ref></char>
    </note>Fogo amo <char style="w" lemma="Henane">henanehe</char> Yesu dedeba bamesine, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubanehe</char> E isale hele falaiya ami lubia daalu. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:28">Kis 34.28</ref></char></note>Aufia, Yesu E hilia daabuluba biniba, nigili daabuluba biniba naiyo nabale alolu. Aufia, dufia E mamialu.<verse eid="MAT 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Ausi, Dedeba Bolo E labea holobagafia, Efea selesia, “Ga seale koleba Godene Faibenaga, amo Gahe abane waalebu ewefea, <char style="w">boledi</char> mesenemaba saama.” <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Lo 8.3</ref></char></note>Auluso, Yesuhe efea obegeba selesia, “Godene bugohe eweguba selelu dobu. ‘<char style="qt">Idele inolo ili naiyofeasu alefasia miliyolu dilale. Aubale. Godene sulu sunia kuliba aafemo alefasia, ili miliyolu dilo.</char>’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5-6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.5-6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Sng 91.11-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>E auba selesi, henanehe E lubia abia, sidi <char style="w" lemma="Muuba kalilu">noekenemo</char> Yelusalame ami goafia, <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> dogo saabia ana lagi yoba melafia, selesia, “Ga seale koleba Godene Faibenaga, amo Ga Gene meleba iligi suba mela. Maumo, Godene bugo eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 4:5-6" />
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:5-6">
    <char style="qt">‘Godehe Ene sulu dia anofea selesia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:5-6">
    <char style="qt">ilihe ga luba ligia, nafuluba yasimesi saeyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:5-6">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, ge emo abanefea dowelosi,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:5-6">
    <char style="qt">ine sonehe ga feoba seba lagoyobafe.’</char>”<verse eid="MAT 4:5-6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:16">Lo 6.16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, Yesuhe efea obegeba selesia, “Sulu noda eweguba selelu dobu. <char style="qt">‘Gahe ge <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Godene kiwigagalu dedeba bamabiyo.’</char> ” <verse eid="MAT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Auba selesi, henanehe Yesu saabia luba dibia abia, hele galea felafia, alebale hamagi, helefealu sunia yasiba adaaba yaabumoda, helefealu amone beleme suniada, ehe Yesufea waleba yaalu. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Auba waleba ligia, e Yesufea selesia, “Ga nafea emo hugulumo sagafia, nafea gulugulusenaga, amo nahe hele ewe sunia ga yasimesi meyo.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:13">Lo 6.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba selesi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “<char style="w">Sedene</char>, ga afa mala! Enebamo, Godene bugohe sulu eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 4:10" />
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:10">
    <char style="qt">‘Ga ge Saminilo Gode E sisa ligia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:10">
    <char style="qt">Efeasu guluguluba melale.’</char>”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Auba selesi, henane E gadefia aasi, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> ili milibaifasia, Yesu E uluba miliyone milibailu.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E dabalu Galili ami maugaba mololu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maga 1.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Lugu 4.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mad 14.3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mag 6.17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Lug 3.19-20</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yone</char> dibolo dafogoluba solu dofasia, E Galili disiligi ami obegeba elaba daalu. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Aufia, Nasalede dauno afasia abia, Kafanima dauno ami misiyo daalu. Kafanimamo, Galili waiyo galubu aniba ami, Sebulunodai, Nafadalidai, aine mosomune helea ami dobu. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Auba aulumo, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Aisaia">Aisaiahe</char> saaba ufuluguba wakalilu.<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:1-2">Ais 9.1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">“Eee, Sebuluno hele-eee, Nafadali hele-eee.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">
    <char style="qt">Eee, eno hano Yodene abia waiyo galubufealomo dobu-eee.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">
    <char style="qt">Eee, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau mosomune</char> Galili-eee.</char><verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />
    <char style="qt">Gine mosomu ili amo nigiligagalu bule aleba kakainalumo, ili amo yane bule abulu-eee.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">
    <char style="qt">Idele inolo olalone asubane sisa kakainalu ili amofea yane nee bule ili labea hiliaba dowelu-eee.</char>”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:2">Mad 3.2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:27">19.27</ref></char>
    </note>Fogo amifia, Yesuhe sulu mana waleyo maugalu. E selesia, “Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo mulu hagoale labegulu, gili nolofia, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besima</char>.”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe inolo binibamo wesi, ili E kuliba daalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maga 1.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Lugu 5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Hilia uleno, Yesu E Galili waiyo galubu amone egewi daaba ligia, elewo aida abulu. Nomo, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidaba</char> sodo amo e. Nomo, ene elewo <char style="w" lemma="Adulu">Adulu</char>. Aalu waiyo ami hani sigiba molabasu adone, hani selege dafogoba alolu. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Yesuhe aalufea selesia, “Na kuliba mila! Aalihe hani sigiloguba, idele inoloda sigiba molamesine, Nahe aali moloba waleyoba.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Auba selesi, aalu alebale aine alu selege gadefia, E kuliba maiyo daalu.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Wedino egewi amo aleba asogofia, Yesu E elewo aida no, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]], Sebedine faibe">Yemesedai</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yonedai</char>, abulu. Aalu enao Sebedidai hano kasu saabia yoba sigia, alu selege asogoba alolu. Auba labi, Yesuhe aalu welu. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Alebale hamagi, aaluhe hano kasuda, aine enaoda, afasia, E kuliba maiyo daalu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe sulu mana walesia, idele inolo wedinale waiba waalelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Lugu 6.17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:35">Mad 9.35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:39">Mag 1.39</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:38">HD 10.38</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, E hele Galili ami siba ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">Yudane gulugululo moloa</char> sunia sulu mana waleba alolu. Ehe Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamone awalu sulu nafulu walelu. Aufia, Ehe idele inolo waiba waalesiamo, ine domala walefa nokene nokeneba ufulumoda waiba waalelu. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:55">Mag 6.55</ref></char></note>Ene sadalumo hele bule Siliamo sunia doba sigisi, idele inolohe inolo walefa nokene nokeneba dulumo, E labea ulubia milibailu. Noolo naga kiwi aleba dulumoda, noolo <char style="w" lemma="Gamodo">gamododa</char> alolumoda, aufia noolo walefa bibilifasia gelebaisalomoda, noolo ine kiwi olaba yaalumoda, Yesuhe ili amo sunia waiba waaleba yaalu. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 3:7-8">Mag 3.7-8</ref></char></note>Ausi, idele inolo wamili Galilifiada, disiligi Dekabolisifiada, aufia Yelusalamefiada, Yudiafiada, hano Yodene nolobalo anogolofiada, ilihe E kuliba dedaleba ado.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="ms">Yesuhe galea ami yoba sigia, Godene sulu mana walelu</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:1-7:29">5.1–7.29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Yesuhe idele inolo wamili E kuliba milibaife baafia, E hele galea felafia yoba asulu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.1</char> Yuda ine manamo dawalolu inolohe idele inolo waleba ligiamo, ili yoba asefasia walelo. (Madiyu 13.2, 24.3; Lugu 4.20 amoda bamale.)</note> <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Ene walelu faibili E labea milibaisi, Ehe ilifea mana waleyone maugalu. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus is teaching" file="IB04112.tif" size="col" loc="5.2" copy="Biblica (Faadil)" ref="5.1–7.29">Yesuhe Godene sulu mana walefe.</figure><verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe selesia, idele inolo ewegulu alebaibu, ili heneyodolu labeba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Lugu 6.20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 57:15">Ais 57.15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Idele inolo asubanefealomo weagulu alebaibu ili amo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Asubanefealomo weagulu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe amo, eweguba selefe. Ga gene meleba bisigia, hilisesia, ne asubane weagulu labe, aulugulu nene namo lililuale lolu. Na Gode diyodolu lolu. Ga auba hilisesenaga, Yesuhe gafea henemaleba selefe.</char></note> ine henelo wasigafia labe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 5:3">Maumo, Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amo, ine dobu.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:2-3">Ais 61.2-3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:17">MUU 7.17</ref></char>
    </note>Idele inolo yegiliba labe ili amo, ine henelo wasigafia labe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 5:4">Maumo, Godehe ine libo aeaba ufiyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:11">Sng 37.11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Idele inolo ine libo onafia labe ili amo, ine henelo wasigafia labe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 5:5">Maumo, Godehe helefealu sunia ilifea daalo meyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:1-2">Ais 55.1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Idele inolo mana isolu holobagamesi alebaiyeba mamiafe ili amo, ine henelo wasigafia labe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 5:6">Maumo, Godehe ili amo kubaleba ufiyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Idele inolo noolofea <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanuluba</char> ado ili amo, ine henelo wasigafia labe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 5:7">Maumo, Godehe ili amofea kanuluyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Idele inolo ine libo galagololu labe ili amo, ine henelo wasigafia labe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 5:8">Maumo, ili amo Gode babiyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Idele inolo aeaba ofolo ili amo, ine henelo wasigafia labe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 5:9">Maumo, Godehe ilifea gili Ne faibiliba saeyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 3:14">1Fid 3.14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Idele inolo isolu mana kuliba aafe amone higinilu diaba yaafe ili amo, ine henelo wasigafia labe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 5:10">Maumo, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amo, ine dobu.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 4:14">1Fid 4.14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, noolo ilihe, gili Ne mosomu labebuba bisigia, gilifea sowaneba selesia, gilifea wolu molosia, aufia gilifea sulu nokene nokeneba oloba koweba masega selesenaga, gine henelo wasigafia labe. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2Sto 36.16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">HD 7.52</ref></char></note>Auba ausenaga, gili nokene koleba henemale. Maumo, gine elebe bulemo <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi dobu. Inolo ilihe <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> samini adaaba yaalu ili amofeada, mana wolu aubasu mololu.”<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gilimo saludai yanedai amogulu labe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maga 9.50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Lugu 14.34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Gilimo helefealune salu labe. Auluso, salu ene nenalebalu asigilesenaga, salu amo haiba nenalebalu melesi, nini kegele uleno moloyodoluale koleba. Salu nenalebaluale ogone dabalumo malegulu, inolohe saidafelesia, ine emo dolalo.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Yon 8.12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">9.5</ref></char>
    </note>Gili helefealune yane labe. Hilisema, dauno uleno hele galea labe amo, e muguba adale. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mag 4.21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Lug 8.16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">11.33</ref></char></note>Aubasu, inolohe naafa uleno yaafasia, fofo sisa ofolale. Aubale. Ilihe naafa ailalu saabia ana ofelesi, amone yanemohe idele inolo molosu saabe amo sunia neeba dowelo. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:8-9">Efe 5.8-9</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:12">1Fid 2.12</ref></char></note>Aubasu, gine yane ogo idele inolone si saabia neeba dowemale. Ilihe gine mana nafulu ogo bafasia, gine Gao <char style="w">hebene</char> labe lagone wi digiyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Godene sulu mugulimone sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 3:31">Lom 3.31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesuhe sulu saabia selesia, “Na mulumo, sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> seleluda, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> sulu selelu amoda, diba dafaliyone muluba hilisemabiyo. Aubale. Na amone diba dafiyone mulualeso, na amone liliba ufiyone mulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:17">Lug 16.17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:33">21.33</ref></char></note>Na seale koleba gilifea selesu. Anakiwida, helefealuda, aso samodobale labi, sulu selelu haisi ulenoda, imini wedidenoda, daba dafiyobafale. Aubale. Amo ufiasu labi, muguli sulu sunia liliba samodoyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 2:10">Yem 2.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, inolo ulenohe sulu muguli wedideno ulenomo gelesia, noolofeada auba molomesi walesenaga, amo Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami, inolo amone wimo wedinoyobafe. Auluso, inolo sulu muguli kuliba abia, noolofeada auba kulimesi walesenaga, amo Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amimo, ene wi bule miliyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Na seale gilifea selesu, gine isolu mana ogohe, <char style="w">Falisi</char> inoloda, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu inoloda</char>, ine isolu mana amo suniasalenaga, amo Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami, gili sugaeyobafale.”<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe sulu isoyo mana amone solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Lugu 12.57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:13">Kis 20.13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Lo 5.17</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Sulu gine gauwadalifea samini eweguba solumo, gili dubulu. Sulu amo ewe. <char style="qt">‘Gilihe inolo dufa olamabiyo. Aulugulu, inolo ulenohe inolo no dufa olasenaga, amo e godoyobafe.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:15">1Yon 3.15</ref></char></note>Auluso, na gilifea eweguba selesu, inolo ulenohe ene elewofea gadisenaga, amo e godoyobafe. Aufia, inolohe ene elewofea, ‘Ga muli maleba’ selesenaga, amo galisolohe e godoyobafe. Aufia, inolo nohe no anogofea lasiaba selesia, ‘Ga kagoaluba’ selesenaga, amo e <char style="w">heli</char> helene de amo sugaeyone labe.<verse eid="MAT 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23-24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.23-24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 11:25">Mag 11.25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, gahe <char style="w" lemma="Soba meyone defene olabolu">soba meyone defene olaboiya</char> ami ulu kegele dia inigia, gelewo nohe gafea sulu gadilu solu dobuba asigisenaga, amo gahe ulu soba meyone kegele amo, defene olabolu aniba ami waagi diba homale. Aufia, ga abia, ge gelewodai haiba hilise ule miliyone, sulu amone isoyodale malale. Gahe sulu amo isoba samodofia, aga amisumo, ge ulu soba meyo ogo Godefea memale.<verse eid="MAT 5:23-24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />Aufia, inolo ulenohe gadai godoyo weiyaasenaga, aali godola ami aso goayo ligia, eno aiba daaba ligia, alebale hamagi, sulu edai isoba bamale. Inolo amohe ga osolalone sone saabia ofolosi, osolalo inolo amo alefasia ga haiba ibolo selune sone saabia ofolosi, aufia ibolo selu inolo amohe ga haiba dibolo molo dafogolosi. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Na seale koleba gafea selesu, gahe ge dano haisidenoda aso duguba samodobale labi, ilihe ga dibolo dafogobugo sububa dafogoyobafale.”<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe susugu mana amone solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:14">Kis 20.14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Lo 5.18</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe selesia, “Sulu gili samini dubulumo, ewe. <char style="qt">‘Gilihe susugu mana molomabiyo.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Auluso, na seale koleba gilifea selesu, ido uleno baafia, wobasubale koleba mesegefe inolo amo, ehe ene asigi usumo ama susugu mololu dobu. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:9">Mad 18.9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:47">Mag 9.47</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, ge si inaloalo ogohe, ga wolu molomesi sigiba dibia aasenaga, amo gahe si ogo dugufasia saidamale. Ge domala ogone haisi ulenomo daba dafelesenaga, amo wolu. Auluso, ilihe ge domala ogo sunia <char style="w">heli</char> usu ami dafogosenaga, amo wolune wolu koleba. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:8">Mad 18.8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:43">Mag 9.43</ref></char></note>Aufia, ge sone inaloalo ogohe, ga wolu molomesi sigiba dibia aasenaga, amo ga koleba, sone ogo gelefasia saidamale. Ge domala ogone haisi ulenomo daba dafelesenaga, amo wolu. Auluso, ge domala ogo sunia heli helea ami aasenaga, amo wolune wolu koleba.”<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe inolo ido dulu duguiyomone mana solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Madiyu 19.9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maga 10.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Lugu 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Lo 24.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:4">Mag 10.4</ref></char>
    </note>Yesu selesia, “Saminimo, sulu muguli eweguba seleba ufulu. <char style="qt">‘Eamono dugulefe inolo amo, ehe ido duguiyone eesiamo, efea beba uleno geleba meyo dobu.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1Kld 7.10-11</ref></char></note>Auluso, Na gilifea selesu, eamono susugu molofale hamaga, balu duguba dafelefe inolo amo, ehe ene eamono inolo no daafia susugu molomesi gadefafe. Aufia, inolohe, inolo none ido duguba dafulu disenaga, amo eda susugu molofe.”<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gilihe aiimabiyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.33-37 </char>Yuda ili <char style="fq" closed="false">aiisiamo</char><char style="ft" closed="false">, kegele ulenone wi selesia, ine sulu saaba ofolo amone kiwigaaba ofelesia aiilo. Auluso, Yesu selesia, gili sulu saaba ofelesiamo, aiimabiyo. Ga moloyoba saaba ufulu amosu kuliba abia, auba molomale.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:21">Lo 23.21</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:12">Wkp 19.12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 30:2">Nam 30.2</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe selesia, “Sulu noolo gine gauwadalifea samini eweguba solumo, gili dubulu. <char style="qt">‘Sulu gahe <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilofea</char> <char style="w" lemma="Aiiba sodo">aiiba</char> solumo, gelesiale kuliba malale.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Ais 66.1</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:12">Yem 5.12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:22">Mad 23.22</ref></char></note>Auluso, Na gilifea selesu, gilihe gine sulu kiwigaaba ufiyosia, <char style="w" lemma="Aiiba sodo">aiimabiyo</char> koleba. <char style="w">Hebene</char> wi saaba aiimabiyo. Maumo, hebenemo, Godene asefalu ailalu yogolelu labe. <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Ais 66.1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 48:2">Sng 48.2</ref></char></note>Aufia, helefealu wi saaba aiimabiyo. Maumo, helefealumo, Gode Ene emo isoba ofolomo dobu. Aufia, Yelusalame wi saaba aiimabiyo. Maumo, Yelusalame amomo, Kini Bulene sidi labe. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Aufia, ge guni ogoba selesiada aiimabiyo. Maumo, gahe ge guni kaau ogo, hoolu me yabulu holobagamesi moloyodoluale labe. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Aulugulu, gili auba moloyoba selesenaga, amo auba molomale. Aufia, gili auba moloyaleba selesenaga, amo auba molomabiyo. Sulu noolo ge sulu kiwigaaba homesine bobaba selefe amomo, <char style="w">henane</char> efea alefasia sodo.”<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gilihe, noolo wolu gilifea molosi, sabe obegemabiyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Lugu 6.29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 21:24">Kis 21.24</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:20">Wkp 24.20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:21">Lo 19.21</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe selesia, “Sulu samini eweguba solumo, gili dubulu. <char style="qt">‘Si, si aine sabesia, bese, bese aine sabemale.’</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">5.38</char> Sulu amone mau ewe: sabe moloba obegesiamo, mololu imini waseba suniamabiyo.</note> Muguli sulu auba selelu dobu. <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Auluso, Na gilifea eweguba selesu, inolo nohe gafea wolu molofe amofea, wolu moloba obegeba sabemabiyo. Aubale. Inolo ulenohe ge bolobolo inaloalo dowesenaga, amo ga efea bolobolo nolobalomoda walemale. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Aufia, inolo ulenohe ga godoyosia, ge saligalo diyo hamesenaga, amo gahe ge saligalo selale amoda efea memale. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Aufia, inolo ulenohe gafea egedidisia, ene kegelemo agifia abia, hele fogo ule malalesenaga, amo gahe ene kegele amo agifia abia, hele fogo aida malale. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Aulugulu, inolo ulenohe kegele uleno memaba gafea haalisenaga, amo efea memale. Aufia, inolo ulenohe kegele uleno odoba gafea haalisenaga, amo gahe efea faiso memabiyo.”<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe gisa hameseyone mana amone solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Lugu 6.27-28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.43 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Wkp 19.18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu selesia, “Sulu samini eweguba solumo, gili dubulu. <char style="qt">‘Ge damenemo hamesesia</char>, ge gisamo haboba bamale.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:4-5">Kis 23.4-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:34">Lug 23.34</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:60">HD 7.60</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:14">Lom 12.14</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 12:20">20</ref></char></note>Auluso, Na gilifea eweguba selesu, gilihe gine gisamo hamesemale. Aufia, inolo gilida woba ofelefe ili amone hilisesia, gilihe Godedai sulu saaba homale. <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />Ausihe, gili gine Gao <char style="w">hebene</char> labe amone faibili miliyobafe. Ehe halomo, inolo nafulufeada, wolufeada, hamaguba neeba dowemesi gadefalo. Aufia, Ehe hele hugamaleba sodomo, inolo <char style="w">isolu galagololu</char> mana mololo ili kakainabia amida, inolo mana isoluale mololo ili kakainabia amida, hamaguba hugamaleba sodo.<verse eid="MAT 5:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Aulugulu, gahe idele inolo gafea hamesefe ili amosu sabe hamesesenaga, ge mana auba molofe amohe, gafea hebene lagi elebe meyobafela? Meyobafale. Wolu mololo inolo ili amoda mana aubasu mololo. <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Aufia, gilihe gine damenedali amosu sone wakalisenaga, amo gine mana nafulumo, inolo none mana waseba suniaeyobafela? Suniaeyobafale, maumo, idele inolo Godeda asigibuale ili amo, aubasu mololo. <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:2">Wkp 19.2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:13">Lo 18.13</ref></char></note>Gine Gao <char style="w">hebene</char> labe amo, nafulu isoba helegeba moloba ado. Aulugulu, gilida aubasu nafulu isoba helegeba moloba melale.”<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe weagulu inolofea sagoba ufiyone mana amone solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 23:5">Mad 23.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Gili nafuluba. Mana nafulu molosiamo, gilihe idele inolo gili bamesisia, mana amo ine si saabia molomabiyo. Aubale. Auba molosenaga, amo gili gine Gao <char style="w">hebene</char> labe amohe elebe dobumo diyobafale.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Aulugulu, ga weagulu inolofea mesiamo, masega gegelo inolo molologuba molomabiyo. Ili amo kegele mesiamo, gala bule dafa, idele inolo bamesifia, <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo moloada</char>, eno anibada, meba ado. Na seale koleba gilifea selesu, ine elebe amo diba samodolu dobu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">6.2</char> Idele inolo noolo ine mana bisigia, mana nafulububa hilisesia, ine wi digisenaga, amo ine elebe amo wi digilu ogo hamaga.</note> <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Auluso, ga weagulu inolofea mesiamo, sone inaloalo kegele molofe amo, sone fofonaloalohe bamabamaba sodosi, muguba molomale. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Ausihe, ge kanululo dabalu mololu ogo muguba mololu dobu. Ausimo, ge Gao muguba mololuda bolo amo, Ehe gafea elebe meyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Godedai sulu saeyo mana amone walelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Lugu 11.2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 23:5">Mad 23.5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:10-14">Lug 18.10-14</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Gili Godedai sulu selesiamo, gili masega gegelo inolohe molologuba, molomabiyo. Ili amo, idele inolohe ili bamesifia, <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo moloada</char>, eno bule dobiada, ami degefia, Godedai sulu saeyo hamelo. Na seale koleba gilifea selesu, ine elebe amo diba samodolu dobu. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Auluso, gahe Godedai sulu selesiamo, ga gene molo lalolumo suga daafia, eno kaafia, ge Gao muguba labe amodai sulu saamale. Ausihe, ge Gao muguba mololuda bolo amo, Ehe gafea elebe meyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:26-29">1Kin 18.26-29</ref></char></note>Aufia, gilihe Godedai sulu selesiamo, gili, yau inolo sodoguba, sulu balu saabia saabiaba samabiyo. Enebamo, yau inolo ili hilisesia, ili sulu wedinale selesalenaga, Godehe ili selefemo dubiyobafaleba hiliselo. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:32">Mad 6.32</ref></char></note>Gilihe ine manamo kuliba malabiyo. Gilihe aso memaba haalibale labi, gine Gaohe kegele ga abobolu dobumo, E hilisebu. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Gilihe Godedai sulu eweguba saamale.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 6:9" />
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Nine Nao, <char style="w">hebene</char> labe Ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">Ge wimo <char style="w">Noekene</char> melesi,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:39">Mad 26.39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:42">Lug 22.42</ref></char>
    </note>Ga Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo helefealu sunia ulufa holobagamesi hamesu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">Ga labea hebene ugi, ili Ge hame kuliba aafeguba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">ninida aubasu, helefealu iwi ligiamo, Ge hame kuliba dabaiyeba hamesu.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Aufia, Gahe hilia aga ewene liliba naiyo ninifea memale.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 6:14-15">Mad 6.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:21-35">18.21-35</ref></char>
    </note>Noolo ninifea heleba mololumo, ninihe <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galisuguba</char>,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">Gada nini heleba mololumo aubasu hamasia heesia galimale.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:40">Lug 22.40</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:13">Yem 1.13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 17:15">Yon 17.15</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 3:3">2Des 3.3</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:18">2Dim 4.18</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, nini wolu moloyalene dedeba babiyo ninifea waagi holobagamabu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Henane">henanene</char> sone sebu amifia nini sububa dafelagomale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">Enebamo, Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">kiwigagalu suniada,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">elaleluda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">Gafeasu alefalu dobu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">
    <char style="sls">Amen</char>. Amo seale koleba.’<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 11:25-26">Mag 11.25-26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Doma. Gilihe idele inolo noolo gilifea heleba mololumo hamasia heesia galisenaga, amo gine Gao <char style="w">hebene</char> labe lago, Ehe gili heleba mololu amo hamasia heesia galiyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Auluso, gilihe idele inolo noolo anogone heleba daalumone hamasia heesia galisalenaga, gine Gao Eda gine heleba daalu amo hamasia heesia galiyobafale.”<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe naiyo aiyalo mana amone solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 58:5-9">Ais 58.5-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Gilihe <char style="w" lemma="Naiyo aiyalo">naiyo aiyasiamo</char>, masega gegelo inolo molologuba, olegi ogilu walemabiyo. Ilihe idele inolofea naiyo aiyasuba waleyosia, ine olegi nigiligagalu bamesi mololo. Na seale koleba gilifea selesu, ine elebe amo diba samodolu dobu. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17-18" />Auluso, ga naiyo aiyasiamo, inolo nohe ga naiyo aiyafebuba bamesialene, gahe walea hano ge guni alu heefasia, ge olegi nuguma heemale. Ausihe, ge Gao muguba labe amo, E elebisu ga aiyafeba asigiyobafe. Aufia, ge Gao muguba mololoda bolo amo, Ehe gafea elebe meyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 6:17-18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kegele nafulu samolo seyone mana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Lugu 12.33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 5:1-3">Yem 5.1-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Helefealu iwi, ginalogalida, soloda amohe kegele woba ofolo. Aufia, helefealu iwi, fadilo inolohe yala olaboba sugafia, kegele fa dilo. Aulugulu, gilihe helefealu iwi, gine kegele nafulumo samolo gagaiyoba diba homabiyo. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:21">Mad 19.21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:22">Lug 18.22</ref></char></note>Auluso, <char style="w">hebene</char> lagimo, ginalogalida, soloda, kegele woba ofolale. Aufia, fadilo inoloda yala olaboba sugafia, hebene lagi kegele fa dilale. Aulugulu, gilihe hebene lagi, gine kegele nafulumo samolo gagaiyoba homale. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Enebamo, hele ge kegele nafulu samoloda dobia amimo, ge asigida amisu miliyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simo, domalane naafa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Lugu 11.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Ge si ogo, domalane naafagulu labe. Aulugulu, gine si ogo nafulunaga, amo gine domala ogo suniamo yane wasigafia labe. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Auluso, ge si ogo wolunaga, amo ge domala ogo sunia nigiligagalu wasigafia labe. Aulugulu, yane gafea labe ogo, nigiligagasenaga, nigiligagalu amo bule halagubabi?”<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolohe yasilo aidane dabalu moloyodoluale dobu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Lugu 16.13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Inolohe yasilo aidane dabalu moloyodoluale dobu. Ausiabiaga, ehe nomo hamesesia, nomo haboba babaiyo. Aufia, ehe no sulu selefemo dobelesia, nomo faiso mebaiyo. Amogubasu, gili Gode sisada, Mole sisada, aalifaba dabalu moloyodoluale dobu.”<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asigi wedinale ofasia, keleba hiliselomone mana amone solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Lugu 12.22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 4:6">Fil 4.6</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:6-8">1Dim 6.6-8</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 5:7">1Fid 5.7</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Aulugulu, Na gilifea selesu, gilihe gine miliyolu ogone eweguba keleba hilisemabiyo. ‘Nini naiyo ene naiyobi?’ Aufia, gili gine domala ogone keleba eweguba hilisemabiyo. ‘Na fagulo ene kaeyobiba’ hilisemabiyo. Ewe asigima. Miliyoluhe naiyo suniabu. Domalahe fagulo kegele suniabu. <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:29-31">Mad 10.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:6-7">Lug 12.6-7</ref></char></note>Gilihe haga anakiwi sibaisafe ogo baafia asigimale. Ilihe edo gelale. Aufia, naiyo amo molafia, naiyoda ofolo moloa ami ofolale. Aubale. Gine Gao <char style="w">hebene</char> labe amo Ehe, haga amofea naiyo meba yaalo. Gili koleba haga wasolu dobu. Aulugulu, Ehe gilifea naiyo bule koleba meyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Ausi, keleba hilisefe mana amofea alefasia, inolo ulenohe ene miliyolu amofea aso halosi fogo uledeno gegoaba ufiyobafela? Inolo uleno auba mololale koleba.<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />Mau enene, gilihe fagulone keleba hilisefe? Gilihe maamo helelebu ogo, eneba holobagafebiba nafuluba fadaba baafia asigimale. Ilihe dabalu hogolosia, ine fagulo asilale. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1Kin 10.4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2Sto 9.3-6</ref></char></note>Saminimo, kini <char style="w" lemma="Solomono">Solomonohe</char> ene momada sunia yogolelusu kaalobiyo. Auluso, maamo ine momadalu amohe, Solomonone momadalu amo sunia wasolu koleba. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Asigi ule ufuluda wedino dobu, gili, eweguba hilisema. Maamo aga helelebu ogo, aide waagisu, inolo gelefasia, de dafogolo. Godehe maamo amofea fagulo yogolelu amogulu kaaba ofolonaga, amo Ehe gilifea fagulo waseba kaaba ufiyobafe koleba.<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Aulugulu, gili eweguba keleba hilisemabiyo. ‘Naiyo ene naiyobi?’ ‘Hano ene naiyobi?’ ‘Fagulo ene kaeyobi?’ Auba ge asigi ogo keleba hilisemabiyo. <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:8">Mad 6.8</ref></char></note>Enebamo, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> ilihe, auba koleba keleba hilisefia, kegele amo sunia dibaiyeba isaba yaalo. Auluso, gilihe kegele amo diyoluba hilisefe ogomo, gine Gao hebene labe amo, Ehe asigiba samodobu. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:11-14">1Kin 3.11-14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 37:4">Sng 37.4</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 37:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 14:17">Lom 14.17</ref></char></note>Auluso, kegele olaibodale isaeyo dobumo ewe. Godehe ge miliyolu ogo sunia uluba ligia, ge yasilo waagi melesiba isamale. Aufia, Ene isolu mana moloyone isamale. Ausi, Ehe kegele noolo suniada gafea gegoaba meyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Aulugulu, gilihe hilia aidenemo keleba hilisemabiyo. Hilia aidemo ene keleba hiliseyobafe. Hilia ule amone higinilumo, amo hilia amonesu dobu.”<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Gilihe no anogone mana osolamabiyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Lugu 6.37-38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">6.41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 2:1">Lom 2.1</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 4:5">1Kld 4.5</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 4:11-12">Yem 4.11-12</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Godehe gine mana osolalosine, gilida no anogone mana osolamabiyo. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:24">Mag 4.24</ref></char></note>Enebamo, gili no anogo osolafe amogubasu, Gode Eda gili aubasu osolaeyobafe. Aufia, gilihe no anogofea iminiba mefe amogubasu, Godehe gilifeada aubasu iminifia, sabe meba obegeyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Ge sifea i fudulu bule dobu ogo keleba asigibale ligia, waagi gadefafia ligia, gahe damene no anogone sia ami, i geele dobu amone keleba asigife ogo, enesi ause? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Gene si anigi i fudulu ufia ligia, gahe ge damenefea selesia, ‘Damene, ga sifea i geele dobu ogo, diba dafelesuba’ selefe ogo, enebane ause? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Masega sodo inolo, ga. Maugabamo, gahe i fudulu ge sia dobu ogodale diba dafiyo dobu. Auba diba dafasia, ga fadaba bisigia, i geele ge damenene sia dobumo, ami diba dafiyodolu dobu.”<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />Aufia, Yesu selesia, “Godefea iminilu kegele waalebu amifia, kegele uleno difasia, geso amofea memabiyo. Ili besiba nolosia, ga muba gaalosi. Aufia, gili gine helebe naiya yogolelumo, dofenefea saidafagomabiyo. Ine emohe emelaba egelosi.”<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolo Godedai sulu selefe ili amofeamo Godehe kegele nafulu meyobafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Lugu 11.9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 11:24">Mag 11.24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 14:13">Yon 14.13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:7">15.7</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 16:23-24">16.23-24</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Haalisi, gafea meyobafe. Isasi, ga babiyobafe. Godogodosi, eno gafea sogoba ufiyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:22">1Yon 3.22</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 5:14-15">5.14-15</ref></char></note>Maumo, haalife ili amo dilo. Aufia, isafe ili amo bolo. Aufia, godogodofe ili amofeamo eno sogoba ofolo. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Aulugulu, gili aleba ami, ge faibehe nolu memaba haalisenaga, amo ga abehe efea abane uleno meyobafe? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Aufia, ge faibehe hani memasenaga, amo ga abehe efea soiye aiyane meyobafe? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:17">Yem 1.17</ref></char></note>Enaodali, gili wolu labeso, gilihe gine faibefea kegele nafulu meyo asigilo. Aulune, gine Gao <char style="w">hebene</char> labemohe, gine faibefea melo mana waselesiamo, Efea haalife ilifea heafusia, kegele nafulusu meyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:39-40">Mad 22.39-40</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:8-10">Lom 13.8-10</ref></char>
    </note>Mana sunia gilihe, noolo anogohe gilifea molomesi hamefe amogulumo, gilihe ilifeada mana amogubasu molomale. Sulu <char style="w" lemma="Muguli">Mugulida</char>, <char style="w">Saaba Ofolo</char> Sulu solu dobuda, sunia sulu ewefeasu bobaba ufulu dobu.”<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gili koleba eno saliba dedelelumo sugamale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Lugu 13.24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />Yesu saabia selesia, “Gili koleba eno saliba dedelelumo sugamale. Maumo, eno daba dafiyofealo aafe amo kuliba maiyomo abeelu dobu. Aufia, amone eno saliba bule alefasia sogoba dobu. Aulugulu, idele inolo wedinalemo eno amo sugafe. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Auluso, eno miliyolu miliyoda diyo helea aafe amo, kuliba maiyomo hogololu koleba dobu. Aufia, amone eno saliba amo, dedelelu koleba dobu. Aulugulu, idele inolo ule ulebahe eno amo isafia baaba golefia, ami sugafe.”<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gilihe masega saaba ofolo alebaibu ogo nafuluba bamale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Lugu 6.43-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">13.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:24">Mad 24.24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:29">HD 20.29</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:1">2Fid 2.1</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Gilihe masega saaba ofolo alebaibugo nafuluba bamale. Ilimo <char style="w">dofene sibi</char> badomo kakabuso, usu ligimo selibo geso ligia, faguba nabaiyesia, bese hegeleba labe. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:19-22">Gal 5.19-22</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 3:12">Yem 3.12</ref></char></note>Gilihe ine sebe helefefea alefasia, ili amobuba eloba babiyobafe. Inolohe didigane efolo aleba daafia, <char style="w">waini</char> sebe sulola? Aufia, inolohe gisi helenalu dobia daafia, <char style="w" lemma="Olono i - Olono sebe">olono sebe</char> sulola? Auba sulale. <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />I nafulu suniamo, sebe nafulu helelelo. Auluso, i wolumo, sebe wolu helelelo. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />I nafulumo, sebe wolu helelelale. Aufia, i wolumo, sebe nafulu helelelale. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:10">Mad 3.10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:9">Lug 3.9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:6">Yon 15.6</ref></char></note>I sunia sebe nafuluda helelefale amo, ilihe gegelefia de dafogolo. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Mad 12.33</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, gilihe ine sebe helelefefea alefasia, ili amobuba eloba bamale.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 6:46">Lug 6.46</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:25">Yem 1.25</ref></char>
    </note>Idele inolo nafea <char style="w">Saminilo</char>, Saminiloba selaba labe, ili amo sunia Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo suga maiyobafale. Aubale. Nao <char style="w">hebene</char> labe amone hameda kuliba aafe ili amosu sugaeyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Hilia amoyamo adesimo, idele inolo wedinale Nafea selesia, ‘Saminilo, Saminilo, ninihe Ge wi alefasia saaba ofolo dabalu mololu. Aufia, Ge wi alefasia, ninihe <char style="w">gamodo</char> asigafia, <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> wedinale mololu.’ Ili auba saeyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Sng 6.8</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 2:19">2Dim 2.19</ref></char></note>Auluso, fogo amoyamo Nahe ilifea fadaba eweguba saeyobasu. ‘Na gili bolalene hilisebuale. Wolu mololo inolo, gili Na labea melabu! Mala!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Molo dilomone mana aida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Lugu 6.47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Aulugulu, inolohe Ne sulu selefemoda dofasia, kuliba abia molofe amo, inolo asigida ufulu labe. Seale e-mo, molo disia, abane baliama saabia molo kolemesi dulu inolo amogulu labe. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Aufia, hele sugasia, amo hano gene inigia, fufulo kolelu fuusia, molo amofea dowesia, molo iluwaluso, duguba daaluale. Mau enebamo, molo amone ikaumo, abane baliama saabia koleba gaalune aulu. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Auluso, inolo Ne sulu selefemo dofasia kuliba abia molofale amo, inolo asigida ufuluale labe. E-mo, molo disia, saii saabia dulu amogulu labe. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Aufia, hele sugasia, amo hano gene inigia, fufulo kolelu fuusia, molo amofea dowesia, molo iluwasi, duguba daalu. Seale, e wobasubale duguba daalu.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Yesuhe sulu auba saaba samodosi, idele inolo wamili ilihe momoleba dobelesia hidigilu. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:22">Mag 1.22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:32">Lug 4.32</ref></char></note>Mau enebamo, E walesiamo, <char style="w">muguli manane dawalolu inolo</char> walelogubale, inolo wida solu kiwida dawalolo inolo waleloguba walelu.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe inolo yolida alolumo waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-44">Maga 1.40-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-14">Lugu 5.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Yesu E galea afasia suga saabi, idele inolo wamilihe e kuliba milibailu. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Ausi, bosolufalumo, aiye yolida aseba samodolu inolo uleno Yesu labea milifasia, emo hugulumo sagafia, selesia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, Ga koleba na galagololu melesi hamesenaga, amo Ga na waiba ufiyodolubu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe Ene sone isosia, inolo amo gesia selesia, “Na auba hamefe. Ga waisia, galagololu mela!” Ausi, alebale hamagi, aiye yoli amo asigilesi, inolo amo galagololu holobagalu. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Wkp 14.1-32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:30">Mad 9.30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:14">Lug 17.14</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesu efea koleba selesia, “Kegele gafea mololu ogomo, inolo ulenofea samabiyo. Aubale. Auluso, inolo noolohe ga seale wailububa asigimesine, ga abia, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melo inolofea</char> gene waleyo mala. Aufia, <char style="w">Mosese</char> molomaleba solu amoguba, ulu kegele soba memale.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe yobolo yasilone dabalu moloba ofolo faibe waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Lugu 7.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Yesu E Kafanima daunomo suga aasi, bosolufalumo, Lomene yobolone yasilo inolo E labea inigia, sagoba homaleyobilesia mulu. <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />E selesia, “Saminilo, doma. Ne dabalu mololo faibe walefagulu, moloa hanefia labe. Ene kiwi sunia olalu digia, naga bule diaba labe.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Na e waiba ufiyone maiyola?” <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Auluso, yobolone yasilo ehe Efea obegeba selesia, “Saminilo, Ga ne molo usu faseba milesine, na lililuale lolu. Auluso, Gahe ugi ligia, waimaleba selesi, ne dabalu mololo faibe ewe yagi waiyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Na auba selesu, enebamo, nene nada, inolo no yasibu amone sisa lolu. Aufia, yobolo inolo noolo na sisada alebaibu. Na ulenofea malasimo, e ano. Aufia, na nofea milasimo, amo e ano. Aufia, nahe ne <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">dabalu mololofea</char> selesia, ga dabalu ewe molomasimo, amo e mololo.” <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus and Centurion" file="IB04113.tif" size="col" loc="8.5" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="8.5-13">Lomene yobolone yasilo inolo uleno Yesu labea mulu.</figure><verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Yesu Ehe, Lomene yasilo inolo amo sulu auba solumo dofasia, E momoleba hidigilu. Ausi, Ehe idele inolo wamili Eda kuliba milibailu ili amofea nolofasia, selesia, “Seale koleba, Na gilifea selesu, <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomu aleba amimo, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule kolelu ufulu</char> labe amogulumo, Nahe ulenoda abuluale. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 13:29">Lug 13.29</ref></char></note>Na gilifea selesu, idele inolo wedinalehe ine hele afasia, halo holobagalofealo afasiada, halo sugalofealo afasiada, ili milibaifia, <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamada</char>, Aisegeda, <char style="w" lemma="Yekobo">Yekoboda</char>, ili galiba Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami sugafia, naiyo bule yufuluiya naba misiyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Mad 22.13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25.30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Lug 13.28</ref></char></note>Auluso, idele inolo Godehe saminimo Ene Yasifia Luba Ada ami kakainamesine molobebelelu ili amomo, egeisa nigili gagaiya ami dafogoyobafe. Amimo, ili bese hegelesia, yegiliba ligia, kudumaneba miliyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Aufia, Yesuhe yobolo yasilomofea selesia, “Ga kegele holobagaeyobafeba <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufuluguba</char> moloyobafegulu, ga mala.” Fogo hamagi koleba, yobolo yasilomone dabalu mololo faibe amo wailu.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Fidane enamolo ido waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-31">Maga 1.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-39">Lugu 4.38-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Yesuhe <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidane</char> molosu sugasia, Fidane enamolo ido domala haloba walefasi molobia hanefia labi abulu. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Aufia, Yesuhe ido amone sone gesi, walefa halomo gelelu. Ausi, e degefasia, Yesune naiyo madenelu.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe idele inolo saludiale waiba waalelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:32-34">Maga 1.32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:40-41">Lugu 4.40-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Geide adesi, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Gamodo">gamododa</char> adaaba yaalu wedinalemo Yesu labea luba dibia milibailu. Ausi, E sulu selesi, asubane wolu idele inolofea alebailumo asigaba yaalu. Aufia, Ehe walefalu ili amo sunia waiba waalelu. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Ais 53.4</ref></char></note>Ausihe, Godene sulu <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Aisaia">Aisaiane</char> mofeofeafia solu amone wakaliba sugalu. Sulu amo eweguba,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 8:17" />
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">
    <char style="qt">“Ehe nine kiwi saneba yaalumo agifia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">
    <char style="qt">nine walefamo dibia daalu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe E kuliba milesine mana amone solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-60">Lugu 9.57-60</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Yesuhe idele inolo wamili E amalefia alebaibi baafia, Ene walelu faibilifea selesia, “Nini waiyo galubu nolobalo anogolo segeba maiyoba.” <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Auba saafia labi, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu inolomo</char> Yesu labea milifasia selesia, “Walelo, hele sunia Gada maiyo aafeamo, nada Ga kuliba miyobasu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 8:9">2Kld 8.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Selibo geso ilimo, hele kaleba hanelo eno dobu. Aufia haga ilimo, molo adaaba yaabu. Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char>, haneyone gunida ufiyo hele male.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 19:20">1Kin 19.20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, <char style="w">walelu faibe</char> nohe Yesufea selesia, “Saminilo, na Ga kuliba miyoso, nadale ne nao baliba ufiyone waagi malaba saamaleyobile?” <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Hama, olalu ilimo, olalu mosomu ine geleba baliba waaleyo dobu. Auluso, ga-mo, Na kuliba mila.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E selesi, fufuloda hano fufulelumoda gadaealu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:36-41">Maga 4.36-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Lugu 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Ausi, Yesu E hano kasumo aleba lagosi, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> E kuliba abia, ilida aleba lagolu. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 4:8">Sng 4.8</ref></char></note>Hano kasu waiyo dogolea daaba labi, bosolufalumo, mogaifo bule inigia, waiyo saabia dowesia, hanohe fufulesi, hano kasu gasiaeyo weiyaalu. Ausi, Yesu E hanefia alolu. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Ausi, ilihe Yesu E gilasia selesia, “Saminilo! Nini hano gifiasia olaeyo weiyaafe. Nini sagoba homa!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:31">Mad 14.31</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:9">Sng 89.9</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Gine asigi ule ufulu amo, wedino kolebabu. Gili sagilife ogo, enesi ause?” Aufia, E degefia, fufulodai hanodaifea halaleba solu. Ausi, fufulo gelesi, hano gadaealu. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Ausi, ili momoleba hidigifia, ine geleba selesia, “Inolo ewe koleba abebi? Fufuloda, fufulefeda, E selefemo sigiba dobolo, besela?”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe inolo aidafea gamodo alolumo asigalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-17">Maga 5.1-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-37">Lugu 8.26-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Yesuda ili hano kasu segeba abia, Galili waiyo galulu nolobalo fogoba asulu Gadala ami, goalu. Ausi, bosolufalumo, <char style="w" lemma="Gamodo">gamododa</char> felalu aida inolo baliya amifia inigia, ili mi gagiba goalu. Aalu ilaluba silogulu, idele inolo aalu baaba sagilisia, eno amo anale. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:24">Mag 1.24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:41">Lug 4.41</ref></char></note>Aufia, aaluhe sogaaba selesia, “Ga Godene Faibe, ga ninifea ene moloyo hamefe? Iminiba ufulu fogo aso holobagabale labi, hamaga ga ninifea ama naga meyo mulubile?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Ili labea amifia asogoloba ami, dofene wedinale sogolugaba naiyo naba alolu. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Ausi, <char style="w">gamodo</char> ilihe Yesufea susiba selesia, “Gahe nini asigaba dafelesenaga, dofene sogolugaba labe asogofea sugaeyo malama.” <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Gili auba mala!” Ausi, gamodo ili amo inolo aidamo gadefia, dofene amofea alibialu. Ausi, dofene sogolugalu ili amo kiwigagaba naguba dedalesia, waiyo galulu egewine sailafealomo subaisalu. Aufia, ili waiyo usu subaisasia, gifiaba danelu.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Dofeneda luba ado ili amohe, molofe amo baafia, ili fisaba dedalelu. Ili abia, dauno amo goafia, kegele molosi ili abulumo, idele inolofea saaba sigilu. Aufia, inolo gamododa alolu aida amofea mololu amoda, ili awaba melu. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Ausi, dauno amone idele inolo sunia Yesu babiyone milibailu. Aufia, ili E baafia, Efea susiba selesia, “Ga nine hele ewe gadefia, nolobalo afa malaba” solu.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe domala kakalolu inolo uleno waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maga 2.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Lugu 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:13">Mad 4.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Yesu E hano kasu saabia aleba lagofia, waiyo galulu nolobalo anogolo segefia, Ene dauno ami koleba goalu. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Aufia, inolo noolohe kakaloba dulu inolo uleno dafu adolu saabia ofasia, Yesu labea ikauba dia mulu. Ausi, Yesuhe ili amo <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> baafia, Ehe walefalu inolo amofea selesia, “Ne faibe, ge libo esebalo mela. Ge <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolumo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galife</char>.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />
    <char style="w">Muguli manane dawalolu inolo</char> noolohe Yesu auba selefe dofasia, ine geleba nenesia, selesia, “Inolo ogo, ‘Na wolu hamasia heesia galifeba’ selefe ogo, E Godene hele disia, E Godegulu loluba selefe. Auba selefe ogo, Ehe samabiyolu muguli sulu gelefe.”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 9:47">Lug 9.47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:25">Yon 2.25</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe ine asigi geleba bafasia selesia, “Gili gine libo ogo asigi wolu ofelefego, mau enene ause? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Abeelu saeyomo halabu? ‘Ge wolu hamasia heesia galisuba’ saeyo amobula, me ‘Degefia malaba’ saeyo amobula? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:2">Yon 17.2</ref></char></note>Auluso, <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> E-mo, helefealu iwi wolu hamasia heesia galiyone wida solu kiwigagalu labe. Aulugulu, gilihe auba fadaba asigimesine, Nahe kakaloba dulu ewefea eweguba saeyobasu.” Aufia, Ehe kakalolu inolo amofea selesia, “Ga, degema! Ge dafu adolu difasia, gene moloa mala.” <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Ausi, inolo amo degefia ene moloa daalu. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Idele inolo wamili ili amo baafia, ili sagililu. Godehe inolofea wida solu kiwida melune, ili Ene wi wabialelu.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Madiyu welu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maga 2.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Lugu 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yesu E daaba ligia bisigia, inolo uleno dagese mole diaba ada moloa ami yoba saabi abulu. Ene wimo, <char style="w" lemma="Madiyu - Lifai">Madiyu</char>. Ausi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Ga na kuliba mila.” Ausi, Madiyu e degefia, Yesu kuliba daalu.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Aufia, Yesuhe Madiyune moloa yoba sigia, naiyo naba labi, dagese dilo inoloda, aufia <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu mololo</char> idele inoloda, wedinale milibaifia, Yesuda Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilida</char>, ili galiba ua naiyo naba kakainalu. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:2">Lug 15.2</ref></char></note><char style="w">Falisi</char> ilihe auba molofe baafia, ilihe Yesune walelu faibilifea doba bisigia, “Gine walelohe dagese diloda, wolu mololoda, ilidai ua naiyo naafego, enesi aufe?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Auba selesi dofasia, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Dogodahe domala nafulu fisigalu labemofea dabalu mololale. Aubale. Dogodahe walefa inolo ilifeasu dabalu moloba ado. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:7">Mad 12.7</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos 6.6</ref></char></note>Gilihe Godene bugo selelu dobumo alegafasia, asigiba diyo mala.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 9:13" />
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 9:13">
    <char style="qt">Gilihe Nafea soba mefemo, Na hamefale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 9:13">
    <char style="qt">Aubale. Gilihe <char style="w">kanululo</char> mana molomesi Na hamefe.</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 9:13" />
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 9:13">Auba selelu dobu. Aulugulu, Na mulumo, <char style="w">isolu galagololu</char> inolo weyone muluale. Aubale. Na wolu mololo ili weyone mulu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hano Gelo Yone ene walelu faibili ilihe Yesufea aiyalo mana amone doba abulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maga 2.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Lugu 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 18:12">Lug 18.12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fogo amoyamo, <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yonene</char> <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> Yesu labea milibaifia, doba bisigia selesia, “Ninida, <char style="w">Falisi</char> ilida, Gode hilisesia <char style="w" lemma="Naiyo aiyalo">naiyo aiyasia</char>, doloma adogulu, no ge walelu faibili auba aufalego, enebane ause?” <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe ilifea besi sulu eweguba solu. “Ido ifosia, inolone damenedai, idone damenedai, gagaiyofea amimo, idoda diyomo aso ili galiba ua yoba saabimo, ili kuanosia yegilisia, naiyo aiyasia doloma miliyobafela? Aubale. Auluso, dufia, idoda diyomo uluba dibia daafia labi, fogo ami, ene damenedalimo naiyo ami aiyayobafe.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Besi sulu ewemo, idoda diyo inolomo Yesu iminife.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mana amakeleludai mana hagaeadai gegoamabiyoba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />Aufia, Yesuhe besi sulu no eweguba solu. “Inolo ulenohe fagulo kaide bidilu amofea asogoyo hilisesenaga, amo e fagulo haisi hili hagaea difasia, kaide bidilu amofea asogolale. Aubale. Auba asogosiabiaga, fagulo amo hano heesi, hagaeamo sigisia, kaidelumo bule gagalabaiyo.”<verse eid="MAT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Aufia, besi sulu no solu. “Inolo ulenohe <char style="w">waini</char> sebe fasifia, waini hano hili mololu amo, dofene meme bado asogolu agogolelumofea hogonialale. Aubale. Auba hogoniasiabiaga, amo waini hano hilimo, hoo kaaba galusia, dofene meme bado agogolelumo fisigasia, waini hanomo hele saabia sagaba dabaiyo. Ausimo, kelebulu bado hamagada bidiba dafaiyo. Aulune, waini sebe hano hilimo, kelebulu bado hagaea hili asogolumofea hogonialo. Ausi, kegele aida amo aalifaba nafulu ufia ado.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe ido sino hulu sugalumo waiba ofasia, ido faibe olalumo degeba ifolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:22-43">Maga 5.22-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:41-56">Lugu 8.41-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Yesuhe Yonene walelu faibilifea sulu auba selaba labi, gulugululo molone guni inolo uleno milifasia, Yesune emo aniba emo hugulumo sagafia, yoba isigia selesia, “Ne nelewelimo agayagi olaso. Auluso, Ge sone e geyo mila. Ausihe, e degefia, haiba bebea misiyobafe.” <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Ausi, Yesu E degefia, e kuliba aasi, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilida</char> E galiba daalu.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Auba daaba labi, ido uleno sino hulu daaba ligia hamu huguluba alolumo, Yesu E faisalo milifasia, ene sonehe Yesune fagulo selalemone haisimo geba golu. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:36">Mad 14.36</ref></char></note>Ehe ene meleba hilisesia, “Nahe Ene fagulofeasu gesenaga, na waiyobasu.” <verse eid="MAT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Auba gesi, Yesu E nolofia, e bisigia selesia, “Neleweli, ge asigi esebalo mela. Ga Nafea <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> ogohe, ga waiba ofolefe.” Fogo hamagi ido amo wailu. <figure style="fig" alt="Touching the hem of Jesus' robe" file="42_Lk_08_34_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="© Sweet Publishing http://sweetpublishing.com, licensed under a CC: BY-SA 3.0 Unported licence." ref="9.20-22">Ido ule sino hulu sugalu amo waiba ufulu.</figure><verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Aufia, ili abia, Yesu E guni inolo amone moloa goasia, bisigia, idele inolo ili yegiliba labi abulu. Inolo noolohe sulu gelelu feeba galaba labi, idele inolo ili gala wedinale dafaliba alolu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.23</char> Yudane manamo kuanosia yegiliba ligia, inolo noolo yagunagasia sulu gelelu feeba galaba ado.</note> <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Ausi, Yesu selesia, “Gili dedaleba yaama. Ido faibe ogo olaluale dobu. E hanefia labe.” Auba selesi, ilihe E baaba galulu. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Auluso, idele inolo baea malafia, Yesuhe molosu suga daafia, ido faibe amone sone gasisi, e degeba lagolu. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Ausi, kegele Yesu E mololu solumo fogoba asulu amo sunia doba sigilu.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe si kalalu aidadai, mofeo kaalu uledai, waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mad 20.29-34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu amifia daaba labi, si kalalu inolo aidamo E kuliba inigia wuaaba selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> Faibe Ga, ani yagunagama.” <verse eid="MAT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Ausi, E molosu sugasi, si kalalu aidamo aaluda sugafia, E labea mulu. Ausi, Yesuhe aalufea doba bisigia, “Aali <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesia</char>, Nahe kegele ewe moloyodoluba hilisefela?” Aalu Efea selesia, “Ee, <char style="w">Saminilo</char>, Ga auba moloyodoluba hilisesu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Auba selesi, Ene sonehe aine sifea gesia selesia, “Aine <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufuluguba</char> kegele aalifea moloyobafe.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:4">Mad 8.4</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, aine si fisigalu. Aufia, Yesuhe sulu kolelu aalufea selesia, “Aalifea kegele mololu ogo, inolo uleno asigimesialene samabiyo.” <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Auluso, aalu abia, idele inolo fogoba asulu amo suniafea Yesune sadalumo saaba sigilu.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Inolo aidamo molo amo afasia aasi, ili noolohe inolo uleno mofeo kaalu <char style="w" lemma="Gamodo">gamododa</char> alolumo, Yesu E labea ulubia suga mulu. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 2:12">Mag 2.12</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesuhe <char style="w">gamodo</char> amo asigasi, mofeo kaalumo sulu solu. Ausi, idele inolohe momoleba hidigifia selesia, “<char style="w">Isolaele</char> iwi, kegele amogulumo holobagasi bolale.”<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:24">Mad 12.24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mag 3.22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Lug 11.15</ref></char>
    </note>Auluso, <char style="w">Falisi</char> ili selesia, “Ehe gamodo asigafemo, gamodone yasilo kiwigagalumohe asigafebu.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe idele inolo yagunagalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mad 4.23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:39">Mag 1.39</ref></char>
    </note>Yesu E daunofealoda, mosomufealoda, sunia siba ligia, Ehe ine <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo moloa</char> ami walesia, Ehe Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamone awalu sulu nafulumone saaba mesia, walefalu suniada waiba waaleba ado. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 10:2">Sek 10.2</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 27:17">Nam 27.17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1Kin 22.17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 14:14">Mad 14.14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mag 6.34</ref></char></note>Ehe idele inolo wamili amo bisigia, ili <char style="w">dofene sibi</char> uluba adoda malegulu labi abulu. Ili sagilifia, kiwi sanefia, ine asigimo elawaneba yaafia labi abulune, E ili yagunagalu. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:2">Lug 10.2</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, Ehe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> selesia, “Edo geiya sebe wedinale gegenelu heleleba yaabuso, amone suba miliyone dabalu mololo inolo bilalebu. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Aulugulu, gelu enaohe dabalu mololo sebe amone suiyone hilibaimesi, gilihe Efea haalimale.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Hilibaisi daalu huguluba amone ine wi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maga 3.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Lugu 6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 6:7">Mag 6.7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1">Lug 9.1</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> huguluba amo milibaimafia, Ehe ilifea <char style="w">asubane wolu</char> asigaba yaeyone, walefa nokene nokeneba waiba waaleyone, wida solu kiwida melesi melu.<verse eid="MAT 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">Hilibaisi daalu</char> huguluba amone ine wimo, ewe. Agelemo <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char>, ene wi nomo, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char>. Aufia, ene elewo <char style="w" lemma="Adulu">Adulu</char>. Aufia, Sebedine faibe <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]], Sebedine faibe">Yemese</char>, aufia, ene elewo <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yone</char> eda. <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Filibi[[1]], Yesune walelu faibe">Filibi</char>. Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Badolomiyu">Badolomiyu</char>. Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Domase">Domase</char>. Aufia, dagese dilo inolo <char style="w" lemma="Madiyu - Lifai">Madiyu</char>. Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[2]], Alufiusune faibe">Alufiusune faibe Yemese</char>. Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Dadisu">Dadisu</char>. <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Selodo mosomu">Selodo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Saimono Selodo mosomune faibe">Saimono</char> eda. Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[1]], Isakaliodo">Yudasa Isakaliodo</char>, dufia Yesuda holonolu amo e hamaga.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe hilibaisi daalu huguluba amofea dabalu melu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maga 6.7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-5">Lugu 9.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yesuhe Ene walelu faibili huguluba amo hilibaisasia, selesia, “Gili <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau inolo mosomu</char> labefealo abiale, Samalia dauno ulenomoda sugamabiyo. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 50:6">Jer 50.6</ref></char></note>Aubale, gili abia, <char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaelene</char> <char style="w">dofene sibida</char> daba dafalilu labealo amosu malale. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Mad 3.2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:17">4.17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:9">Lug 10.9</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 10:11">11</ref></char></note>Gili abia, sulu mana eweguba walemale. ‘Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo mulu hagoale labe.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Aufia, gili abia, walefalumo waiba waalemale. Aufia, inolo olaba yaalu <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba ifomale</char>. Aufia, yolida inolo ilimo galagololu gadefamale. Aufia, <char style="w">gamodo</char> asigaba yaamale. Gili elegebale ulu dulugulu, gilida idele inolo noolofea ulu memale. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4">Lug 10.4</ref></char></note>Gili <char style="w">golo</char> moleda, silifa moleda, mole iso wedino amoda, semabiyo. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:7">Lug 10.7</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 9:14">1Kld 9.14</ref></char></note>Gili abiamo, aluda agimabiyo. Enebamo, dabaluda molofemo ene elebe diyo dobu. Aulugulu, gilihe saligalo hulianeda, samagada, kaidamoda, sebale malale.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />Aufia, gili abiamo, dauno uleno, me mosomu uleno suga abia, gilihe hele amone inolo halane nafulu isolulaba fadaba bamale. Aufia, gili inolo amo galiba adabia, hele amo afa abia hamale. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:5-6">Lug 10.5-6</ref></char></note>Aufia, gili molo amo sugasiamo, idele inolo ami aselomofea aeaba ofelefeba selesia wakalimale. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Aufia, ili moloa ami saabemo, gili luba diyo henesenaga, amo gine <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealo</char> sulu nafulumo ilifea miliyobafe. Auluso, ilihe gili luba diyo hamesalenaga, amo gine sulu aealo nafulumo ginefea obegeyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:10-12">Lug 10.10-12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:51">HD 13.51</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, inolo ulenohe, gili ene moloa heneba luba diyo hamebale ligia, gine sulu dubiyo hamesalenaga, gili molo amo, me dauno amo, gadefia abia, helesao gine emofea baabugo fifiba dafogofia malale.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yuda ilihe ine mana kuliba abia, helesao ine emofea baabumo fifiba dafelesuba sodomo, gine mana wolu mololumo ninifea baabualesia sodo.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:24">Mad 11.24</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:7">Yud 1.7</ref></char></note>Na seale koleba gilifea selesu, osolaeyo hilia adesimo, dauno ogone idele inolo higini diyobafe amohe, <char style="w" lemma="Sodomo">Sodomoda</char>, Gomolada, amone idele inolo higini diyobafe amo, waseba suniaeyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Higini wedinale nonoba holobagaeyobafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maga 13.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Lugu 21.12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:3">Lug 10.3</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:19">Lom 16.19</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe sulu saabia selesia, “Doma, Na gili hilibaisasi, gili <char style="w" lemma="Dofene sibi">dofene sibigulu</char>, selibo geso adaaba yaabia aleba ami miliyobafe. Aulugulu, gili soiye molologubasu molomale. Enebamo, soiyehe kegele aso moloyo ligiamo, saminiba nafuluba asigiba ado. Aufia, gilihe haga hilune mana kuliba abia, mana wolu moloyo hilisemabiyo.<verse eid="MAT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 13:9-11">Mag 13.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Lug 12.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-15">21.12-15</ref></char>
    </note>Gili yasisia, inolo nafuluba bamale. Ilihe gilimo uluba dibia abia, ine galisolofea godosia, gili <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> usu efolo fegoba yaeyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Ne wi gilifea dobugo alefasia, ilihe gilimo kinidai gamanedai si saabia degeba melaeyobafe. Ausi, gilihe asigi ule ufulu ogone mau ilifea saeyobafe. Aufia, gilihe <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolofeada</char> auba saeyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Ilihe gili sefia, godola helea yoba melasimo, gili sagiliba hilisesia, nini sulu halaguba saeyobiba hilisemabiyo. Aufia, nini sulu enegulu saeyobiba hilisemabiyo. Aubale. Fogo hamagi koleba, Gode E alefasia, sulu gilifea ewe saamaba waleyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:26">Yon 14.26</ref></char></note>Mau enebamo, gene ga saeyobafaleso, ge Gaone Asubane alefasia, gafea saaba dafelagoyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mai 7.6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:35">Mad 10.35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:12">Mag 13.12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:16">Lug 21.16</ref></char>
    </note>Elewohe elewomo dufa olamesi holonoyobafe. Ausi, enao ene faibefea aubasu moloyobafe. Ausi, faibilihe elelisia, enaodai enaedaifea gisa adesia, aalu dumesi, noolone sone saabia ufiyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Aufia, ne wi gilifea dobu alefasia, inolo suniahe gilifea gogoloba babiyobafe. Auluso, idele inolo kiwigagaba kalugalabia abia, aleba elofefea elofe ili amo, gasiba dafaliyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Aulugulu, dauno none idele inolohe gilifea woba molosenaga, amo fisaba abia, dauno nolobalo malale. Na seale gilifea selesu, gilihe auba fisaba siba ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaelene</char> dauno sunia aso siba samodobale labi, <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> ami miyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Lug 6.40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Yon 13.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15.20</ref></char>
    </note>Sugululo faibemo, ene walelomo waseba sunialale. Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">dabalu mololo inolo</char> e-mo, ene yasilo inolomo sunialale. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mad 9.34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:24">12.24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mag 3.22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Lug 11.15</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, sugululo faibe ene walelogulu adesenaga, amo isobu. Aufia, dabalu mololo inolo ene yasilogulu adesenaga, amoda isobu. Noolohe Na amone saaba selesia, ‘E <char style="w">Besebulububa</char>’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.25</char> <char style="fq" closed="false">Besebulu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo Sedenene wi no. (Madiyu 12.22-28 ami bamale.)</char></note> solubiyo. Aulugulu, ilihe gili amone saaba wolune wolu koleba wi saeyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolohe Gode baabasu sagiliyo dobu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Lugu 12.2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mag 4.22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Lug 8.17</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe sulu saabia selesia, “Gilihe inolo gilida woba ofelefe amofea sagilimabiyo. Kegele sunia aga gasiaguba dobumo, ulufa holobagaeyobafe. Aufia, kegele sunia aga muguba dobumo, fadaba asigiyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Sulu aga na nigiliba gilibisufea selesu ewe, gilihe yaida ami ulufaba saamale. Aufia, sulu gili koneniaba solu ogo, sulu amo gilihe molo fagia degefia yoba ligia, idele inolofea wuaaba saaba memale.<verse eid="MAT 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 4:12">Yem 4.12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:31">Lom 8.31</ref></char>
    </note>Gine domalada balusu dufa olasiaso, gine asubaneda dufa olaeyodoluale inolo amo, baaba sagilimabiyo. Aubale. Gine domalada asubaneda alifabada <char style="w">heli</char> usu saidafogofia woba ufiyodolu dobu amo, E baabasu sagilimale. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Haga biliye wedino aidamo mole iso wedino ulesu elegelomo, gili asigibualela? Auluso, gine Gaohe haga wedino amoda luba ado. Haga uledenomo hele saabia hodobaisenaga, E asigibu. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Aufia, Godehe gine guni kaau sunia alegaba samodobu. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:26">Mad 6.26</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, gili sagilimabiyo. Gili eleda haga biliye wedinale amo wasolu dobu.”<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ninihe nini Yesune mosomu loluba saeyomo yuamabiyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Lugu 12.8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />Yesuhe sulu saabia selesia, “Uleno abehe, idele inolone si saabia na Yesune mosomu inolo loluba fogaba selesenaga, amo Nada ne Nao <char style="w">hebene</char> labemone si saabia selesia, ‘Inolo amo Ne labeba’ fogaba saeyobasu. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 8:38">Mag 8.38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:26">Lug 9.26</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 2:12">2Dim 2.12</ref></char></note>Auluso, uleno abehe, idele inolone si saabia na Yesune mosomu lolualeba selesenaga, amo Nada ne Nao hebene labemone si saabia selesiamo, ‘Inolo amo Ne-aleba’ saeyobasu.”<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idele inolo ilihe Yesu bule koleba hameseyo dobu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Lugu 12.51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />Yesuhe sulu saabia selesia, “Na helefealu iwi mulumo, idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aeaba</char> esebalo kakainayone dia muluba, gili auba hilisemabiyo. Aealo mana dia mulualeso, Na helebesi dia mulu. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mai 7.6</ref></char></note>Enebamo, Na mulumo, idele inolo kukulifia alebaibu amone sogaba dafiyone mulu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 10:35" />
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 10:35">
    <char style="qt">Inolo enaofea kulifia labe amone sogaba dafiyone mulu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 10:35">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, eleweli enaefea kulifia labe amone sogaba dafiyone mulu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 10:35">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, dulu idohe ene hagolufea kulifia labe amone sogaba dafiyone mulu.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />
    <char style="qt">Inolo ene damenele koleba waaga, edai gisa miliyobafe.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Uleno abehe, ene enao, me ene enae, bule koleba hamesefia, Na wedino hamesesenaga, amo e Ne damene miliyobafale. Aufia, uleno abehe, ene faibe, me ene eleweli, bule koleba hamesefia, Na wedino hamesesenaga, amo e Ne damene miliyobafale. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:24-25">Mad 16.24-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34-35">Mag 8.34-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23-24">Lug 9.23-24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17.33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yon 12.25</ref></char></note>Aufia, inolo abehe, na kuliba inigia, ene <char style="w">imolane</char> digisalenaga, amo e Ne damene koleba miliyobafale. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Mau enebamo, uleno abehe, ene miliyolu fedoba seyo hilisesenaga, amo e ene miliyolu daba dafiyobafe. Auluso, inolo abehe, Ne wi saabia ene miliyolu weasesenaga, amo e seale miliyolu miliyo seyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolohe Kelisone mosomu sagoba ofelesenaga, amo e elebe nafulu diyobafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Maga 9.41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mag 9.37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Lug 10.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yon 13.20</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe sulu saabia selesia, “Uleno abehe, gili heneba luba disenaga, amo Na heneba luba dife. Aufia, inolo abehe, Na heneba luba dife amo, e Nada hilibailu amoda, heneba luba dife. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Inolo no, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> labemone, gahe e-mo heneba luba disenaga, gafea sabe mesiamo, saaba ofolo elebe diloguba, elebe amogubasu gafea meyobafe. Aufia, no anogo inolo nafulu labene, gahe e-mo heneba luba disenaga, amo gafea sabe mesiamo, inolo nafulu elebe diloguba, elebe amogubasu gafea meyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Na gilifea seale selesu, uleno abehe, inolo widale ewe ilimo Yesune <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilibuba</char> hilisesia, ilifea sagoba ofelesia, hano badilu gaabu wasulu uleno mesenaga, amo inolo amone elebemo asigileyobafale.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Hano Gelo Yonehe ene walelu faibili ili Yesufea doba bamesine malalelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Lugu 7.18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Yesuhe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> amofea auba molomaleba saaba samodofia, E amifia abia, Galiline dauno ami siba labeofia, idele inolofea Godene sulu mana walelu.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2-3" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Hano Gelo Yone</char> e dibolo ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> dabalumone sulu solu dofasia, ehe ene walelu faibilifea selesia, “Gili Yesu labea daafia, Efea eweguba wanemale. ‘Inolo Gode alefasia milesiba saaba ufulu amo, Ga-la? Me ninihe inolo no milesi yasiyobile?’ ” Yonehe ili auba waneyone malalu.<verse eid="MAT 11:2-3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Ili goafia, auba doba besabi, Yesu E ilifea obegeba selesia, “Gili obegeba abia, gili dubulu amoneda, abulu amoneda, saaba mesia, Yonefea eweguba awamale.<verse eid="MAT 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:5-6">Ais 35.5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61.1</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">Si kalaba yaalu ilimo, haiba bebelefe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:5">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, kakaloba dulu ilimo, haiba dedalefe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:5">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, inolo yoli asulu walefa ilimo, haiba galagololu adaaba yaafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:5">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, koneni kakaba yaalu ilimo, sulu haiba dobalaba yaafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:5">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, inolo danelu ilimo, <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba</char> yaafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:5">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, idele inolo weagulu ilimo, awalu sulu nafulu dobalaba yaafe.</char><verse eid="MAT 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Aulugulu, inolo abehe Na baafia, ene asigi ule ufulu gelebaifale amo, ene henelo wasigafia labe.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Yonene walelu faibili ili daafia labi, Yesuhe idele inolo wamilimofea, Yonemone saaba sulu eweguba solu. “Gili anogo hele falaiya ami dedalelumo, amene babiyone daalu? Gili fufulohe gabaiya uleno walu besife amone bea dedalelubile? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Auba aulualenaga, gili amene babiyone dedalelu? Gilihe inolo ule fagulo nenafolosu kaalu amone babiyone dedalelubile? Aa. Fagulo nenafolo kakafia alebaibu inolo ili amogulumo, kinine moloa aselo. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Auluso, auba aulualenaga, mau eneyone gili dedalelu? <char style="w">Saaba ofolo</char> uleno babiyone dedalelubile? Ee, amone saaba sulu na gilifea eweguba selesu, saaba ofolo ewehe, saaba ofolo noolo wasolu labe. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:76">Lug 1.76</ref></char></note>Inolo ewe iminisiamo, Godene bugo eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 11:10" />
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:10">
    <char style="qt">‘Bama. Nahe Ne sulu saaba sigimesi dia ano inolomo Ga saminiba malesi hilibaiyobasu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:10">
    <char style="qt">Edale abia, Ga malesi, eno felaba madeneyobafe.’</char><verse eid="MAT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Na seale koleba gilifea selesu, helefealu iwi kakinabu idele inolo aleba ami, inolo ulenohe Hano Gelo Yone wasoluale. Auluso, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone ili aleba ami, widale wedino labe amohe, Yone wasolu labe.<verse eid="MAT 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 16:16">Lug 16.16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hano Gelo Yonehe maugaba mana waleiya amifia inigia aga iwimo, wolu inolo ilihe belagulo mana nokene nokeneba molosia, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamone diba dafiyone, kiwigagaba belaguba labe. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Saaba ofolo suniada, <char style="w">muguli</char> sulu selelu amoda, sulu saaba ufiyo labia miliba ligia, ami aga fogo ewe Yone holobagalu. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Aulugulu, gilihe dubiyo hamesenaga, amo gili domale. Elaiya, e milesi saaba ufulu amo, Yone e. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Konenida ga, sulu ewe doma.<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />Idele inolo aga saabe ewene manamo, Na ili amo halaguluba iminiba dedeba saeyobi? Na eweguba dedeba selesu. Faibe deseine magede ofola helea ami kakainafia ligia, faibe noolo anogofea eweguba wuaaba selefe.<verse eid="MAT 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />‘Nini alefasia, gili ibamesisia, suulu gelelu feeba galaluso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:17">gili ibasale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:17">Aufia, nini alefasia, gili yegilimesisia, yanolu gasa soluso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:17">gili yegilisale.’ </para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 11:17" />
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 11:17">Idele inolo aga saabe ili amo, faibe deseine amogulu labe.”<verse eid="MAT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Auba safasia, Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Yonemo, naiyoda hanoda nabale adabia mulune, ilihe selesia, efea <char style="w">gamodo</char> labeba selefe. <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:14">Mad 9.14</ref></char></note>Aufia, agamo <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> naiyoda hanoda nalabia saabimo, gili selesia, ‘Bama, E inolo naiyoda, waini hanoda, wedinale galibaleleba noloba selefe.’ Aufia, gilihe E saaba sulu selesiamo, ‘Ogomo, dagese dilodai, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu mololo</char> inolodai, damene adefeba’ selefe. Auluso, idele inolo Godene dawalolo dife amomo, olaibo kegele moloba walelo.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idele inolo noolo asigi besiluale labemo ilifea woba ufiyobafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Lugu 10.13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Yesuhe <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> wedinale moloiya dauno amimo, ili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besiluale</char>. Aulune, Yesu dauno amone idele inolo amofea eweguba gadiba solu. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Yeele! Kolasini dauno ga, gafea woba ufiyobafe! Yeele! Besaida dauno ga, gafea woba ufiyobafe! Enebamo, gili aleba ami, Nahe momolelu kegele wedinale mololuso, gili asigi ule ofelesale. Nahe yau mosomune sidi aida, Dailadai, Saidonodai, aleba ami, momolelu kegele auba mololubiaga, amo ili yagunagalo fagulo kakafia, dose heefasia, asigi besibaiyo. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Auluso, na gilifea selesu, osolaeyone hilia adesimo, higinilu gilifea holobagaeyobafe amohe Dailadai, Saidonodai, higinilu diyobafemo, wasolu koleba miliyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Ais 14.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Stt 19.24-28</ref></char></note>Aufia, Kafanima dauno ga, gili <char style="w">hebene</char> lago koleba digi dibia felaeyobafeba hilisefela? Felaeyobafale koleba. Gili koleba danelu yasiba ada ami sugaeyobafe. Enebamo, momolelu kegele Nahe gili aleba mololu amo <char style="w">Sodomo</char> ami auba mololubiaga, amo hele Sodomo aga ewe aso ufia alebaiyo. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mad 10.15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:12">Lug 10.12</ref></char></note>Auluso, nahe gilifea selesu, osolaeyone hilia adesimo, higinilu gilifea holobagaeyobafe amohe, Sodomo higinilu diyobafemo, wasolu koleba miliyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gili Na labea milifasia halemane dima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Lugu 10.21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 1:26-29">1Kld 1.26-29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fogo amoyamo Yesu selesia, “Nao, Ga <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenedai</char> helefealudaine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> labene, Na Ge wi digisu. Mau enebamo, Gahe kegele ewemo dawalolo inoloda, asigilo inoloda, ilifea muguba ufuluso, Gahe inolo faibe deseinegulu labe ili amofea, ulufaba walefe. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Seale, Nao, Ga auba mololumo, Gene heneyone mololu.”<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 28:18">Mad 28.18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:35">Yon 3.35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 17:2">17.2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:18">1.18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10.15</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Ne Naohe, kegele sunia Ne sone saabia ufulubiyo. Inolo ulenohe Faibe ewe amobuba hilisebualeso, Enao Elebisu Faibe hilisebu. Ausi, inolo ulenohe Nao ewe amobuba hilisebualeso, Faibe Elebisu Enao hilisebu. Faibehe Enao babiyone molobebelelu idele inolo ili amoda, Enao hilisebu.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:25">Jer 31.25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hogololu dabalu molosia, i higinilu bule koleba didigibu idele inolo gili sunia, Na labea milibaima. Nahe gilifea halemane melesi meyobasu. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29-30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.29-30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 5:3">1Yon 5.3</ref></char></note>Na onafia, Nene meleba helea ado. Aulune, kegele Nahe gilifea digimesi mesu ogomo, haulu. I amo, Na gine kilele saabia digimesi ofelesu ogomo, abeelu. Aulugulu, gilihe Ne i abeelu amo, gine kilele saabia digifia, daaba ligia, Nafea dawalofia, Ne sulu sisa melale. Ausihe, gine <char style="w">asigine libo</char> halemane misiyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 11:29-30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Sabada hilia dabalu mololaleba muguli ufulu amone Yesu fadaba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maga 2.23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Lugu 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Lo 23.25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hilia uleno, <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.1</char> Yudane <char style="fq" closed="false">Sabada hilia </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo seale hilia Kaabe. Mosese muguli elo ofelesia, Sabada hilia ami dabalu mololaleba saaba ufulu.</char></note> adesi, Yesuda ili desi widi gelu aleba dedaleba ligia, ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> mamiasi, ili <char style="w" lemma="Widi">desi widi sebe</char> noolo suba nalabia dedaleba alolu. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Kis 20.10</ref></char></note>Auba molofe bafasia, <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo ilihe Yesufea doba bisigia, “Bama. Godene mugulihe Sabada hilia elo ofelesia, mana ewe molomabiyoba solugulu, Ge walelu faibili auba molose ogo, enesi aufe?”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1Sml 21.1-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba selesi, Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Amakele <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidida</char>, e galiba sibaisaloda, ili amo mamiasi, kegele mololumone sadalu amo, gili alegalualela? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:5-9">Wkp 24.5-9</ref></char></note>Fogo amoyamo, Deibidi e Godene molo usu sugafia, <char style="w">boledi</char> Godene olegia diba ufia adomo, e difasia, ene eda, e galiba sibaisalo amoda, ili mololu. Boledi amo, <char style="w">soba melo inolo</char> ilisu namenesi, inolo baluhe namenabiyoba muguli elo ufulu. Aulugulu, Deibidi auba naasihe, muguli molomabiyolu gelelu. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:9-10">Nam 28.9-10</ref></char></note>Aufia, <char style="w">muguli</char> bugo selelu dobu sulu eweda, gili alegalualela? Soba melo inolohe, Sabada hilia <char style="w">sebele molo</char> usu dabalu moloba labene, Sabada hilia ami dabalu molomabiyoba muguli elo ufulumo gelefeso, ili heleba daalu male. <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:41-42">Mad 12.41-42</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, na gilifea selesu, labe ewe E-mo, sebele molo wasolu labe. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hos 6.6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:13">Mad 9.13</ref></char></note>Godene bugo eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 12:7" />
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:7">
    <char style="qt">‘Gilihe Nafea soba mefemo, Na hamefale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:7">
    <char style="qt">Aubale. Gilihe <char style="w">kanululo</char> mana molomesi, Na hamefe.’</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 12:7" />
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:7">Gilihe auba selelu dobumo nafuluba asigilubiaga, gilihe inolo heleba daaluda male amofea egedidisi osolabaiyale. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Maumo, <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibehe</char>, Sabada hilia amone yasilo labe. Aulugulu, hilia amimo, molomabada, molomabiyobada saeyomo, yasilo ene dabalu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sabada hilia ami Yesuhe inolo sone kakaloba dulumo waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maga 3.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Lugu 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Auba safasia, Yesuda ili abia, ine <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molosu</char> suga daalu. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:3">Lug 14.3</ref></char></note>Inolo uleno ene sone kakaloba dulu ami asulu. Inolo noolo Yesu sefia egedidifia godoyone mau isasia, ilihe efea doba bisigia, “<char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> ami dabalu molomabiyoba muguli elo ufulu. Aulugulu, walefa inolo waiba ufiyomo, muguli mana geleyobafela?”<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 14:5">Lug 14.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba selesi, Yesu ilifea selesia, “Gili aleba ugi, <char style="w">dofene sibi</char> uleno labego, Sabada hilia amohe gogolu uleno gelebaisenaga, amo gahe gasiba diba lagoyobafalela? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Auluso, inolohe dofene sibi wasolu koleba! Aulugulu, Sabada hiliamo mana nafulu moloyomo muguli gelefale.”<verse eid="MAT 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Auba saafia, E sone wolu inolo amofea selesia, “Ge sone ogo isoma.” Ausi, e sone isosia, sone nafulu isolu nolobalogulu alolu. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:16">Yon 5.16</ref></char></note>Auluso, <char style="w">Falisi</char> ilimo degefia, molo amo afasia daafia, gagaiyofia, Yesu dufiyone eno isaba sulu mumuguba nenelu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E Godene dabalu mololo molobebelelu inolo koleba labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15-16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.15-16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 8:4">Mad 8.4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:12">Mag 3.12</ref></char>
    </note>Falisi ili auba daiyafeba hilisefia, Yesu E amifia nolobalo elaba aasi, idele inolo wedinalemo E kuliba milibailu. Ausi, Ehe ine walefalumo sunia waiba waalefasia, E ilifea E amobuba samabiyoba kaaba solu. <verse eid="MAT 12:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Auba mololumo, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Aisaia">Aisaiahe</char> solumone wakalimesine aulu. Aisaiahe eweguba solu.<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.18-21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:1-4">Ais 42.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mad 3.17</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">“Ewe Ne dabalu mololo inolo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">
    <char style="qt">Nene Nahe e molobebelelu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">
    <char style="qt">Nahe e bule koleba hamesefia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">
    <char style="qt">Ne asigihe efea bule koleba henebu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">
    <char style="qt">Nahe Ne Asubanemo efea gadefasi,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">
    <char style="qt">ehe helefealu idele inolo mosomu suniafea isoba ofolo amone waleyobafe.</char><verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />
    <char style="qt">Ehe hegeba halaleba koleba saeyobafale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">
    <char style="qt">Idele inolo ilihe e eno kia sulu wuaaba selaba labi dubiyobafale.</char><verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />
    <char style="qt">Gabaiya kiwidale adefemo, ehe sunia olaboba dafiyobafale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, ehe naafa fufuneba waiyafemo, usuba dafiyobafale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">
    <char style="qt">Ehe auba dabalu molobasu ligia, isoba ofolo manamo kaamo melesi moloyobafe.</char><verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />
    <char style="qt">Ausi, helefealu idele inolo mosomu sunia ilihe, Efea henefia asigi ule ofasia, Ehe ili sagoba homesi <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofelagofia yasiyobafe</char>.”</char><verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilihe Yesumo Besebulune kiwigagalu alefasia dabalu molofeba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maga 3.20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Lugu 11.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Ausi, fogo amoyamo, ilihe inolo uleno <char style="w" lemma="Gamodo">gamododa</char> alolumo Yesu labea lubia mulu. Inolo amo e si kalalu ligia, suluda sodale. Ausi, Yesuhe e waiba ofelesi, nafuluba bebelesia, sulu solu. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Ausi, idele inolo sunia momoleba hidigiba yaafia selesia, “Inolo auba molofe ewe, <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> Faibebile?” <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mad 9.34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10.25</ref></char></note>Auluso, <char style="w">Falisi</char> ilihe sulu amo dofasia selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Gamodo">Gamodone</char> yasilo <char style="w">Besebulu</char> amosu alefasia, inolo ogo gamodo asigaba yaafe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Auluso, Yesuhe ili asigifemo bafasia, ilifea selesia, “Mosomu uleno ine meleba aidaba osolafia yobosenaga, amo bidiba dafelesia, hodobaiyobafe. Aufia, yasiba ado uleno ine meleba aidaba osolafia yobosenaga, ili amo kiwigaafia kaalu gaeyobafale. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Aulugulu, <char style="w">Sedene</char> ehe ene dabalu mololo koleba asigaba yaasenaga, amo nini hilisesia, ene mosomu osolaba dafalilu dobu. Ausenaga, halaguba e yasifia miliyobafebi?<verse eid="MAT 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Gili aleba ami, inolo noolohe gamodo asigafe. Aufia, gilihe Na-mo seale Besebulu alefasia gamodo asigafeba selesenaga, amo ilida Besebulu alefasia asigabaiyo? Aulugulu, sulu gine selefe ogohe, gili fadaasia osolafia, isolualebuba waleyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:38">HD 10.38</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:8">1Yon 3.8</ref></char></note>Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane</char> alefasia Nafea kiwi mesi, Nahe gamodo asigaba yaasu. Ausimo, gili eweguba hilisema. Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo gili labea mulu labe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />Aufia, Yesuhe besi sulu saabia eweguba solu. “Inolo ulenohe, inolo kiwidane molo usu ami suga daafia, molo biso amo dofabale, ene kegelemo eneba fa diyobi? Aubale. Ehe molo biso kiwida amodale, efolo dofafasia, moloa kegele dobumo ami fa dilo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.29</char> Besi sulu ewene mau eweguba: Molo biso kiwida amo henane iminife. Aufia, besi sulu iwi, fadilo inolo amo Yesu iminife.</note><verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mag 9.40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:50">Lug 9.50</ref></char>
    </note>Inolo Ne dameneale labemo, Nadai gisa adefe. Uleno abehe, Nadai idele inolo gagaiyoba ufiyone dabalu molosalenaga, amo ehe ilimo dusuba dafalife. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:4-6">Hib 6.4-6</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, Na gilifea selesu, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> suniada, gaidaboba soaneba sulu solu suniada, Godehe hamasia, heesia galiyobafe. Auluso, inolo abehe Asubane Noekene amofea saaba gaidabosia, soaneba selesenaga, Godehe ene wolu amo heesia galiyobafale. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Inolohe, <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibefea</char> sulu woba selefemo, Godehe ene wolumo <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galiyobafe</char>. Auluso, inolohe <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemofea</char> sulu woba selefemo, Godehe ene wolumo agada, dufiada, heesia galiyobafale.”<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">I wolumo sebe wolu helelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Lugu 6.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mad 7.16-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu selesia, “I nafulunaga, amo ene sebeda nafulusu helelo. Aufia, i wolunaga, ene sebeda wolusu helelo. I eloba babiyonemo, inolohe ene sebe helebufea eloba bolo. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Mad 3.7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:18">15.18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Lug 3.7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:45">6.45</ref></char></note>Aiyanene edo, gili! Wolu ligia, sulu nafulu gili halaguba saeyodolubi? Idele inolone asigifeafia wasigaalu dobu hamagulu, ine mofeohe saaba dafelagolo. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Inolo nafulumo, ene libo usu asigi nafulusu wedinale wasigaalu dobi, mana nafulusu dibia holobagaba ado. Inolo wolumo ene libo usu asigi wolusu wedinale wasigaalu dobi, mana wolusu dibia holobagaba ado. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Auluso, na gilifea selesu, osolaeyo hilia adesimo, idele inolo ilihe ine sulu sunia heleba selaba yaalu amone, Godefea ulufaba saaba meyo dobu. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Maumo, ge sulu ogo alefasia, Godehe ga isolu inoloba saeyobafe. Aufia, ge sulu ogo alefasia, Ehe ga godosia osolaeyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolo noolohe Yesufea momolelu kegele molomesi doba abulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Maga 8.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Lugu 11.29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:1">Mad 16.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Lug 11.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:30">Yon 6.30</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, <char style="w">muguli manane dawalolu inolo</char> nooloda, <char style="w">Falisi</char> nooloda, ilihe Yesufea selesia, “Walelo, ninihe Ga Godefea alefasia dabalu molofelaba eloba babiyo hamefe. Aulugulu, Ga <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> uleno ninifea walema.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:4">Mad 16.4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mag 8.12</ref></char>
    </note>Ili auba selesi, Ehe obegeba selesia, “Godefea faisoda melo mosomu gili, eloba bamesine momolelu kegele walemafebu! Auluso, momolelu kegele uleno gilifea waleyobafale. Aubale. <char style="w">Saaba ofolo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Yona">Yonafea</char> holobagalu amosu, gilihe eloba bamesine, gilifea waleyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 1:17">Jna 1.17</ref></char></note> Enebamo, <char style="qt">Yona e-mo, hilia osoloa, nigili osoloa, hani aiyeelu bule amone ilimili usu asulu </char> amogubasu, <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> Eda, hilia osoloa, nigili osoloa, hele usu miliyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:5">Jna 3.5</ref></char></note>Osolaeyo hilia adesimo, Ninifa sidi inolo ilihe, godo dobolefea ami yoba ligia, gilifea fadaasia, osolaeyobafe. Mau enebamo, Ninifa idele inolo ilihe Yona mana walelumo sigiba dofasia, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besilu</char>. Auluso, aga iwi labe E-mo, Yona wasolu labe. Ausi, gilihe mana E walefemo, sigiba dofasia, asigi besiluale.<verse eid="MAT 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.42 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1Kin 10.1-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Osolaeyo hilia adesimo, hele Siba amone kuwini, ehe godo dobolefea ami yoba ligia, mosomu aga labe ewefea fadaasia, ilimo osolaeyobafe. Mau enebamo, kuwini ido amo e, hele hago amifia inigia, <char style="w" lemma="Solomono">Solomonone</char> asigilo nafulu selefe amo dubiyone mulu. Auluso, Solomonoda wasolu E-mo, aga iwi labe. Ausi, gilihe sulu E selefemo dubiyo habofe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nafuluba, asubane wolu asigaba dafulumo saabia obegeba anosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Lugu 11.24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43-44" />Yesuhe sulu saabia selesia, “<char style="w">Asubane wolu</char> ulenohe inolo uleno gadefia abia, isale hele falaiya daafia ami siba ligia, halemane misiyone fogo isafeso, besabalene e selesia, ‘Na abia, molo nada samini gadefia muluiya ami, obegeba maiyobasu.’ Aufia, inigia goasia, bosolufalumo, molomo sawaba dafasia, misiyone madenelu dobi besabe. <verse eid="MAT 12:43-44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 2:20">2Fid 2.20</ref></char></note>Auba madeneba dobi bisigia, e daafia, asubane domoba noolo, e wolu mololomo wasolu ili amo, uluba difasia, ilidai obegeba inigia, molo amo suga daafia, ami yoba kakainabu. Saminimo, inolo amo asubane wolu ule ligia, nafuluba asuluale. Auluso, agamo, asubane wolu aaiyoba ligiane, e saabemo, wolune wolu koleba saabe. Idele inolo wolu aga iwi alebaibu ewe, ilifeada mana aubasu moloyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesune enaedai elewodali amo abe?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maga 3.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Lugu 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yesuhe idele inolo wamili amofea sulu aso saaba meba labi, ene enaeda, ene elewodalida, edai sulu saeyo hamefia milibaifasia, baea yoba alebailu. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Ausi, inolo uleno Efea selesia, “Doma. Ge gaeda, ge gelewodalida, ili baea yoba ligia gadai sulu saeyo hamefe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Ausi, Yesuhe inolo amone sulu obegeba selesia, “Ne nae ogo abe? Aufia, ne nelewodali ogo abe?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Aufia, Ehe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> sone binibo gagafia selesia, “Ne naedai, ne nelewodalimo, ili ewe bama. <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:29">Lom 8.29</ref></char></note>Enebamo, ideleda inoloda Nao <char style="w">hebene</char> labemone hame kuliba aafe ili amo, ne nelewodalida, ne nanodalida, ne naeda, ili amo labe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe widi sebe fifilumone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maga 4.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Lugu 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Hilia hamagayamo, Yesu E molo amo afasia, baea daafia abia, waiyo galubu amone egewi yoba asulu. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Lug 5.1-3</ref></char></note>Ausi, idele inolo wamili wedinale E labea milibaifia, gagaiyoba, E amaleba galisi, E hano kasu ulenomo aleba lagofia, yoba aselesi, idele inolo sunia saii saabia yoba alebailu.<verse eid="MAT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea kegele wedinale besi sulusu walelu. E selesia, “Doma. Inolo uleno geiya widi sebe fifiyone daalu. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />E fifilabia aasi, widi sebe noolomo eno kia hodobaisasi, haga milibaifasia diba mololu. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Ausi, widi sebe noolomo, hele abane feaba dobia ami hodobaisalu. Hele amo gafinilualene, widi sebe amo alebale soboba yaalu. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Auluso, halo holobagafia neesimo, widi amo seme sugalualene sunia sasefia bausoba yaalu. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Ausi, widi sebe noolomo didigane aleba hodobaisalu. Didiganedai, wididai, aalifaba sobosia, didiganehe widimo mabulabia felaba yaalu. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Auluso, widi sebe noolomo hele nafuluiya hodobaisalumo, sebe helelelu. Noolomo daabulubasu daabuluba helelelu, aufia noolomo daabulubasu kaabeba helelelu. Aufia, noolomo daabulubasu osoloa helelelu. <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Konenida ga, sulu ewe doma!” <figure style="fig" alt="Farmer plants seed" file="IB04136.tif" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="13.1-9">Inolo uleno widi sebe fifiba labe.</figure><verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E besi sulu solumo, E mau ene asigifia solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maga 4.10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Lugu 8.9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Dufia <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ilimo E labea milibaisia, doba bisigia, “Enebane Gahe idele inolo ilifea besi sulusu selese?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Ausi, Yesu E obegeba selesia, “Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone sulu mau mugusilu ufulu amo, Godehe gili waagi dawaloba dimesi gadefabuso, ili noolofea waleluale. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:29">Mad 25.29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mag 4.25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Lug 8.18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">19.26</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, inolo abehe kegeleda sefia labemo, efea saabia noolo gegoaba mesi, e wedinale seba ligia wasigaeyobafe. Auluso, inolo kegele sebale labemo, kegele wedino e sebumo amoda, e amofea sagoba diyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Na ilifea besi sulusu sodo amone mau ewe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 13:13" />
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:13">‘Ine si beaba labeso, ilihe kegele uleno besabale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:13">Ine koneni dobolaba labeso, ili dobelesiale asigiba difale.’<verse eid="MAT 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.14-15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Ais 6.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:40">Yon 12.40</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 28:26-27">HD 28.26-27</ref></char>
    </note>Saaba ofolo <char style="w" lemma="Aisaia">Aisaiahe</char> sulu eweguba solu amone ilifea wakalilu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 13:14" />
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">
    <char style="qt">‘Gilihe dobolabasu miliyobafeso, mau asigiba diyobafale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">
    <char style="qt">Gili beabasu miliyobafeso, kegele uleno babiyobafale.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />
    <char style="qt">Maumo, mosomu ewe ine libomo kolefia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="qt">ine konenihe sulu dubiyo habosia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="qt">ine si sisuguba yaalu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="qt">Auluso, ine sihe kegele bisigia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="qt">ine konenihe suluda dobelesia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="qt">ine asigine libomo sulu amo asigiba disia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="qt">ili Nafealo obegeba miyone nolosiabiaga,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="qt">Na ili waiba waalebaiyo.’</char><verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:23-24">Lug 10.23-24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, gine si besabe ogomo, henelo wasigafia labe. Aufia, gine koneni dobelefe ogomo, henelo wasigafia labe. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Na seale gilifea selesu, samini <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> wedinaleda, aufia, isolu inolo wedinaleda, ilihe kegele gili aga besabe ogo, babaiyeba hameluso, ili abuluale. Aufia, sulu gili aga dobelefe ogo, ilihe dobaiyeba hameluso, ili dubuluale.”<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Desi widine besi sulu solumone mau ewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maga 4.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Lugu 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Aga inolo widi sebe edo geiya fifilumone besi sulu amone maumo selesu ewe doma. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Inolo abehe Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone awalu sulu nafulumo dobelefeso, amone mau asigiba difale, e-mo widi sebe eno kia fifilu amogulu ado. Enebamo, Sedene inigia, sulu ene asigine libo gelu dobumo, fa duguba dibia ano. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Aufia, widi sebe noolomo, hele abane fealu dobia hodobaisalu amogulumo, inolohe Godene sulu mana dobelesia, alebale heneba dilo. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Auluso, e seme daalualene, e fogo wedino koleba ado. Enebamo, ehe Godene sulu sigiba dubulu amone higinilu disenaga, me inolo noolo anogohe efea woba ofelesenaga, ene asigi ule ufulumo alebale gelebailo.<verse eid="MAT 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 12:16-21">Lug 12.16-21</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:9-10">1Dim 6.9-10</ref>, <ref loc="1TI 6:17">17</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, widi sebe noolomo didigane aleba hodobaisalu amogulu labe. Eda sulu doboloso, helefealune kegele keleba asigiloda, elebeda ufulu alebaiyeba hame degeloda, kegele nokene nokene hamebaiyesia mesegeloda, mana amohe Godene sulu mana mabulabia felasi, sebe helelelale. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Auluso, widi sebe noolomo, hele nafuluiya hodobaisalu amogulumo, inolohe sulu sigiba dofasia, amone sisamo fadaba asigiba dilo. Amo e sebe helelesiamo, noolomo daabulubasu daabuluba, noolomo daabulubasu kaabeba, noolomo daabulubasu osoloa helelelo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gisi wolu geiya holobagalu amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yesuhe ilifea besi sulu no eweguba solu. “Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amomo, ewegulu labe. Inolo ulenohe ene geiya widi sebe nafulu fifilu. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Auluso, fififasia, ili sunia nigiliba fufunalofia labi fogomo, inolo amone gisa inigia, ehe gisi sebe wolumo <char style="w">widi</char> aleba fififia daalu. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Dufia ami, widi sobofasia, saa gaasi, gisi wolu amoda ua sobosi eloba abulu.<verse eid="MAT 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">dabalu mololo faibilimo</char> gelu enao labea daafia, ilihe efea selesia, ‘<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, gahe widi sebe nafulusu ge geiya fifilula? Gisi wolu ewe wagifia mulune holobagafebi?’<verse eid="MAT 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Ausi, ehe ilifea selesia, ‘Gisa uleno mololubu.’ Ausi, ene dabalu mololo faibilihe efea doba bisigia selesia, ‘Nini daafia, gisi wolu amo duguba dafalimesi hamefela?’<verse eid="MAT 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Auluso, ehe ilifea selesia, ‘Aubale. Gili gisi wolu dugulesiamo, widida dugulosi. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Aubale. Gilihe aalifaba waagi sobomesi gadefafia ligia, sebe susia bamale. Aufia, sebe suiyo fogo adesimo, nahe suiyo inolo ilifea eweguba molomaleyobasu. “Gilihe maugaba gisi wolumo dugufasia, de gamemesi dofaba waalemale. Auluso, gilihe widi amo gagaiyofia, ne naiyo ofolo moloa ami diba waalemale.”’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maseda sebe amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maga 4.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Lugu 13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yesuhe besi sulu no ilifea eweguba solu. “Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amo, maseda sebe amogulu ado. Inolo ulenohe maseda sebe uleno difasia ene geiya gelu. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Maseda sebe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">13.32</char> <char style="fq" closed="false">Maseda sebe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo wedino kewalo sebe amogulu.</char></note> amo naiyo sebe noologuluale. Aubale. Amo wedideno koleba. Auluso, e sobofasia edo gelu noolo labemo suniasia, igulu adesi, anakiwine haga milibaifasia, i amone odo dedalelu saabia, ine molo ami diaba yaafe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Falawada bulelo yisi amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Lugu 13.20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yesuhe besi sulu saabia no ilifea eweguba solu. “Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amomo, falawada bulelo <char style="w" lemma="Yisi">yisigulu</char> labe. Ido ulenohe yisi wedino difasia, falawa amodai besifasia, habanelo. Aufia, dufia ami falawa amo sunia bolesia, bulelu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe besi sulusu idele inolofea solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Maga 4.33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Sulu Yesuhe idele inolofea solu amo sunia besi sulusu solu. Besi sulu saabale, E ilifea kegele uleno soluale. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Sng 78.2</ref></char></note>Ausihe, samini <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> uleno sulu eweguba solu amo wakaliba hugalu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 13:35" />
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">
    <char style="qt">“Sulu selesiamo, Na gilifea besi sulu saeyobasu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">
    <char style="qt">Helefealuda maugaiya amifia, muguba walelu kegele amo Na awaeyobasu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gisi wolune besi sulu amone mau fadaba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Aufia, Yesuhe idele inolo wamili gadefia, e molo usu sugalu. Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> E labea milifasia, Efea selesia, “Gahe gisi wolu amone besi sulu solumo, ninifea fadaba saamaleyobile?”<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Inolo widi sebe nafulu fifilo amo, e <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char>. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Aufia, geiya amo, helefealu ewe. Aufia, widi sebe amo, Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone faibili. Aufia, gisi wolu amo, Wolu Mololone faibili. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Gisi woluda fifilu gisa inolo amo, e <char style="w">henane</char>. Naiyoda sebe suiyo fogo amogulumo, helefealu eweda aleba eloyo hilia amo. Sebeda suiyo inolo ili amo, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> labe.<verse eid="MAT 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 15:6">Yon 15.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gisi woluda dugufasia, de sobolo amogubamo, helefealu eweda aleba eloyo hilia adesi, aubasu moloyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:31">Mad 24.31</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:31">25.31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:27">Mag 13.27</ref></char></note>Inololene Faibehe Ene sulu dia ano hilibaisasimo, ilihe Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami gisi alosia, wolu molomesi moloba ofolo kegele suniada, wolu moloba ado ili suniada, duguba dafaliyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Mad 8.12</ref></char></note>Aufia, ilihe ilimo dibia de bule waiyaba labemo dafogoyobafe. De aleba amimo, ili bese hegelesia, yegiliba ligia, kudumaneba miliyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:3">Dan 12.3</ref></char></note>Fogo amomo, <char style="w">isolu galagololu</char> idele inolo ilimo, ine Enao Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada usu amimo, halo neeloguba neeyobafe. Konenida ga, doma!”<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo beleme samologulu ligia, kegele sunia noolo wasolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo, beleme samolo uleno hele usu muguba ufulu amogulu dobu. Inolo ulenohe hele ami inigia, samolo amo baaba golefia, haiba saabia muguba ufulu. E samolo amo dibaiyeba koleba hilisesia, kegele sunia e selumo elegeba samodofia, mole amo difasia dibia abia, hele samoloda muguba ufulu dobu amo elegeyone daalu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amo bagegulu ligia, kegele sunia noolo wasolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />Yesuhe sulu saabia selesia, “Besi sulu nomo ewe, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo, bisinesi inolo ulenohe bage yogolelusu elegeyone isalo amogulu. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Aufia, ehe bage uleno nafulu, kegele bule elegeyodolumo abulu. E bage amo dibaiyeba koleba hilisesia, kegele sunia e selumo, elegeba samodofia, mole amo difasia, bage yogolelu amo elegelu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Selegene besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Besi sulu nomo eweguba. Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amo, selege uleno ilihe waiyo galuba ufulu dafogosi, hani nokene nokeneba dilo amogulu. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Selege wasigaasi, hanida dilo ilihe sigifasia, hano egewi ufulu. Aufia, ili yoba kakainafia, hani nafulumo fofo seba gaaba yaalu. Auluso, hani wolumo ilihe saidafalilu. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Helefealu eweda aleba eloyobafea ami, amogulu miliyobafe. <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">Godene sulu dia ano</char> milibaifasia, ilihe isolu inolo aleba ami, wolu inolo alolumo osolaba dafaliyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:42">Mad 13.42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Lug 13.28</ref></char></note>Aufia, ilihe ilimo dibia, de bule waiyaba labemo dafogoyobafe. De aleba amimo, ili bese hegelesia, yegiliba ligia, kudumaneba miliyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Aufia, Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea doba bisigia, “Sulu ewe suniane sisamo gili fadaba hilisefela?” Ausi, ili Efea eeba solu.<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Ausi, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Aulune, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu inolomo</char>, Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili adefe</char> ili amo, molo biso amogulu labe. Biso amo, ene ofola amifia, samolo hilida, amakeleluda, dibia holobagaba yaalo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nasalede ilihe Yesufea faiso melu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maga 6.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Lugu 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Yesuhe besi sulu auba saaba samodoba yaafia, e hele amo afasia daalu. <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:15">Yon 7.15</ref></char></note>Aufia, E Ene mosomu helea daafia, <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> usu suga daafia, idele inolo ilifea Godene sulu mana maugaba walelu. Ilihe Ene sulu amo dofasia, ili momoleba hidigiba yaafia selesia, “Dawaloloda, <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> molomesine kiwida, wagi ufulu difasia, inolo ogo molofebi? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:42">Yon 6.42</ref></char></note>Inolo ogo, molo dilone faibealela? Ene enae <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[1]], Yesune enae">Malia-alela</char>? Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[3]], Yemese Bugoda selelumo, amo e">Yemeseda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[3]], ene wi no Yosese">Yosebeda</char>, Saimonoda, <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[2]], Yudasa bugoda selelumo, e">Yudasada</char>, ili amo Ene elewodali-alela? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Aufia, Ene enanodali sunia nini galiba labalela? Aulune, inolo ogo kegele ewe wagi ufulu difebi?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.57 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Yon 4.44</ref></char></note>Ili auba saafia, Efea waaselaba hiliselu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Auluso, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Saaba ofolo">Saaba ofolomo</char> hele nolobalomo wida adoso, ene mosomuleda, ene moloa kolebada, e amimo widale ado.”<verse eid="MAT 13:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Ilihe asigi ule ufulualene, E hele amimo momolelu kegele wedinale mololuale.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Hano Gelo Yone gifogolo gelelumone awalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maga 6.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Lugu 3.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1-2" />Fogo amoyamo, kini <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[2]], Adibasa">Helodo</char> ehe, Yesu mololu amone sulu gi saaba sigisi dubulune, ehe ene dabalu mololo inolofea selesia, “Inolo ogo <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Hano Gelo Yonebu</char>. E olalumo degelubu. Aulune, e kiwigaafia, <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> molofebu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3-4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.3-4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:16">Wkp 18.16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:21">20.21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Lug 3.19-20</ref></char>
    </note>Hano Gelo Yone olalumone sadalu eweguba. Saminimo, Helodohe ene elewo Filibine eamono Helodiasa sagoba dulune, Yone efea selesia, “Ga gelewone ido fa sagoba dulu ogo, gahe molomabiyolu sulu muguli gelelububa” solubiyo. Auba selesi, Helodiasafea alefasia, Helodohe Yone sefia, seini dofafasia, dibolo dafogolubiyo. <verse eid="MAT 14:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:26">Mad 21.26</ref></char></note>Aufia, Helodohe Yone dufa olaeyo hameluso, e idele inolo baaba sagililubiyo. Maumo, ilihe Yonemo <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> uleno labebuba hiliselubiyo.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Helodo e seba dulumone henelo sigilo hilia adesi, Helodiasane elewelimo milifasia, inolo ami gagaiyolu si saabia aulo ululu. Ausi, Helodohe e aulo udefemo bisigia, e bule koleba hamelu. <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />Aufia, Helodohe ido buda amofea eweguba <char style="w" lemma="Aiiba sodo">aiiba</char> saaba ofelesia, “Amene kegele sunia, ga nafea haalife amo, na gafea meyo.” <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Auba selesi, ene enaehe asigi efea mesi, ido buda amohe Helodofea selesia, “Aga yagi, Hano Gelo Yonene guni gelefasia, fofo saabia ofasia, nafea memale.” <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9-10" />Kinihe sulu amo dofasia, ene asigi higinilu. Auluso, ehe aiiba saaba ufulumone asigisia, idele inolo ami kakainalu amone si saabia yualosiba hiliselu. Aulune, ehe yobolo inolo noolofea selesia, “Ido buda amo soluguba molomale. Gili dibolo moloa daafia, Yonene gifogolo geleyo malaba” solu. <verse eid="MAT 14:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Ausi, ilihe ene gunimo fofo saabia dibia milifasia, ido buda amofea melu. Ausi, ehe ene enae labea dibia daalu. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Ausi, Yone ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilimo</char> milibaifasia, ene domalamo dia abia baliba ufulu. Baliba ofasia ili abia, Yesufea saeyo daalu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe idele inolo wamili saii biafea naiyo melu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:31-44">Maga 6.31-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Lugu 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-13">Yone 6.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Ilihe Yone dufa olaluba selefemo dofasia, Yesu E elebisu hano kasu aleba lagofasia abia, inoloda maleiya heeba dulu helea ami daalu. Auluso, idele inolo wamilimohe Yesu daaluba solumo dofasia, ilida dauno amifia hele aiba abia, E kuliba daalu. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Ausi, Yesu E ami goasia, bosolufalumo, idele inolo wamilimo ami labi abulu. Aufia, Ehe ili yagunagafia, ine walefalumo waiba waalelu.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Geidesihe, <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ili Yesu labea milifasia, selesia, “Iwi inoloda maleiya helegulu, naiyoda nabale hilia samodofe. Aulugulu, Ga idele inolo wamili ogo, mosomu nolobalo hele aniba ami, naiyo ine naiyone elegemesi dedalemamaba” solu.<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Auluso, Yesuhe walelu faibili ilifea selesia, “Eneyone ili dedalemayo? Gilihe ilifea naiyo namenesi memale.”<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Ausi, ilihe Efea selesia, “Nini <char style="w">boledi</char> bia, hani aida, amosu sebu.” <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Ausi, E selesia, “Boledi ogoda, hanida, Na labea dia mila.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:35-39">Mad 15.35-39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:6-10">Mag 8.6-10</ref></char></note>Aufasia, Yesuhe idele inolo ili amo gisi saabia kakainamaba solu. Aufasia, Ehe boledi bia amoda, hani aida amoda, difasia, <char style="w">hebene</char> baaba lagofia Godefea henelu sulu solu. Aufia, Ehe boledi amo sunia gogolefia, Ene walelu faibilifea mesi, ilihe idele inolofea sagaba yaalu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Ausi, idele inolo sunia nabaisia, kubaleba yaalu. Aufasia, naiyo haisimo afelesi, walelu faibili ilihe molafia, fofo huguluba wasigafasia, diba walelu. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Naiyoda mololu ili amo, inolo daosene bia (5,000) amogulu. Inolo amosu alegalu. Ideleda, faibeda, ili naiyo mololuso, ili amo alegaluale.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu hano saabia emo emelalabia mulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maga 6.45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:16-21">Yone 6.16-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Aufia, alebale koleba Yesuhe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilimo</char> hano kasu aleba lagofia, waiyo galulu nolobalo anogolo ilidale samini malalelu. Aufia, Ehe idele inolo wamilimo ine helea dedalemalelu. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23-24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.23-24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:12">Lug 6.12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28">9.28</ref></char></note>Ehe idele inolo dedalemalefia, E elebi Godedai sulu saeyone hele gale fela daalu. Aufasia, nigililabia sugasi, E elebisu galea ami labi, hano kasumo waiyo galulu dogolea daaba alolu. Ausi, fufulo inigia, hano kasu mi haumo dowesi, hanohe kasumo iluwalu.<verse eid="MAT 14:23-24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25-26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.25-26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 24:37">Lug 24.37</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba labi, hiliaeyo hagoalesi, Yesu E waiyo galulu saabia emo emelalabia, Ene walelu faibili labea goayo aasi, ilihe E hano saabia miliba labi bisigia, ili kiwi bibilisia, sagilisia, wobasubale galagilisia, “Ogo iladalo ulenomobu-oooba” solu.<verse eid="MAT 14:25-26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Auluso, alebale hamagi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Gili kolefia mela. Ewe Na, gili sagilimabu.” <verse eid="MAT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidahe</char> selesia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char> amo Ga-naga, na hano saabia waagi Ga labea milama!”<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29-30" />Auba selesi, Yesu E selesia, “Ga mila.” Ausi, Fida e hano kasu asulumo, sugaba ilogofia, hano saabia emo emelalabia Yesu labea daalu. Auluso, fufulo dowefemo bisigia, sagililune, e hano usu ulubailabia sugasi, galagiliba selesia, “Saminilo, na gasiba diba lagoma!”<verse eid="MAT 14:29-30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 8:26">Mad 8.26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:39">Mag 4.39</ref></char>
    </note>Alebale hamagi, Yesune sonehe Fida sefia, gasiba diba lagofasia, selesia, “Ga asigi ule ufulu wedinobu. Enesi ga asigi aida ofelese?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Ausi, aalu hano kasu aleba lagosi, fufulomo gelelu. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Ausi, hano kasu saabia asulu ilimo, Yesufea gulugulusia selesia, “Seale koleba, ga Godene Faibebuba solu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe hele Genesalede ami walefalu wedinale waiba waalelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maga 6.53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Yesudai, Ene walelu faibili ilidai, hano kasuhe waiyo galuba ufulumo segefia, hele Genesalede ami goafia kalugaalu. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Inolo ami kakainalu ili amohe, Yesu eloba bafasia, ilihe mosomu aniba dobu amo suniafea, sulu saaba sigisi, idele inolohe ine walefalu sunia E labea lubia milibailu. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:20-21">Mad 9.20-21</ref></char></note>Aufasia, ilihe Yesufea selesia, walefalu ili Ene fagulo haisi amosu sone gemesiba susiba solu. Ausi, auba geba golu ili amo, sunia waiba yaalu.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Godene sulu mugulihe nauwadaline sulu wasolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Maga 7.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Fogo amoyamohe, <char style="w">Falisi</char> nooloda, <char style="w">muguli manane dawalolu inolo</char> nooloda, ili Yelusalamefia Yesu labea milibaifia, Efea doba bisigia, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Ge <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ogo, nine nauwane mana ufuluguba gelefia, sone nuguma heebale naiyo naafe ogo, mau ene?”<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Gine mana ogonesu kuliba abia, gine gilihe Godene sulu muguli gelelo ogo, mau ene? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kis 20.12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 21:17">21.17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Lo 5.16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Wkp 20.9</ref></char></note>Enebamo, Gode eweguba solu. <char style="qt">‘Gaedai gaodai sisa alefasia, aine sulu nafuluba kuliba malale.</char> Aufia, <char style="qt">enaedai enaodaifea sowaneba selefe inolo amo, e olaeyo dobu.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5-6" />Auluso, gilihe molomalelu sulu amone gegoaba eweguba sodobiyo. Inolo ulenohe, enaedai enaodaifea selesia, ‘Na kegele ewe aalifea sagoba ofelesia mebaiyoso, na kegele amo Godefea ulu meyone iminiba ufuluba’ selesenaga, amo gili Falisi selesia, ‘Amo nafulu, sulu e auba iminiba selefe amomo, enaedai enaodai aine sisa melaleba sulu muguli amone afelesia, e kegele amo aalufea meyodolumone afelefe.’ Gili auba soluso, Na gilifea eweguba selesu. Gili gine gauwadaline mana bulebuba hilisesia, auba molofemo, Godene Sulu Muguli waaselaba bisigia, dufa dafogoba ado. <verse eid="MAT 15:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Masega gegelo, gili! <char style="w" lemma="Aisaia">Aisaiahe</char> gine mana ogone iminiba saaba ofelesiamo, e seale koleba isoba solubu. Sulu amo ewe.<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.8-9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 29:13">Ais 29.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">‘Idele inolo ili ewemo Ne wi digiba selesiamo, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">
    <char style="qt">mofe balu selesiaso, ine asigine libomo Nadai hago ado.</char><verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />
    <char style="qt">Ili walesiamo, inolone molomalelu sulu amosu walelogulu,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">
    <char style="qt">ili Nafea balu guluguluba ado.’ ”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolofea nuguma baalo kegele amone Yesu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Maga 7.14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Aufia, Yesuhe idele inolo wamilimo E labea milibaimafia, ilifea selesia, “Gili dobelesia nafuluba asigima. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Mad 12.34</ref></char></note>Inolone mofeo kegele sugafe amohe, inolo nugumaba ofolale. Aubale. Ene mofeofeafia kegele holobagaba dafelagofe amohe, e nugumaba ofolo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Auba selesi, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> E labea milibaifasia, Efea wanesia selesia, “<char style="w">Falisi</char> ilimo Ga sulu selefe amo dofasia, ili waaselaba dobelesia kanolumo, Ga hilisebula?” <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Ausi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Edo gelu aleba ami, Ne Naohe geluale amo sunia, seme wagada duguba dafaliyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:39">Lug 6.39</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:19">Lom 2.19</ref></char></note>Ili waagima. Ili gasiba selo si kalalu labe. Si kalalu ulenohe, si kalalu no gasiba sefia, eno walesenaga, amo aalu aalifaba gogolu ami gelebaisaeyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidahe</char> Yesufea doba bisigia, “Besi sulu solu amone maumo, ninifea fadaba saama.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Ausi, Yesu E selesia, “Gili wagada, aso asigiba dibale elela? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Mofe kegele sugafe amo sunia, ilimili sugafasia, aufia domalafea holobagaba daafia ano. Gili amo asigibualela? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Auluso, mofeofeafia holobagaba dafelagofe kegele amo, inolone asigifeafia holobagalo. Kegele amohe inolo nugumaba ofolo. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19-20" />Enebamo, inolone asigifea alefasia holobagalo kegele amo, ewe. Asigi woba hiliseloda, inolo dufa olaloda, ido fa diloda, susugu nokene nokeneba mololoda, masega godoloda, soaneba sododa.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 15:19-20">Mana ewehe, inolo Godene si saabia nugumaba ofolo. Auluso, sone nuguma heebale ligia, naiyo naafe amohe, inolo nugumaba ofolale.”<verse eid="MAT 15:19-20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kainani ido ehe Yesufea asigi ule koleba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maga 7.24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Aufia, Yesuda ili amifia abia, Daila sididai, Saidono sididai, fogoba asuluiya ami maiyo daalu. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Aufia, Kainani ido uleno mosomu ami alolumo, e milifasia wuaaba selesia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> Faibe, Ga koleba na yagunagama! Ne neleweli <char style="w">gamodo</char> felafia, wobasubale weiyaaba labe.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Auluso, Yesuhe sulu uleno efea obegeba soluale. Ausi, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> Efea koleba selesia, “Ido ogo nini kuliba inigia, wuaalabia saabegulu, Ga efea afa malaba saama.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:6">Mad 10.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesuhe obegeba selesia, “Godehe Na hilibailumo, <char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaelene</char> <char style="w">dofene sibi</char> daba dafalilu ili amosu sagoba ufiyone hilibaisi, na mulu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Auluso, ido amohe emo hugulumo sagafia, helea sauba hanefia selesia, “Saminilo, Ga koleba na sagoba homa!”<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Ausi, Yesuhe efea obegeba selesia, “Ninihe faibene naiyomo difasia, gesodalifea saidafogoyo amo isoluale.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Auluso, ido amo selesia, “Saminilo, ga seale koleba selefeso, geso ilimo, enaone ailalu sisa naiyo sao hodobaisalumo, ilihe keleba nolo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Yesuhe sulu amone dofasia obegeba selesia, “Ido, ge <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> amo bule kolebabu. Kegele ga haalife ogomo, moloyobafe.” Amo fogo hamagi koleba, ene eleweli amo wailu.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe walefalu wedinale waiba waalelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Aufasia, Yesu E hele amo afasia abia, Galili waiyo galubu amone egewi aniba amolo daalu. Aufasia, E hele gale fela dafasia yoba asulu. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Ausi, idele inolo wamili wedinale E labea milibaisia, ilihe emo woba yaaluda, si kalaba yaaluda, kiwi koageba yaaluda, mofe kakaba yaaluda, aufia walefaba yaalu wedinaleda, Yesu labea lubia milibaifasia, Ene emo aniba diba waalesi, Ehe ili amo waiba waalelu. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 7:37">Mag 7.37</ref></char></note>Ausi, mofe kakaba yaalumo sulu selesi, kiwi koageba yaalumo isosi, emo woba yaalumo dedalesi, si kalaba yaalu ilimo bebeleba yaalu. Auba mololu baafia, idele inolo ilihe momoleba hidigifia, <char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaelene</char> Gode wabialeba solu.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe inolo wamili saii binibafea naiyo melu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maga 8.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:14">Mad 14.14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesuhe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> E labea milibaimafasia, ilifea selesia, “Nahe idele inolo ili ewe yagunagafe. Ili ewe Nadai ligia, hilia osoloa alolune, ilimo naiyoda male adefe. Ili kiwi sanesia, eno aiba gelebaisaba yaalosi, ilimo mamiafia labi, Nahe ili dedalemaleyo hamefale.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Ene walelu faibili ilihe Efea obegeba selesia, “Iwi inoloda maleiya helegulu, nini idele inolo wamili ewegulumo <char style="w">boledi</char> ili liliba namenesimo, wagi ufulu difasia meyobi?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea wanesia, “Gilihe boledi halagia sebu?” Ausi, ilihe selesia, “Ninihe boledi domobafia, hani weidesine bulale sebu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Auba selesi, Yesuhe idele inolo ili hele saabia yoba kakainamaba solu. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Aufia, Ehe boledi domobada, hanida, difasia, Godefea henelu sulu safasia, boledi gogolefia, Ene walelu faibilifea mesi, ili difasia idele inolofea sagalu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Ili sunia nafasia kubalelu. Aufasia, naiyo haisimo afelesi, walelu faibili ilihe molafia, fofo domoba wasigafasia diba walelu. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Naiyoda mololu ili amo, inolo daosene biniba (4,000) amogulu. Ideleda, faibeda, ili alegaluale. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Aufia, Yesuhe idele inolo wamilimo dedalemalefia, E hano kasu aleba lagofia Magadana fealomo daalu.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Ilihe Yesufea momolelu kegele molomesi doba abulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Maga 8.11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Lugu 12.54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mad 12.38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Lug 11.16</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Falisi">Falisida</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Sadiyusi">Sadiyusida</char>, ili Yesu labea milibaifasia, ilihe E dedeba bisigia selesia, “Ninihe Ga Godefea alefasia dabalu molofelaba eloba bamesine, Ga koleba <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> ninifea walemaba” solu.<verse eid="MAT 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Auluso, Ehe ine sulu obegeba selesia, “Geide adesimo, gilihe anakiwi genefe baafia, hilia nafulu miliyobuba sodo. <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Aufia, keafamo kene yabusi, anakiwi genefe baafia, gilihe fufulodai, heledai, hilia aga ewe miyobafebuba sodo. Ee, gilihe anakiwi lago molofe eloba baafia, nafuluba osolalobu. Auluso, gilihe fogo aga ewemo eloba baafia, nafuluba osolaeyodolualebu. <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Mad 12.39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Lug 11.29</ref></char></note>Godefea faisoda melo mosomu gili, eloba bamesine momolelu kegele walemafebu! Auluso, momolelu kegele uleno gilifea waleyobafale. Aubale. Saaba ofolo <char style="w" lemma="Yona">Yonafea</char> holobagalu amosu, gilihe eloba bamesine, gilifea waleyobafe.” Auba safasia, Yesuhe ili gadefia daalu.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Falisidai, Sadiyusidaine, boledi bulelo yisi amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Maga 8.14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">Walelu faibili</char> ilihe <char style="w">boledi</char> seyomo galifia, Yesuda ili waiyo galulu nolobalo hano kasu segefia daalu. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Lug 12.1</ref></char></note>Aufia, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Nafuluba, gili <char style="w" lemma="Falisi">Falisidai</char> <char style="w" lemma="Sadiyusi">Sadiyusidai</char>, ine <char style="w" lemma="Yisi">yisimo</char> baaba nafuluba yasifia melale.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Auba selesi, walelu faibili ili ine geleba nenefia selesia, “Ninihe boledi dibia mulualemone, E sulu ewe selefebu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yesuhe ili nenefemone hilisefia, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Asigi ule ufulu wedino dobu, gili! Boledi malebamo, gine geleba eneyone selese? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:17-21">Mad 14.17-21</ref></char></note>Gili aso fadaba asigiba difalela? Boledi bia amomo, inolo saii biamo (5,000) mololumo gili nafuluba asigiba obegefalela? Aufia, fofo halagia, gili fofaba waalelu? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:34-38">Mad 15.34-38</ref></char></note>Aufia, boledi domoba amomo inolo saii binibamo (4,000) mololumoda, gili amoda asigiba obegefalela? Aufia, fogo ami gilihe fofo halagia fofaba waalelu? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Nahe boledi amone selesia selefalebubamo, gili asigiba difalego, enesi ause? Auluso, gilifea selesu amo ewe. Falisidai, Sadiyusidai, ine yisi amone baaba nafuluba yasimale.” <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Aufia, sulu amo dofasia, ili asigiba disia, Ehe yisi boledifea ofolo amone yasimesifia soluale. Aubale. E solumo, Falisidai, Sadiyusidai, ili sulu walelo amone koleba yasimesifia solu.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fidahe Yesu amobuba ulufaba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Maga 8.27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Lugu 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yesu E fogoba asulu Sisalia Filibai ami goasia, Ehe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> doba bisigia, “Idele inolo ilihe, <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> abebuba selefe?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:1-2">Mad 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-15">Mag 6.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-8">Lug 9.7-8</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, ili obegeba selesia, “Noolo selesiamo, Ga <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Hano Gelo Yonebuba</char> selesi, noolo selesiamo, Ga Elaiyabuba selesi, noolo selesiamo, Ga <char style="w" lemma="Yelemaia">Yelemaia</char>, me <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> ulenomobuba selaba yaafe.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea doba bisigia, “Gili kolebamo, Na abebuba selese?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:69">Yon 6.69</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char> <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidahe</char> obegeba selesia, “Ga <char style="w">Keliso</char>,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">16.16</char> <char style="fq" closed="false">Keliso</char><char style="ft" closed="false">, wi amone sisamo, Godehe Ene dabalu molomesine iminifia molobebelelu inolo.</char></note> Gode bebeada saabene Faibe, Ga koleba.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 1:15-16">Gal 1.15-16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, Yesuhe Fida selefe amone obegeba selesia, “Yonane faibe, Saimono, ge henelo wasigafia labe. Helefealu inolo uleno sulu ewe gafea ulufaba walelualeso, Ne Nao <char style="w">hebene</char> labe amo E-su, ewe gafea ulufaba walelu. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:42">Yon 1.42</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:20">Efe 2.20</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, Nahe gafea eweguba selesu, Ga Fida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">16.18</char> <char style="fq" closed="false">Fida</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ne wi amone Giligi suluba sisamo, abane baliama.</char></note> Aufia, Nahe Ne <char style="w" lemma="Sese">sesemo</char> abane baliama ewe saabia diba ufiyo. Aufia, Olalone kiwigagaluhe sese amo dufa dafogoyobafale. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:18">Mad 18.18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Yon 20.23</ref></char></note>Aufia, Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone giimo, gafea meyobasu. Helefealu iwi ga kaafe amo sunia, Godehe hebene lagida aubasu kaeyobafe. Aufia, helefealu iwi ga sogofe amo sunia, Godehe hebene lagida aubasu sogoyobafe.” <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Auba safasia, Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea E Kelisobuba ulenofea samesiale haguguba solu.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E olafia haiba degeyoba saaba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Maga 8.31–9.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Lugu 9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Fogo amifia, Yesuhe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> eweguba fadaba saaba meyone maugalu. E Yelusalame ami dafasia, guni inoloda, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu inoloda</char>, ine sone saabia E naga wedinale naiyo dobuba saaba melu. Aufia, ilihe E dufa olaeyobafe. Aufia, hilia osoloa alefasia, E <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeyobafeba</char> solu.<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidahe</char> sulu amo dofasia, ehe Yesu anibalo lubia daafia, Efea gadiba selesia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, auba auyale koleba! Kegele ewe koleba, Gafea holobagaeyobafale.”<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Ausi, Yesu E nolofia, Fidafea selesia, “<char style="w">Sedene</char>, ga Na faisalo mala. Gahe Na walemesi kani helefe. Ga Godene asigi kuliba abiale, inolone asigisu kuliba aafe.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mad 10.38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Lug 14.27</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea selesia, “Inolo ulenohe Na kuliba miyo hamesenaga, ene hamemo dufa dafogofia, ene <char style="w">imolane</char> ene digifia, e koleba Na kuliba milale. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mad 10.39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Lug 17.33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yon 12.25</ref></char></note>Enebamo, uleno abehe, ene miliyolu fedoba seyo hamesenaga, amo ene miliyolu daba dafiyobafe. Auluso, inolo abehe Ne wi saabia ene miliyolumo weasesenaga, amo e seale miliyolu diyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:8-9">Mad 4.8-9</ref></char></note>Maumo, inolo ulenohe helefealune kegele sunia difasia sefia ligia, ene miliyolumo woba dafelesia, daba dafelesenaga, kegele sunia e dulu amohe, e halaguba sagoba ufiyobafebi? Inolo amohe ene miliyolu obegeba diyone, su amenegulu suluba meyo dobubi? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Mad 25.31</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Sng 62.12</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:12">Snd 24.12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Lom 2.6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:12">MUU 22.12</ref></char></note><char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> Enaone yane <char style="w">elalelu</char> usu amifia, Ene sulu dia anodalidai inigiamo, Ehe idele inolo sunia, mana ili mololuguba, ilifea elebe sabe meyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Na seale gilifea selesu, inolo noolo aga iwi labemo, aso olabale ligia, ilihe Inololene Faibemo kini alefasia saabemo babiyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesune domalamo noekene elalesi abulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maga 9.2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Lugu 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Hilia kaabeba alefasia, Yesuhe <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidada</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]], Sebedine faibe">Yemeseda</char>, ene elewo <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yoneda</char>, ili lubia abia, hele gale uleno ana digiba lagolumo, ilibisu felafia ami alolu. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:16-18">2Fid 1.16-18</ref></char></note>Aufia, ilihe sidafia ligia, bosolufalumo, Yesune domalamo nokene koleba dedegesi abulu. Aufia, Ene olegimo halogulu neeba dowesia, Ene fagulomo yanegulu hoolu holobagasi abulu. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Auba beaba labi, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Moseseda</char>, Elaiyada, aalu holobagafia, Yesudai sulu sugaba alolu.<verse eid="MAT 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Fidahe amo bisigia, Yesufea selesia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, nini iwi lolu ewemo nafulubu. Aulugulu, Ga hamesenaga, amo nahe hisuba misiyone molo wedino osoloa iwi diyoba. Ulenomo Ge, aufia ulenomo Mosesene, aufia ulenomo Elaiyane.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sng 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Ais 42.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mad 3.17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mag 1.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Lug 3.22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:15">Lo 18.15</ref></char>
    </note>Fida e sulu aso selaba labi, kene hoolu elalelu inigia, ili gasiagulu. Aufia, kene amofeafia sulu goo uleno selesia, “Ewe ne Naalo, E Ne yaguso koleba! Na Efea bule koleba henesu. Gilihe E selefemo domale.”<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">Walelu faibili</char> ili sulu goo amo dobelesia, ili bule sagilisia, hele saabia sauba haneba yaasia, ine olegi muguba waalelu. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Aufia, Yesu E inigia, ili gesia selesia, “Sagilimabu, gili degema.” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Aufia, ili baaba lagosia, bosolufalumo, ilihe inolo no bisigiale, Yesu E-su abulu.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Aufia, ili hele galeafia huga inigiamo, Yesuhe ilifea koleba selesia, “Gili aga abulumo, inolo ulenofea aso awaba memabiyo. Auba awabale abia, <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> olafasia, <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba ifofia</char> labi eloyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Ausi, Ene walelu faibili ilihe Efea doba bisigia, “<char style="w">Muguli manane dawalolu inolo</char> ilihe selesia, ‘Elaiya edale miyobafeba’ sodomo, mau enene auba sodo?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Ausi, Ehe obegeba selesia, “Sulu ewe seale koleba, Elaiya e kegele sunia isoba haiba momoloyone miyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mad 11.14</ref></char></note>Auluso, na gilifea selesu, Elaiya e mulu aloluso, inolo ilihe e eloba abuluale. Aubale. Ine hamefeguba kuliba abiane, ilihe mana efea nokene nokeneba mololuso. Aufia, ilihe Inololene Faibefeada mana aubasu moloyobafe.” <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:17">Lug 1.17</ref></char></note>Yesuhe auba selesi, Ene walelu faibili ili asigisia, Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Hano Gelo Yonemone</char> selefebuba hiliselu.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe faibe ule gamododa alolu waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Maga 9.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-42">Lugu 9.37-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14-15" />Yesuda Ene walelu faibili osoloada, ili huga milifasia, idele inolo wamili labea goasi, inolo uleno Yesu labea inigia, Efea emo hugulumo sagafia selesia, “Saminilo, Ga koleba, ne faibemo yagunagaba homa. E kagoaba ligia, ene domalamo woba dafulu dobu. Aufia, fogo wedinale e de sugaeyo, me hano gelebaiyoba ado. <verse eid="MAT 17:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Ausi, nahe e-mo ge <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> ulubia muluso, ilihe e waiba ufiale adeso.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Ausi, Yesu selesia, “Asigi ule ufuluale, heleba ano mosomu, gili! Na gilifea habofia ligia, aso fogo halaguba waagi gilidai miliyobi? Na gili gadefia daabale ligia, fogo halaguba aso miliyobi? Faibe ogo na labea iwi lubia mila.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Aufia, Yesuhe <char style="w">gamodo</char> amo asigasia, malaba selesi, e faibe amo gadefia aasi, alebale hamagi ene walefamo wailu.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:1">Mad 10.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Ene walelu faibili ilibisu Yesu labea milibaifasia, doba bisigia selesia, “Gamodo amo, ninihe asigaeyodoluale amo, enesi aulubi?” <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20-21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.20-21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:21">Mad 21.21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:23">Mag 11.23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:6">Lug 17.6</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1Kld 13.2</ref></char></note>Ausi, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Gine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> ogo abobofene, gili moloyale adefebu. Na seale koleba gilifea selesu, Gine asigi ule ufulumo maseda sebegulu wedino dobunaga, amo isobu. Ausenaga, gilihe hele gale ewefea selesia, ga iwifia gigilifia anogolo malasenaga, amo e gigiliba maiyobafe. Aufia, gilihe dabalu uleno moloyodolualemo, male koleba.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.20-21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dawalolo inolo noolo hilisesia, sulu haisi no hii ewe dobumo eweguba. <char style="it">Gamodo amogulu aisasiamo, naiyo aiyafia Godedai sulu selesisu, holobagaba daafia maiyobafe.</char> (Maga 9.29 ami bamale.) </char></note><verse eid="MAT 17:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe sulu aganebo saabia selesia, E olafia haiba degeyoba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maga 9.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Lugu 9.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22-23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17.22-23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mad 16.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesuda, Ene walelu faibilida, ili Galili ami siba ligia, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> holonofia, inolone sone saabia ofelesi, ilihe e dufa olafasia labi, E hilia osolomo <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degefia</char>, bebea miliyobafe.” Walelu faibili ili sulu amo dofasia, ine libo higinilu koleba.<verse eid="MAT 17:22-23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe sebele molone dagese ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 30:13">Kis 30.13</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 38:26">38.26</ref></char>
    </note>Dufia, Yesuda, Ene walelu faibilida, daafia, Kafanima dauno ami goafia, sebele molone dagese dilo inolo <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> labea milifasia, doba bisigia, “Gine walelo ogohe, sebele molone dagese mole dalagema iso aida ofolaba adalela?” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">17.24</char> <char style="fq" closed="false">Dalagema </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo, Isolaelene mole iso. Hilia ule dabalu molofasiamo, dalagema mole iso amone, ule dilo. Inolo seba dulu hamu daabuluba aidafia lagolomo, ili ule uleba, hamu ulene sebele molone dagese dalagema aida ofolo.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Ausi, Fida selesia, “Aa, E ofolaba adoba” solu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Aufia, Fida e molosu sugasia, sulu aso saabale labi, Yesu Edale efea doba bisigia selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char>, ga eneba hilisefe. Helefealu ewene kini ilihe, dagesemo abefea dilo? Ilihe ine faibilifea dilola, me inolo noolofea dilola?” <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Ausi, Fida selesia, “Inolo noolofea dilo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Ausi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Aulugulu, kinine faibili kolebahe, dagese ofelesiale beega labe. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Auluso, ilihe anifea waaselaba bolosi, ga waiyo galuiya daafia, gima dafogomale. Aufia, hani maugaba ga sigifemo amo difasia, ene mofe sogasimo, gahe mole dalagema iso ule biniba alolumo usu ami dobi babiyobafe. Ga mole iso amo difasia, ge dageseda, Ne dageseda, aalifaba homesi, ilifea memale.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamone wi bule koleba amo abe?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maga 9.33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Lugu 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Lug 22.24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fogo amoyamo, <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ili Yesu labea milibaifasia, ili Efea doba bisigia selesia, “Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone wida kolebamo, abe?”<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2-3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.2-3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 19:14">Mad 19.14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:15">Mag 10.15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:17">Lug 18.17</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, Ehe faibedeno uleno milafasia, faibe amo ili olea yoba melafia selesia, “Na seale koleba gilifea selesu, gili dedegefia, faibe deseinegulu adesalenaga, amo gili Godehe Yasiba Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada usu ami faseba sugaeyobafale. <verse eid="MAT 18:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Aulugulu, faibe ewegulu ligia, ene meleba helea adefe inolomo, amo e Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami wida koleba labe. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus and children" file="IB04116.tif" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="18.1-5">Faibe deseine ilimo Yesudai labe.</figure><verse eid="MAT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mad 10.40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Lug 10.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yon 13.20</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, uleno abehe, Ne wi saabia, faibe deseine ewegulu heneba luba disenaga, amo ehe Na heneba luba dife.”<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mana woluhe asigi ule ufulu woba ofolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maga 9.42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Lugu 17.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Inolo ulenohe faibe deseine ewegulu Nafea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumo</char>, wolu molomesi sigisenaga, amo ilihe sabesia, ene dogaeyofea abane baliama godaifia, e waiyo galulu gifiamesi dafogosiabiaga, amo nafulu koleba babaiye.<verse eid="MAT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Yeele! Helefealu iwi, mana wolu mololofea walemesi kani waagi helelebu. Auluso, inolo kanida helefe amofea woba ufiyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:29-30">Mad 5.29-30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, ge sonehe, me ge emohe, wolu molomesi ga sigisenaga, amo gahe ogo geleba damale. Ga soneda, emoda, aida labi, ilihe ga de usulalemo saidafogosenaga, amo wolu koleba. Auluso, ga soneda, emoda, maualu ligia, <char style="w">miliyolu miliyo</char> disenaga, amo heda koleba. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Aufia, ge si ogohe ga wolu molomesi sigiba dibia aasenaga, amo gahe ogo duguba damale. Ga si aida labi, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Heli">heline</char> de ami dafogosenaga, amo wolu koleba. Auluso, ga si ulesu ligia miliyolu miliyo disenaga, amo heda koleba.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10-11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.10-11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 1:14">Hib 1.14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:10">Lug 19.10</ref></char>
    </note>Gili nafuluba bamale. Gilihe faibe deseine uleno ili aleba ewehe, eleda malebusia, efea golaba bamabiyo. Aubale. Na gilifea selesu, <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> ili amohe, faibe deseine sagoba homesine, hilia sunia ne Nao hebene labe amone olegi beabasu ado.” <verse eid="MAT 18:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dofene sibi daba dafulu amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Lugu 15.3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Gilihe eneba hilisebu? Inolo ulenohe <char style="w">dofene sibi</char> daabulubasu daabuluba (100) ligia, uleno daba dafelesia asigilesenaga, ehe amo isalalela? Aubale. Ehe dofene sibi daabuluba agofolobafia haiba agofolobamo (99) hele galefealo ami waagi gadefafia, ehe dofene sibi ule daba dafulu amo isaeyo ano. <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Na seale koleba gilifea selesu, e dofene sibi amo baaba golesiamo, e bule koleba henelo. Daba dafuluale dofene sibi daabulubasu agofolobafia agofolobamo, e heneloso, ehe dofene sibi ule daba dafulu obegeba disiamo, ene henelomo bule koleba ado. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Mana aubasu gine Gao <char style="w">hebene</char> labe Ehe, faibe deseine ili ewegulu, uleno daba damesi hamebuale.”<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Damene wolu mololu amone isoyone mana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 17:3">Lug 17.3</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 6:1">Gal 6.1</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Ge damenehe gafea molosenaga, amo gahe e labea daafia, aalibisu ligia ami, gahe e heleba mololu amo, ene fadaba bamesi saamale. Ausi, ehe ga selefe dobelesenaga, amo gahe ge damene amo gasiba obegeba dulu. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Lo 19.15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:17">Yon 8.17</ref></char></note>Auluso, ehe ge sulu dobelesalenaga, amo inolo noolo ilida, sulu aali isofe amo si bamesine, <char style="qt">ga inolo aida, me inolo osoloa wefia, ga galiba abia, saabia e labea malale.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Auluso, ehe ine suluda dubiyo habosenaga, amo gahe <char style="w" lemma="Sese">sesefea</char> ene heleba mololumo ulufaba saamale. Aufia, ehe sese amone sulu amoda dubiyo habosenaga, amo gahe efea mana molosiamo, yau inolofeada, dagese dilo inolofeada, molologuba molomale.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:19">Mad 16.19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Yon 20.23</ref></char>
    </note>Na seale koleba gilifea selesu, helefealu iwi gili dofafe amo sunia, Godehe <char style="w">hebene</char> lagida aubasu dofaeyobafe. Aufia, helefealu iwi gili fisigafe amo sunia, hebene lagida aubasu fisigalu miliyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 11:24">Mag 11.24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:7">Yon 15.7</ref></char>
    </note>Na saabia gilifea selesu, helefealu iwi, inolo aidahe kegele uleno haaliyone hilise ule ofelesia, Godedai sulu selesenaga, amo Ne Nao hebene labe amo Ehe, aalifea meyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Enebamo, inolo aida, me inolo osoloahe, Ne wi saabia alefasia gagaiyosenaga, amo Nene Na ilidai ami lolu.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Damene no woba molofe heesia galiyone mana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> e Yesu labea inigia, doba bisigia selesia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, ne damenehe nafea wolu molosi, nahe ene wolu <char style="w" lemma="Hamasia heesia galiyo">hamasia heesia galiyomo</char>, fogo halagia? Fogo domobabile?” <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:4">Lug 17.4</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Ene wolumo fogo domobasu heesia galimesi selesuale. Aubale. Na gafea eweguba selesu. Gahe ene wolu galisia, daabuluba domobasu domoba (70 x 7) hamasia heesia galiyo dobu.<verse eid="MAT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Aulugulu, doma. Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amo, kini uleno amogulu labe. Kini amohe ene <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">dabalu mololo faibilimo</char> e labea milibaimafia, dano amone ilidai isomesi hamelu. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Ehe dano ufulu amone maugaba isoba labi, ilihe inolo uleno e labea lubia mulumo, ehe kinifea mole dano dulumo, 10 miliene kina dulu. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Auluso, ehe dano amo obegeyone mole male. Ausi, kinihe ene ibolo selufea selesia, ‘Inolo amoda, ene eamonoda, ene faibilida, sefasia, ili inolo none balu dabalu moloba ofolo melesine, elegemaleba’ solu. Aufia, ine ili elegelu amoda, ine kegele sunia elegelu amoda, mole amo sunia difasia, dano dulumo duguba meyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Dabalu mololo faibe amohe, sulu ewe dofasia, e emo hugulumo sagafia, kini amofea susiba selesia, ‘Ga yagunagafia, na yasimale. Nahe dano sunia gafea dulumo, duguba obegeba meyoba.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Ausi, kinihe e yagunagafia, dano ufulumo duguba meyomo hamalesia, e sububa dafogofia malalelu.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Ausi, sububa dafogolu faibe amo, e baea daafia, edai dabalu ua mololo faibe uleno efea 10 kina amosu dano ufulumo wakalilu. Aufia, ehe faibe amo dogaeyo sefia, dedelesia efea selesia, ‘Gahe dano nafea dulumo sunia obegeba memale.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Auba selesi, dabalu ua mololo amo, emo hugulumo sagafia, inolo amofea susiba selesia, ‘Ga yagunagafia, na yasimale. Nahe dano sunia gafea dulumo, duguba obegeba meyoba.’<verse eid="MAT 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Auba selesi, nohe auba yasiyo habosia, ehe inolo amo 10 Kina dano ufulumo dibolo dafogolu. E dibolo ami ligiasu, dano obegeba mesi sububa dafogoyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Dabalu mololo faibili ili noolohe, manamo, samini 10 miliene kina danoda hamasia afolu inolo amo molofemo bafasia, ine libo wosi abia, kini amofea mololumo sunia awaba melu.<verse eid="MAT 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Ausi, kini amohe, dabalu mololo faibe amo milafia selesia, ‘Dabalu mololo faibe wolune wolu, ga! Samini, ga nafea yagu nagamaba susilune, nahe ne dano gafea ufulu amo sunia hamasia afolu. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Na ga yagunagaluguba, gahe ge dabalu ua mololo yagunagaluale ogo, enesi ause?’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mad 5.25-26</ref></char></note>Aufia, kini amo bule kanosia, e dano ufulu amo sunia duguba memesifia, naga melo inolone sone saabia diba ufulu.”<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 6:15">Mad 6.15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:25">Mag 11.25</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:32">Efe 4.32</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:13">Kol 3.13</ref></char>
    </note>Besi sulu ewe samodosia, Yesu selesia, “Amogubasu, gine libo koleba alefasia, gilihe damene none wolu mololu amo hamasia heesia galisalenaga, ne Nao <char style="w">hebene</char> labe amo Ehe, gilifea mana kini amo mololugubasu moloyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Ido dulu duguba dafolomone mana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Maga 10.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Lugu 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Yesu E sulu amo saaba samodofia, e Galili afasia abia, Yudia fogoba asulu ami sugafia, hano Yodene segeba nolobalomo daalu. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Ausi, idele inolo wamili wedinalemo E kuliba milibaisi, Ehe ine walefa ami waiba waalelu.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Ausi, <char style="w">Falisi</char> ilihe Yesu dedeba babiyofia, E labea milibaifia efea doba bisigia selesia, “Inolohe ido dulumo ene hamefeguba duguba dafiyomo isobula, me auba molomabiyolula?” <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Stt 1.27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5.2</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesuhe obegeba selesia, “Godene bugo eweguba selelu dobu amo, gili alegalualela? Sulu amo ewe, samini Godehe kegele sunia maugaba dofelesiamo, inolodai idodai mololu. <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Stt 2.24</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:31">Efe 5.31</ref></char></note>Aufia, Gode selesia, <char style="qt">‘Auba aulune, inolohe enaodai, enaedai, afasia abia, ene eamonodai kuliba ofolo. Auba ausimo, aalu domala ule miliyobafe.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Gode auba solune, aalu aida saabia no adesiale, domala ule adefe. Aulugulu, kegele Gode kuliba ufulumo, inolohe geleba damabiyo.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Lo 24.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mad 5.31</ref></char>
    </note>Auba selesi, Falisi ili obegeba selesia, “Ausenaga, mau enene <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesehe</char> sulu eweguba saaba ufulu? <char style="qt">‘Inolo ene eamono duguba dafiyo hilisesenaga, e duguba dafiyone beba selefia, idofea mesia afa malaleba saeyo dobu.’ </char>Mosesehe auba molomalelu, enebane solu?” <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Gine libo kolefia elelilo baafia, Mosesehe gine ido ogo waagi duguba damaleba solu. Auluso, samini koleba mana amo, auba ufulualebiyo. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mad 5.32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1Kld 7.10-11</ref></char></note>Na gilifea eweguba selesu, inolo uleno ene eamono, susugu mana mololuale hamaga, duguba dafasia, ido no disenaga, inolo amo e susugu mana molofe.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">Walelu faibili</char> ilihe sulu amo dofasia, Yesufea selesia, “Ainodai eamonodai aleba ami, mana amogulu dobunaga, amo nini idoda diyo mana amo afelesenaga, amo nafulubu.” <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Inolo suniahe sulu ewe diyodoluale dobu. Aubale. Godehe ilifea sulu dimesine kiwigagalu melu, ili amosu dilo. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Doma, idoda diyalemone mau nonoba dobu. Inolo noolomo, enaehe ili seba disia, ine domala woba dafulune ido dilale. Aufia, noolomo domala gelelune, ido dilale. Aufia, noolomo Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone dabalu moloyone hilisefia, ido diyaleba saaba ufulune, ido dilale. Auluso, sulu eweda diyodoluhe, diyo dobu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe faibe deseinemo E labea milibaimaba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maga 10.13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Lugu 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Fogo amo, idele inolohe Yesu ene sonehe ine faibe deseinene gunia ofasia, Godedai sulu saaba walemesi hamesia, faibe deseinemo Yesu labea lubia milibailu. Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ilihe idele inolofea halaleba selesia, faibe ulubia milibaimabusia kaalu. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:2-3">Mad 18.2-3</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesu selesia, “Faibe deseine ogo na labea waagi milibaimalema. Gilihe ili ogo kaamabu. Aubale. Maumo, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amo, inolo faibe deseine ewegulu adefe amone dobu.” <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Aufia, Ehe faibe deseine ediliba ofelesia, ene sonemo ine gunia ofasia, E amifia daalu.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elebeda ufulu inolo fisamilihe Yesudai sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maga 10.17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Lugu 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Aufia, inolo uleno Yesu labea inigia selesia, “Walelo, na mana nafulu enegulu molosi, nahe <char style="w">miliyolu miliyo</char> diyobafebi?” <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Wkp 18.5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:28">Lug 10.28</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Gahe mana nafulu amone Nafea eneyone doba bese? Ule E-su nafulu labe. Auluso, gahe miliyolu miliyo nafulu amone diyo hilisesenaga, amo Godene molomalelu sulu kuliba malale.” <verse eid="MAT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-16">Kis 20.13-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-20">Lo 5.17-20</ref></char></note>Ausi, inolo amohe Yesufea doba bisigia selesia, “Ga molomalelu sulu halane selese?” Ausi, Yesuhe selesia, “Molomalelu sulu amo ewe.</para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MAT 19:18">
    <char style="qt">Inolo dufa olamabiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MAT 19:18">
    <char style="qt">Ido fa dimabiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MAT 19:18">
    <char style="qt">Kegele fa dimabiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MAT 19:18">
    <char style="qt">No anogofea masega godomabiyo.</char><verse eid="MAT 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="li3">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kis 20.12</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Wkp 19.18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Lo 5.16-20</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">Gaedai gaodai sisa ligia, aine sulu kuliba malale.</char></para>
  <para style="li3" vid="MAT 19:19">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, gahe gene meleba hameselo amogubasu, ge damene noolo anogoda auba hamesemale.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Yesuhe auba selesi, inolo fisamili amohe Yesufea selesia, “Godehe molomalelu sulu amo, na sunia kuliba abia mololo. Auluso, na aso amene malebu?” <verse eid="MAT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Ausi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Ga inolo isolu koleba miliyo hilisesenaga, amo ga abia, ge kegele dobu ogo sunia elegeba samodofia, mole ga dife amo weagulufea memale. Ga auba molosenaga, gahe kegele nafulu koleba <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi ge samolo diba ufiyobafe. Auba molofasia, ga Na kuliba milale.” <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Sulu amo dofasia, inolo fisamili amo, ene libo higinifia, afa daalu. Maumo, e elebe wedinale koleba ufulune aulu.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Ausi, Yesuhe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> selesia, “Na seale koleba gilifea selesu. Elebeda ufulu inolo ilimo Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada sugaeyomo, kolelu koleba dobu. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Na gilifea saabia koleba selesu, kelebulu hagolu bule, <char style="w" lemma="Kamele">kamelemo</char>, asogolo aleba eno sugaeyomo lilibula? Lilibuale. Amogubasu, elebeda ufulu inolo uleno, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami, sugaeyomo kolelune kolelu koleba.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Walelu faibili ilihe sulu amo dofasia, ili wobasubale hidigifia selesia, “Amo aulunaga, abe <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba dulu</char> miliyobafebi?” <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 42:2">Jop 42.2</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesuhe ili sidafia selesia, “Inolo moloyodolualeso, Godehe kegele sunia liliba moloyodolu dobu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />E auba selesi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidahe</char> sulu E selefemo obegeba selesia, “Bama. Nini Ga kuliba milibaisia, kegele sunia afasia milibailugulu, ninifeamo amene diba ufiyobafe?” <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Mad 25.31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:30">Lug 22.30</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:21">MUU 3.21</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Na gilifea seale koleba selesu. Kegele sunia hili momoloyobafe fogo ami, <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> ene asefalu ailalu <char style="w">elalelu</char> saabia aselesi, Nada kuliba milibailu amo, gilida, asefalu ailalu hugulubamo saabia yoba sigia, <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomu hugulubamo yasiba miliyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Aufia, idele inolo sunia na hilisesia, moloda, elewodalida, enanodalida, enaedalida, enaodalida, faibilida, edo geluda, afalilu labe amo, ilihe kegele amo haiba saabia suniaba, daabulubasu daabuluba (100) diaba yaeyobafe. Aufia, ilihe miliyolu miliyo nafulu amoda diyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:16">Mad 20.16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Lug 13.30</ref></char></note>Auluso, inolo wedinale aga olaibo ligia, samini labe ili amo, dufia ili dufialo ligia, sia miliyobafe. Aufia, inolo wedinale aga sia ligia, dufialo labe ili amo, dufia samini ligia, olaibo miliyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Waini geiya dabalu mololo amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Ili olaibo miliyobafeba solu amone mau ewe, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amo, inolo ule heleda biso labe amogulu. Keafale koleba e elegela helea daafia, dabalu mololo faibili ene <char style="w">waini</char> edo geiya mole dabalu molomesi dulu. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Disiamo, ehe ilidai sulu ule ofelesia, ehe ili ule ulebafea, hilia amone silifa mole iso ule<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">20.2</char> Isolaele ili hilia ule dabalu molofemo, <char style="fq">silifa mole iso ule</char> dilo.</note> meyoba eelu. Aufasia, ehe ilimo ene waini edo geiya dabalu molomesi gadefalu.<verse eid="MAT 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Aufasia, halosi agofolo amogulu adesi, e daafia, bisigia, elegela helea ami inolo noolo balu alebaifia labi abulu. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Auba labi baafia, ehe ilifea selesia, ‘Gilida ne waini geiya dabalu moloyo milibaima. Dabalu samodofia labi, nahe gilifea isoba elebe meyobasu.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Auba selesi, ili milibaifasia, ene geiya ami dabalu mololu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:5">Halo dogoda, geide halosi osoloda, e haiba saabia elegela helea daafia, aubasu inolo noolo ene geiya dabalu moloyone milibaimalu. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Aufia, geide halosi bi amogulu, e abia bisigia, inolo nooloda aso balu alebaifia labi abulu. Ehe ilifea doba bisigia, ‘Gili hilia selale ewe balu alebaifia ele ogo, enesi ause?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Auba selesi, ili obegeba selesia, ‘Inolo uleno ninifea dabalu melualene aulu.’ Auba selesi, ehe ilifea selesia, ‘Gilida milibaifia, ne waini geiya dabalu moloyone milibaima.’ Auba selesi, ili ami dabalu moloyo daalu.<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:13">Wkp 19.13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:15">Lo 24.15</ref></char>
    </note>Ami dabalu moloba labi, geidesi, waini gelu bisohe dabalu molofemone yasilofea selesia, ‘Gahe dabalu mololo inolo weba gagaiyofia, ilifea elebe memale. Gahe elebe mesiamo, dufia milibailu ili amofeadale, maugaba melabia abia, samini milibailu amofea meba elomale.’<verse eid="MAT 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Ausi, inolo geide halosi bi adesi, dabalu molomesi dulumo, ilidale milibaifia, inolo ule uleba amo, silifa mole iso ule dulu. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Ausi, inolo maugaba dabalu molomesi keafale dulu, ili amo milibaisia, ili mole bule diyobafebuba hiliselu. Auluso aubale, ili wagada, silifa mole iso ule aibasu imini dulu. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Ilihe mole auba difasia, gelu bisofea gogomosia, eweguba solu. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />‘Inolo ili ogo dufia koleba milibaifia, halosi ulesu dabalu mololuso, ga elebe ninifea mesiamo, ili dulugubasu imini mefe. Auluso, ninimo keafafia hogololu dabalu mololabia inigia, halo nee nini wobasubale soba dagilu.’<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Auba selesi, bisohe ili aleba ami ulenofea obegeba selesia, ‘Damene, na gafea heleba molosuale. Gene alefasia, ani sulu ule ofelesia, silifa mole iso ule diyoba eelualela? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Ga ge elebe difasia mala. Na inolo dufia mulumoda, elebe imini ga dulugubasu meyo hilisefe. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Amo ne kegele. Ne mole ewe, nene hamefeguba osolafalebula? Na nafulu labi, ga mau enesi nafea asigi wose?’ E auba solu.” <verse eid="MAT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mad 19.30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mag 10.31</ref></char></note>Yesu sadalu amo samodosia selesia, “Amogubasu inolo ili dufialo koleba labemo, samini miliyobafe. Inolo ili samini labemo, dufialo koleba miliyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe sulu osolo saabia selesia, E olafia haiba degeyoba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maga 10.32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">Lugu 18.31-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Yesu E Yelusalame maiyo felasi, ehe <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> hugulubamo eno egewifealo luba difasia, ilifea selesia, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18-19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.18-19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mad 16.21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">17.22-23</ref></char></note>“Doma. Aga nini Yelusalame fela maiyo dedalesu. Ami goasimo, <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> E-mo <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu inoloda</char>, ine sone saabia ufiyobafe. Aufia, ilihe E fadaasia, E osolaba dafelesia, dufa olamaba saeyobafe. Aufia, ilihe E <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau inolofea</char> seba meyobafe. Ausi, ili amohe Efea baaba gaidesia, efolo fegofia, E <char style="w">imolane</char> udesi, olaeyobafeso, hilia osoloa alefasiamo, E <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeyobafe</char>.”<verse eid="MAT 20:18-19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sebedine faibe aidamo wi bule diyo hilisefe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maga 10.35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Dufia Sebedine faibe aida amoda, aine enaeda, ili Yesu labea mulu. Aufia, aine enae amo emo hugulumo sagaba yoba sigia, Efea kegele uleno molomaleyobileba haalilu. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mad 19.28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:30">Lug 22.30</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Yesuhe efea wanesia, “Na gafea amene molomesi hamefe?” Ausi, e Yesufea selesia, “Gahe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami, ne faibe aida ewene, nomo ge sone lilibefealo, nomo ge sone fofonaloalofealo ami yoba sigia, yasimesi waagi gadefama.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:39">Mad 26.39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:11">Yon 18.11</ref></char>
    </note>Auba selesi, Yesu selesia, “Kegele gili Nafea haalife ogo, gili mau fadaba hilisebuale. Nagamo, Nahe aga, gaabu wasulu nologuba, naiyobasumo, aalida naiyo lilibula?” Aalu selesia, “Anida naiyo lilibu.” <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yesuhe aalufea selesia, “Seale, Ne gaabu wasulumo, aalida naiyobafe. Auluso, abe Ne sone lilibefealo misiyomoda, me Ne sone fofonaloafealo misiyomoda, amo Na waagi iminiba saeyodoluale. Aubale. Ami misiyobafe amo, Godehe Ene daiyalu amonesu madeneba dobu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Walelu faibili daabuluba ili amohe, elewo aidahe Yesufea haalilu amo dofasia, ili aalufea gadilu. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:25-26">Lug 22.25-26</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesuhe ili E labea weba gagaiyofia, ilifea selesia, “Gili asigibu, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau mosomu</char> suniane yasilohe, kiwigagafia ine mosomu yasilo. Ine saminilohe kiwigaasia, idele inolo sunia koleba ine sulusu kuliba malesi gasiagufia moloba ado. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mad 23.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mag 9.35</ref></char></note>Auluso, gilimo auba moloba melabiyo. Inolo gili aleba wasolu miliyo hamesenaga, amo e gili sagoba ofa, balu gine dabalu moloba miliyo dobu. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Aufia, inolo uleno gili aleba saminiba miliyo hamesenaga, amo e-mo gine <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">balu dabalu moloba ofolo</char> miliyo dobu. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:27">Lug 22.27</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:7">Fil 2.7</ref></char></note>Aubasu, <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> Eda iwi mulumo, idele inolo ilihe E sagoba homesine muluale. Aubale. Ehe ili sagoba ufiyone inigia, Ene miliyolu weasesia, idele inolo wedinale obegeba disia, su meyone mulu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe si kalalu aida waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maga 10.46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Lugu 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Yesuda, Ene walelu faibilida, ili Yeligo dauno afasia aasi, idele inolo wedinale fuluba Yesu kuliba milibailu. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Ausi, inolo si kalalu aida eno aniba yoba sigia, aalu Yesumo suniafeba solu dofasia, wuaaba selesia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> Faibe, Ga koleba, ani yagunagama!” <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Idele inolo wamilihe aalufea halalesia, saumaba solu. Auluso, aaluhe haiba koleba wuaasia, “Saminilo-ooo! Deibidine Faibe-eee! Ga koleba ani yagunagama-aaa!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Ausi, Yesu kalugaafia milafia, aalufea wanesia, “Na aalifea eneba molomesi hamefe?” <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Aalu obegeba selesia, “Saminilo, Gahe anine si fisigaba homesi hamefe.” <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Ausi, Yesuhe aalu yagunagafia, Ene sone aine si gesi, alebale hamagi, aalu bebelelu. Aufia, aalu Yesu kuliba mulu.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesumo Saminilo kinigulu alefasia, Yelusalame suga mulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maga 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Lugu 19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yone 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1-2" />Ili auba abia, Yelusalame goayo hagoaleba adesi, Olifi galea Bedefage mosomia goalu. Ami goafia, Yesuhe <char style="w">walelu faibe</char> aida malasia, aalufea selesia, “Aali abia, mosomu anogo malale. Aali ami goasia, <char style="w">dofene dogi</char> uleno kiliseba dobi babiyobafemo, ene edo kalofo amodai labi babiyobafe. Kiliselu fisigafia, aida aalifaba Na labea lubia milale. <verse eid="MAT 21:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Inolo uleno aalifea, ‘Aali ene moloseba’ wanesenaga, amo aali koleba eweguba saamale. ‘<char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> aida ewefea dabalu moloyo dobi ausu. Molofasia, Ehe aida ewe alebale ulubia obegeyobafe.’ Aalifea wanefe amofea auba saamale.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Kegele mololu ewe amakele <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo solumone wakaliba sugamesine mololu.<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Sek 9.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">“Saiono idele inolofea sulu ewe saamale.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">21.5 </char>
      <char style="fq" closed="false">Saiono</char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe amo, Yelusalame sidi amone iminiba selefe.</char>
    </note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">
    <char style="qt">‘Bama. Gine Saminilo aga gili labea saabego.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">
    <char style="qt">E onalu inolo ligia, <char style="w">dofene dogi</char> saabia asefia saabego.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">
    <char style="qt">E dofene dogi edo kalofo saabia asefia saabego.’ ”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Ausi, walelu faibe aidamo abia, aaluhe Yesu aalufea soluguba mololu. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Aaluhe dofene dogi enaeda, edo kalofoda, E labea lubia inigiamo, aalu fagulo saligalo seselamo hufasia, dofene dogi saabia feaba ufulu. Ausi, Yesu E amo saabia asulu. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Idele inolo wamilimohe, ine fagulo saligalo seselamo hufasia, eno aiba fefeaba waalesi, noolomo samia walu gegeleba molafia, eno aiba fefeaba waalelabia milibailu. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Sng 118.25-26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 148:1">148.1</ref></char></note>Idele inolo wamili ili noolomo, Yesu sunialabia abia, noolomo E faisa dufia milibaisia, wuaalabia dedalesia selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 21:9" />
  <para style="qc" vid="MAT 21:9">
    <char style="qt">“Hosana!</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">21.9 </char>
      <char style="fq" closed="false">Hosana</char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">ba sulu sodo amone sisa: “Ene wi wabialemaba selefe”.</char>
    </note></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="MAT 21:9">
    <char style="qt">
      <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> Faibefea henesu-ooo!</char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="MAT 21:9">
    <char style="qt">Inolo ewe, Saminilone wi saabia mulugulu,</char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="MAT 21:9">
    <char style="qt">Efea wabialesia wi digimo-ooo!</char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="MAT 21:9">
    <char style="qt">Hosana! </char></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="MAT 21:9">
    <char style="qt">Ana labe lagone wi digimo-ooo!”</char> <figure style="fig" alt="Triumphal entry" file="IB04153.tif" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="21.1-11">Yesumo Saminilo kinigulu alefasia, Yelusalame suga saabe.</figure><verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Yesumo Yelusalame sugasi, sidi ami kakainalu idele inolomo hidigiba bisigia selesia, “Wae! Ewe abebi?” <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Ausi, idele inolo wamili Yesudai milibailumo selesia, “Ewe, saaba ofolo Yesumo, E Nasalede dauno Galilifia saabe-eee!”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe sebele molone yalaiya usu ami, inolo kegeleda elegesia waalelumo aiba gasalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maga 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Lugu 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yone 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Yesu E <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yalaiya usu sugafia, moleda bedoba adone ailalumoda, haga hiluda elegelone ailalumoda, besigaba dafalisia, inolo kegeleda elegesia waalelumo aiba gasaba yaalu. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Ais 56.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7.11</ref></char></note>Auba moloba ligia, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Godene bugo eweguba solu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 21:13" />
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:13">
    <char style="qt">‘Ne molomo, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu sodo</char> amone molo miliyobafe.’</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:13">
    <char style="qt">Auluso, gili alefasia molo ewe fadilo inolone muguba ado hele gadefalubu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Yesumo sebele molo yalaiya ami auba safasia labi, si kalaluda, emo woluda, ili E labea milibaisi, Ehe waiba waalelu. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Ausi, sebele molone yala usu ami, faibe deseine heneba wuaaba selesia, “Hosana! <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> Faibefea henesu-oooba” selaba alolu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:15">Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu inoloda</char>, ili faibe deseine auba selefemo dobelesia, Yesu momolelu kegele molofemo bisigia, ili kanoba abulu. <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:2">Sng 8.2</ref></char></note>Ili Yesufea wanesia, “Sulu faibe deseine selefe ogo, Ga dobelesela?” Auba selesi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Ee, na dobelesu. Auluso, gilihe sulu ewe alegalalela?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 21:16" />
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:16">
    <char style="qt">‘Gode, Ga alefasia, faibe suboboda, faibe deseineda,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:16">
    <char style="qt">amone mofeohe wabialeyone sulu Gafea saamesi gadefalu.’</char>”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Auba safasia, Ehe ili gadefia abia, sidi afasia, yaufealo Bedani mosomu goafia, nigilisi, ami hanelu.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe olono ifea kaoba selesi bausolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maga 11.12-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">11.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Keafale koleba, Yesu E sidi obegeba maiyo abia, E mamialu. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Olono i - Olono sebe">olono i</char> uleno eno aniba labi bisigia, E ami daafia, bosolufalumo, sebe ulenoda helebi abuluale. Walu balusu bafasia, ehe olono ifea selesia, “Saabia no, gahe sebe heleyobafale koleba.” Auba selesi, olono imo alebale bausolu.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">Walelu faibili</char> ili amo bisigia, wobasubale hidigiba abulu. Ili selesia, “Olono i ewe alebale bausolu ogo, enesi ause?” <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mad 17.20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:6">Lug 17.6</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1Kld 13.2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 14:12">Yon 14.12</ref></char></note>Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Na gilifea seale koleba selesu, gili seale <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesia</char>, asigi aida adesalenaga, amo manamo Na olono ifea mololu amoguba, gilida moloyodolu miliyobafe. Aufia, gili amosu moloyobafale. Aubale. Gilihe hele gale ewefea selesia, ga gene olaboba abia, waiyo hano dafogomasenaga, kegele amo gili selefeguba moloyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">Mad 7.7-11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:19">18.19</ref></char></note>Ga <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesenaga</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selesia</char> haalife amogulu, ga diyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ga kiwi dulu ogo abehe wi mesoba, ilihe Yesufea wanelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maga 11.27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Lugu 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yesuhe <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yalaiya usu sugafia, idele inolofea waleba labi, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, Isolaelene guni inoloda, ili milibaifia Efea wanesia, “Kegele Ga molofe ogo, moloyone wida solu kiwigagalu ogo, wagifia dulu? Abehe Gafea wabialelo wi mesi, Ga auba molose?” <verse eid="MAT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Nada gilifea sulu no doba babiyobasu. Gilihe Nafea obegeba selesenaga, amo Nahe wida solu halane alefasia, Na kegele ewe molosuba gilifea saaba meyo. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" /><char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yonehe</char> idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geba</char> waalelu amomo, e mana ewe wagifia dulu? <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">Hebenefia</char> molomasi mololula, me inolone hilise alefasia mololula?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Yesu auba selesi, ilihe ine geleba nenesia selesia, “Nini hebenefia molomasi mololuba selesenaga, amo E ninifea eweguba saeyobafe. ‘Gili sulu e selefemo sigidubuluale ogo, mau enesi ause?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:5">Mad 14.5</ref></char></note>Auluso, nini selesia, ‘Amo inolone kegeleba’ selesenaga, amo ninimo idele inolo baaba sagiliyo dobu. Mau enebamo, sunia hilisesia, Yone e <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Aulugulu, ilihe Yesufea obegeba selesia, “Nini babeafe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea obegeba selesia, “Amo, Nahe wi halagulu alefasia dabalu molosuba gilifeada saeyale.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Enao uleno faibe aida alolune besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />Yesuhe guni inolofeada,<char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolofeada</char>, saabia eweguba solu. “Gili eneba hilisefe? Inolo ulenohe faibe aida alolu. E abia, faibe maugaba abulumofea selesia, ‘Faibe, ga daafia, <char style="w">waini</char> geiya dabalu moloyo malaba’ solu. <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Auba selesi, faibe amo selesia, ‘Na habofe, maiyaleba’ safasiaso, dufia ene asigi dedegefasia, e daalu.<verse eid="MAT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Aufia, enao ene faibe no labea dafasia, sulu ule hamagubasu efea solu. Faibe selesia, ‘Ee, maiyoba’ safasiaso, e daaluale.<verse eid="MAT 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Aulugulu, faibe aida ewe abehe, enaone hame kuliba daalu?” Ili selesia, “Agelemo.” Ausi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Na gilifea seale koleba selesu, dagese dilo inoloda, susugu ideleda, ilihe gili suniafia abia, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami saminiba suga dedaleba labe. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:12">Lug 3.12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:29-30">7.29-30</ref></char></note>Mau enebamo, <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Hano Gelo Yone</char> gili labea mulumo, mana isolu gilifea waleyone muluso, gili e selefemo sigidubuluale. Auluso, dagese dilo inoloda, susugu ideleda, ilimo sigidubulu. Gili amo abuluso, gine asigi dedegesiale, ene sulu aso sigiba dubulualebiyo.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolo wolu ilihe waini gelu luba alolumone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maga 12.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Lugu 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1-2">Ais 5.1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu saabia selesia, “Besi sulu no ewe, gili doma! Gelu biso ulenohe, ene geiya ami <char style="w">waini</char> edo gefasia, gelu amo yalalu. Aufasia, ehe waini sebeda fasilo gogolu ami diba ufulu. Aufia, geiya ami sidafia yasifia melesine, ehe molo ana diba ufulu. Aufia, ehe gelu amo yasiba luba melesine, inolo noolo gadefalu. Aufia, e-mo hele hago daalu. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Waini sebe suiyo hilia hagoalesi, ehe ene <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">dabalu mololo faibili</char> ene waini sebe sulu amone haisi dia milesine, waini geiya hilibaisalu.<verse eid="MAT 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Auluso, gelu yasiba ado ili amohe, ene dabalu mololo faibili sefia, nomo habaea dufelesia, nomo dufa olasia, nomo abane ololu. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Auba ausi, edo gelu bisohe dabalu mololo faibili noolomo ami hilibaisalu. E ami hilibaisasiamo, samini hilibasailumone alegalu amo wasolu. Ausi, gelu yasiba ado ilihe, ilifeada mana samini mololu amogubasu mololu. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Auba ausi, dufia kadafelesia, gelu bisohe ene faibe koleba ili labea ami hilibaisia selesia, ‘Ilihe ne faibemo baaba momolesia, e sulu selefe amo dubiyobafe.’<verse eid="MAT 21:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:18">Mad 27.18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, gelu yasiba ado ilihe, ene faibe saabe baafia, ili nenesia selesia, ‘Inolo ewehe, enaone daalo sunia diyobafe. Mila, nini e dufa olasia, ene daalomo nini diyoba.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:12">Hib 13.12</ref></char></note>Aufasia, ilihe e koleba sefasia, gelu egeisialo saidafasia, e dufa olalu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Besi sulu auba saaba samodosia, Yesu selesia, “Gili eneba hilisefe, dufia waini gelu bisomohe inigia, gelu yasiba luba adomofea mana halaguba moloyobafe?” <verse eid="MAT 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Auba selesi, ilihe Efea selesia, “E alefasia, inolo wolu ogo woba dafaliyobafe. Aufia, ehe waini gelumo inolo noolofea luba melesi meyobafe. Ausi, sebe suiyo hilia adesi, ene haisi koleba amo, ilihe efea meyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.42 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Sng 118.22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:10">Mag 12.10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 4:11">HD 4.11</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:20">Efe 2.20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:33">Lom 9.33</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:6-8">1Fid 2.6-8</ref></char>
    </note>Ili auba obegeba selesi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Gilihe sulu selelu dobu ogo, alegalualela? Sulu amo ewe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 21:42" />
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="qt">Abanemo, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="qt">moloda dilo ilihe wolubusia, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="qt">waaselaba abulu amo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="qt">Aga abane amomo, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="qt">moloda kiwigaaba sefia melesine,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="qt">duguiya ikau olaibo gadefalu labe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="qt">Saminilo alefasia, auba molosimo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="qt">nine sihe momolelu bule koleba bosolu.</char><verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Aulugulu, na gilifea selesu, Gode alefasia ene Saminilo Ligia Yasifia Luba Adamo gine sone saabia dobugo, gilifea sagoba difasia, mosomu no, sebeda nafuluba heleyobafe, ili amofea meyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Inolo abane amofea siginaba gelebaisenaga, amo e kiwi nenamuba dafiyobafe. Abane amo, inolo uleno saabia hodobaisenaga, inolo amo sauba dafiyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">Soba melone guni inoloda</char>, <char style="w">Falisi</char> inoloda, Yesuhe besi selefe amo dobelesia, ili asigilu, amo ine ilifea iminiba selefe. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Aulugulu, ili Yesu seyo hameluso, ilihe idele inolo wamili baaba sagililu. Enebamo, idele inolo E <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo labebuba hiliselu.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Ido ifosia sigilo naiyo nolomone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:16-24">Lugu 14.16-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yesuhe saabia besi sulu no guni inolofea eweguba solu. <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamo, kini ulenohe ene faibe ido ifoyone sigilo naiyo madenelu amogulu. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Sigilo hilia amo adesi, ehe ene <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">dabalu mololo faibili</char> hilibaisasia, sigilo milesi saaba sagalu inolo amofea milibaimaba saeyone dedalemalu. Ili milibaimaleba solu dubuluso, ili miyo hameluale. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Ausi, ehe ene dabalu mololo faibili noolo hilibaisasia selesia, ‘Gili dedalefia, inolo sigilo milaleba saaba sagalu amofea milesine eweguba saeyo malale. “Doma, na ne naiyo madeneba dobu. Ne dofene keao dofoloda, ne kelebulu gaugagiluda, amo yasoba gaabu. Aufia, ne kegele nooloda madeneba dobugulu, gili ido ifosia naiyo naiyo milibaimale.” ’<verse eid="MAT 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Aufia, ili haiba auba saaba sagaeyone daalu. Auluso, ili sulu amo saabia dubiyo habosia, noolomo ine edo geiya aasi, noolomo ine mole diyone dabalu moloyo dedalelu. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:35">Mad 21.35</ref></char></note>Noolomo kinine dabalu mololo faibilimo seba anagolofia, ili wobasubale dufulabia abia dufa olalu. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Ausi, kini e kanosia, ene ibolo selu hilibaisafia, ilihe inolo ene dabalu mololo faibilida yasolu amo yasoba danefia, ine mosomu de subiyone dedalemalu.<verse eid="MAT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Aufia, kini ene dabalu mololo faibilifea selesia, ‘Ido ifosia sigilo naiyo naiyomo madeneba dobuso, sigilo milesi saaba sagalu inolo amo nafulualene, ilimo ne naiyo naiyomo miyone iminiluale alebaibu. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Aulugulu, gili dedalesia, eno sagafela sunia dedalefia, inolo sunia gili besabemo wefasia, ido ifosia sigilo naiyo naafemo naiyo milesi sigimale.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />E auba selesi, dabalu mololo faibili eno aiba sunia dedalefasia, inolo sunia, woluda, nafuluda, ili abulumo wafe diba gagaiyofia, lubia milibailu. Inolo sobele naiyo naiyone milibailumohe, ido ifola molo amo wasigaalu.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />Idele inolomo ami yoba kakainabi, kini e ene sobele milibailumo babiyone, molo usu sugafia, ili amo bebelesia, bosolufalumo, inolo uleno, ido ifosia fagulo nafulu kaalomo kaaluale, yoba saabi abulu. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Kini efea doba bisigia, ‘Damene, gahe ido ifosia fagulo nafulu kaalomo kaabale, suga mulu ogo, enesi ause?’ Ausi, inolo amo e sulu saeyo babealu. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Mad 8.12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25.30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Lug 13.28</ref></char></note>Aufia, kini ene dabalu mololo faibilifea selesia, ‘Gilihe inolo amone emoda, soneda, dofafia, egeisialo nigili gagaiya saidafogoyo mala. Nigili gagaiya amimo, e bese hegelesia, yegiliba ligia, kudumaneba miliyobafe.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Besi sulu ewe saaba samodofia, Yesu selesia, “Gili doma. Godehe idele inolo wedinale sigilo milesi saaba sagalu labeso, Ehe molobebelelumo, ule ulebasu labe.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ili koleba dagese mole Lomene saminilofea ufiyola, me ufiyalela?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maga 12.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Lugu 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 3:6">Mag 3.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo gadefia daafia, ilihe guni gagasia, sulu eweguba nenelu. Yesu Ene E sulu selefea ami, Ene meleba walemesisia, kani heleyone, ilihe eno isasia nenelu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">22.15</char> Ili hilisesia, ilihe Efea gegeba doba besabi, Ehe heleba obegeba selesenaga, amo E Ene meleba kani waliyobafe.</note> <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Aumesine, ilihe ine <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilida</char>, Helodo galiba ado inoloda, ili Yesu labea daafia, Efea eweguba doba babiyone malalelu. “Walelo, nini hilisesia, inolo seale sodomo Ga-ba hilisesu. Aufia, Ga seale sulu sodo amosu kuliba abia, Godene manamo idele inolofea walelo. Gahe inolo noolo sulu selefe baaba sagililalegulu, Ga sulu suniafea selesiamo, inolo widafeada, widalefeada, imini uluse sodo. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Aulugulu, Ga eneba hilisebu? Ninihe dagese mole Lomene kini <char style="w" lemma="Sisa">Sisafea</char> waagi ufiyo isolubile, me isolualebile?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Auluso, Yesuhe ine asigi wolumo fadaba baafia, e selesia, “Gili masega sodo inolo, mau enene gili na kani walemesi helese?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">22.18</char> Kani helelumo ewe. Yesuhe dagese mole Lomefea homaba selesiabiaga, Yuda inolo ili Efea gadibaiyo. Auluso, E homabiyoba selesiabiaga, Falisi ilihe E sefia Lome gamanene yasilomone sone saabia ofaiyo.</note> <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Gili dagese mole ufiyone iso ulenomo Nafea walema.” Auba selesi, ili mole iso uleno Efea walelu. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Ausi, Yesu ilifea doba bisigia selesia, “Mole ewene saabiamo, abene mimisililu labebu? Aufia, mole saabia wi selelu dobu ogo, abenebu?” <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:7">Lom 13.7</ref></char></note>Auba doba besabi, ili obegeba selesiamo, “Sisanebuba” solu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Auba selesi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Sisanemo, Sisafea mema. Godenemo, Godefea mema.” <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Auba selesi, ili E baaba hidigifia, momoleba dubulu. Aufasia, ilihe e gadefia dedalelu.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sadiyusi ilihe inolo olafia degelomone Yesudai sulu hegelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maga 12.18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Lugu 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">HD 23.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Hilia amoyamo, <char style="w">Sadiyusi</char> inolo noolo Yesu labea milibailu. Sadiyusi mosomu ili amomo, inolo danelumo <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba</char> gaalaleba sodo. Inolo ili amohe Yesufea selesia, <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Lo 25.5</ref></char></note>“Walelo, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesehe</char> ninifea eweguba molomalelu. <char style="qt">Inolo uleno e ido difasia, faibeda male ligia olasenaga, amo ene elewohe ido ilisulu amo difasia, ene elewo olalumone mosomu amo mimilosifia, faibe seba gaeyobafe.</char> Mosesehe auba molomalelu. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Aulugulu, nini aleba amimo elewodali domoba alolu. Olaibomo, ido difasia olalu. E faibedale olalugulu, e ene eamono ene elewo dimesine daalo melu. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Elewo aganebomo, eda faibedale ligia olalu. Elewo osolo, eda amogubasu mololu. Auba mololabiasu abia, elewo domo amofea elolu. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Aufia, ili sunia faibeda male daneba samodosi, kaaba dafelesiamo, ido amoda olalu. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Aulugulu, ga saama. Elewodali domoba amohe ido ule hamagane dulugulu, danelu ili amo seale haiba degeba gaasenaga, fogo ami, ido amo abene eamono koleba miliyobafebi?” Sadiyusi ilihe Yesufea auba doba abulu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">22.28</char> Sadiyusi ine sulu kiwimo ewe: Yesuhe ilidai eemesisia, inolo olalumo degelaleba saamesifia, inolo domoba olalu ewene sadalu solu.</note><verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Ili auba doba besabi, Yesuhe ilifea selesia, “Godene sulu selelu dobumoda, Godene kiwigagalumoda, gili fadaba asigibualegulu, gili sulu heleba babeaba selefe. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Daneba yaalu haiba degesiamo, inolo ido diyobafale, ido inolo maiyobafale. Aubale. Ili amo <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenene</char> sulu dia ano amogulu miliyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Aufia, inolo olafasia haiba degelofealomone, gili sulu Gode gilifea solumo alegalualebile? <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Kis 3.6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 8:11">Mad 8.11</ref></char></note>‘<char style="qt"><char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamane</char> Godeda, Aisegene Godeda, <char style="w" lemma="Yekobo">Yekobone</char> Godeda, Na lolu.</char>’ Gode E daneba yaalune Gode-ale. Aubale. E bebea alebaibumone Gode.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">22.32</char> Yesune sulu kiwimo ewe: Abalahamada, Aisegeda, Yekoboda, ili olalu osoloa amo degeyobafalebiaga, Gode Ehe “Na ine Gode loluba” sabaiyale. (Kisim Bek 3.6 ami bamale.) Aulune, gilihe ili degeyobafeba asigisia, inolo olaba yaalu sunia degeba yaeyobafeba hilisema.</note><verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Idele inolo wamilimo E sulu selefe amo dobelesia, sulu E walefemo momoleba dubulu.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Molomalelu sulu wasolu bule kolebamo ewe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-31">Maga 12.28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Lugu 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />
    <char style="w">Falisi</char> ili Yesuhe <char style="w">Sadiyusi</char> mosomumo dufa dafogoba selefe baafia, ili e labea milibailu. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35-36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35-36" />Ili aleba ami, <char style="w">muguli</char> manane dawalolo dulu inolo uleno alolu. Ehe Yesu dedeba babiyofia, Efea doba bisigia, “Walelo, muguli sulu amone molomalelu aleba ami, bule olaibo koleba, noolo wasolugo, hala?”<verse eid="MAT 22:35-36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:5">Lo 6.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu efea obegeba selesia, “<char style="qt">‘Ga koleba, ge <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Gode hamesesiamo, ge libo kolebada, ge asubane kolebada, ge asigi kolebada, E hamesemale.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Molomalelu sulu amo olaibo alefasia, wasolu koleba dobu. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Wkp 19.18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">Mad 7.12</ref></char></note>Molomalelu sulu aganebomoda, no hamagulu koleba. Amo eweguba, <char style="qt">‘Gahe gene meleba hameselo amogubasu, ge damene noolo anogoda auba hamesemale.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:10">Lom 13.10</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 5:14">Gal 5.14</ref></char></note>Sulu mugulida, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> sulu solu dobumoda, suniamo molomalelu sulu aida amofea goloba helebu.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Falisi mosomufea Keliso ogo abene faibeba doba abulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maga 12.35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Lugu 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />
    <char style="w">Falisi</char> ili gagaiyofia labi, Yesuhe ilifea doba abulu. <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:42">Yon 7.42</ref></char></note>“<char style="w">Keliso</char> amonemo, gili eneba hilisefe? E abene faibe?” Ausi, ilihe Efea selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> faibe.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Aufia, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Aulunaga, Deibidihe efea Saminiloba solu ogo, enesi aulu? Enebamo, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubanehe</char> Deibidifea asigilo mesi, e eweguba solu.<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.44 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sng 110.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:64">Mad 26.64</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">‘Saminilo Ehe, ne Saminilofea eweguba solu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <char style="qt">“Ga Ne sone lilibefealo yoba aselesiamo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <char style="qt">Na ge gisa inolomo, Ge emo sisa waalemesi yasiba mela.</char>”’ <verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Gili bama. Deibidihe Kelisofea, <char style="it">Ga ne Saminilo</char>ba selesenaga, Keliso E halaguba ene faibe miliyobi?” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">22.45</char> Yesu E Falisi ilifea eweguba saeyo hamefe. Seale, Keliso E Deibidine faibe labe. Auluso amosuale. E Deibidine Saminilo amoda labe. Aufia, E idele inolo suniane Saminilo labe.</note><verse eid="MAT 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Yesu auba selesi, inolo ulenohe Yesu sulu solumo, Efea obegeba saeyo babealu. Hilia amifia maugafia abia, ili sagilisia, Yesufea kegele uleno doba abuluale.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Falisida, muguli manane dawalolu inoloda, ilihe bamabamaba ado</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Maga 12.38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Lugu 11.43</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20.45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Aufia dufia, Yesuhe idele inolo wamilimofeada Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifeada</char> eweguba solu. <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“Bama. <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">Muguli manane dawalolu inoloda</char>, <char style="w">Falisi</char> inoloda, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesene</char> fogo alibiafebuba hilisesia, idele inolo waleba ado. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 2:7-8">Mal 2.7-8</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, sulu sunia ilihe gilifea saaba mefe ogo, amo gili koleba dofasia kuliba malale. Auluso, mana ili molofe amo, gili kuliba malabiyo. Enebamo, ili walefemo ine meleba kuliba abia mololale. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Ilihe ine muguli elo, higinilu kegelegulu, sabofia, inolone awi saabia diba waaleloso, ine ili sone gasoda amone sagoba ofelesia, digiyo hiliselale.<verse eid="MAT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 6:1">Mad 6.1</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:9">Kis 13.9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:8">Lo 6.8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 15:38-39">Nam 15.38-39</ref></char>
    </note>Kegele sunia ili molofe amo, inolo bamesisia mololo. Godedai sulu saeyone sasole, ili bulesu molofasia, kakaalo. Ine fagulone suu amoda seselasu goloba helelelu kakaaba ado.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">23.5</char> Yudane manamo, ili Godedai sulu saeyone sasolegulu beba selelu amofea baafia, ine olegia baaba dofalo. Amogubasu, ine sonefeada dofaba walelo. (Kisim Bek 13.9, 16 ami bamale. Aufia, Lo 6.8; 11.18 amoda bamale.) Aufia Yuda ilihe Namba 15.37-41 selelu dobumone kuliba abia, ine fagulo seselafea suu goloba helelelo. Yesu sulu iwi solumone mau ewe. Falisi ilihe bamabamasia, ine sasole bule koleba molofasia, ine suu sesela koleba mololo amone E solu.</note> <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Aufia, naiyo bule naiyone gagaiyosiamo, ili wida solumone molobu saabia kakainayo hamelo. Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> usu aselesiamoda, aselo molobu saminiba amosu kakainayo hamelo. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Aufia, gagaiyolo helea ami, idele inolo ili wakalisia, ‘Waleloba’ samesisia, ine misi waleba siyo hamelo.<verse eid="MAT 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Auluso, gilimo, inolo uleno gafea ‘Waleloba’ samesi melabiyo. Aubale. Gine Walelomo ule labene, gili suniamo, nelewo nelewoba labe. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Aufia, helefealu iwimo, gilihe inolo ulenofea ‘Naoba’ samabiyo. Enebamo, uleno gine Gao labe. E <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi labe. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Aufia, ulenohe gilifea ‘Luba Adoba’ samesi melabiyo. Enebamo, gine Luba Ado ule labe, amo E <char style="w">Keliso</char>. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:26">Mad 20.26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mag 9.35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Lug 22.26</ref></char></note>Gili aleba ugi, wasolu koleba labe amo, e gine dabalu mololo miliyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 22:29">Jop 22.29</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 29:23">Snd 29.23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Lug 14.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18.14</ref></char></note>Mau enebamo, idele inolo suniahe ine wida digibaiyefemo, Godehe ili helea dufa dafogoyobafe. Aufia, idele inolo ine meleba helea adefemo, Godehe ine wi digiyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe muguli manane dawalolu inolofeada, Falisifeada, haguguba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Maga 12.40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-52">Lugu 11.39-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20.47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />Yesu saabia selesia,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 23:13">“<char style="w">Muguli manane dawalolu inolo</char> gilida, <char style="w">Falisi</char> gilida, masega sodo inolo gili, yeele! Gilifea woba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 23:13">Enebamo, gilihe Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone sugaeyonemo, inolo sugamesiale eno kaalo. Gine gilimo ami huga anale ligia, idele inolo noolo huga maiyofia saabe amoda, huga malesialefia kaabasu ado.<verse eid="MAT 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Muguli manane dawalolu inolo gilida, Falisi gilida, masega sodo inolo gili, yeele! Gilifea woba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 23:14">Enebamo, gilihe idele ilisulu gegefia, ine kegele gegeba dilo. Aufia, gili Godefea sulu selesiamo, domadomasia, masega selale sodo. Aulugulu, fadaafeiyamo gilifea naga bule meyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />Muguli manane dawalolu inolo gilida, Falisi gilida, masega sodo inolo gili, yeele! Gilifea woba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 23:15">Enebamo, inolo uluseno gine walelu faibe melesine isasia, gilihe hele aiba silo. Aufia, gili hano sibi asefasia, salu hano aibada silo. Aufia, inolo uleno gine walelu faibe adesimo, gilihe e gili waagulu, <char style="w" lemma="Heli">heline</char> faibe adesia, e gine mana wolu mololomo wasolu melalelo.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:14">Mad 15.14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gasiba selo si kalaba yaalu gili, yeele! Gilifea woba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 23:16">Enebamo, gili eweguba sodo. ‘Inolo ulenohe, e moloyoba saaba ufulu sulu kiwigaamesine, Godene <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molofea</char> <char style="w" lemma="Aiiba sodo">aiiba selesenaga</char>, gili selesia, sulu amo eleda maleba’ sodo. Auluso, inolo uleno sebele molone belemefea aiiba selesenaga, gili selesia amo, ‘E ene aiifeguba molomaleba’ sodo. <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Kagoafia, si kalaba yaalu gili! Godene si saabia olaibomo amene labe? Sebele molo ogo olaibola, me beleme ogo olaibola? Gili asigibu, sebele molo alefasia beleme ogo <char style="w" lemma="Noekene">noekene</char> gadefaba ofologulu, sebele molo ogo, amo olaibo koleba labe.<verse eid="MAT 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Aufia, gili selesia, ‘Inolo ulenohe e moloyoba saaba ufulu sulu kiwigaamesine, <char style="w">soba meyone defene olabolu</char> amofea aiiba selesenaga, sulu ogo eleda male. Auluso, e ulu melo kegele defene olabolu saabia dobu amofea aiiba selesenaga, amo ene aiifeguba moloyo dobu.’ Gili auba sodo. <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Si kalaba yaalu gili! Godene si saabia olaibomo, amene labe? Soba meyone defene olabolu ogo, olaibola, me ulu melo kegele ogo olaibola? Gili asigibu, soba meyone defene olabolu alefasia, ulu melo kegele noekene gadefaba ofologulu, soba meyone defene olabolu ogo olaibo labe.<verse eid="MAT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Aulugulu, inolohe soba meyone defene olabolufea aiisenaga, amo ehe defene olabolu amofeada aiisia, kegele sunia amo saabia dobu amofeada aiife. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Inolohe sebele molofea aiisenaga, amo ehe molo amofeada aiisia, moloa ami Saabe Amofeada aiife. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Ais 66.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:34">Mad 5.34</ref></char></note>Aufia, inolohe <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefea</char> aiisenaga, amo ehe Godene asefalu ailalu yogolelufeada aiisia, ailalu amo saabia ami Yoba Saabe Amofeada aiife.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:30">Wkp 27.30</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:8">Mai 6.8</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="w">Muguli</char> manane dawalolu inolo gilida, Falisi gilida, masega sodo inolo, gili, yeele! Gilifea woba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 23:23">Enebamo, geiya difasia, osolafia daabulu Godefea mesiamo, gili isabulu mulumulo walu amoneda, fago amoneda, daabulu melobiyo. Auluso, gilihe Godene sulu muguli amone olaibo kegele afolobiyo. Olaibo kegele amo ewe, isolu manada, <char style="w">kanululo</char> manada, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofolo</char> manada, gilihe afolobiyo. Muguli elo amone siadenomo afelesiale, gili olaibomoda koleba molosiabiaga, amo nafulubaiye. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Gasiba selo si kalaba yaalu gili! Hano naiyone hogoniasiamo, gili fifi deseine hugamesialeba, fagulo hagufia hogonialobiyo. Auluso, gilihe dofene <char style="w">kamele</char> bisigiale, sunia naba gulubailobiyo.<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 7:4">Mag 7.4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Muguli manane dawalolu inolo gilida, Falisi gilida, masega sodo inolo, gili, yeele! Gilifea woba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 23:25">Enebamo, gili gaabuda, beledida, bado saabialosu nafuluba heesiaso, gine libo usumo asigume manada, ene melebasu asigilo manada, wasigafiasu ado. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Si kalalu, Falisi, ga! Maugabamo, ga koleba gaabuda, beledida, usudale heesi, bado saabialo lagoda, isoba heelu miliyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:3">HD 23.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Muguli manane dawalolu inolo gilida, Falisi gilida, masega sodo inolo gili, yeele! Gilifea woba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 23:27">Enebamo, gili inolo balilu dana biimo hoolu heelu amogulu labe. Dana saabialo amo, yogolelu boloso, no usu iligimo, inolo olalune kiwida, nugumalu kegele suniada, wasigaabu. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:15">Lug 16.15</ref></char></note>Amogubasu, gilida bado saabialomo idele inolone si saabia <char style="w">isolu galagololu</char> bolo. Auluso, gine libohe masega sodo manada, sulu muguli gelelo manada, wasigafia labe.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29-30" />Muguli manane dawalolu inolo gilida, Falisi gilida, masega sodo inolo, gili, yeele! Gilifea woba ufiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 23:29-30">Enebamo, gilihe <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> danelu amone dana molo yogolelu disia, isolu inolone danada nafuluba momadaba ofelesia, selesia, ‘Nini nine nauwadali alolu fogo amo alolubiaga, nini ili sagoba ofelesia, saaba ofolone ibi malesi, molobaiyale.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:29-30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:52">HD 7.52</ref></char></note>Gine sulu ogo walesia, gili saaba ofolo inoloda yasolu amone saladegelu mulu labeba walefe. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Aulugulu, gili gine gauwane mana wasigaeyone, ili maugalumo, gili moloba samodoma.<verse eid="MAT 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23.33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:7">Mad 3.7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:34">12.34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Lug 3.7</ref></char>
    </note>Soiye wolu gili! Aiyanene edo gili! Gili heli malesi fadaasi, eneba elaeyobafe? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Aulugulu, gili doma. Nahe saaba ofolo inoloda, dawalolu inoloda, aufia waleloda, gili labea hilibaisu. Auluso, gilihe ili amone noolo dufa olasia, noolomo <char style="w">imolane</char> uluba waalesia, noolomo <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo moloa</char> efolo fegoba dufelesia, noolomo dauno nofea nofeaba aisaba yaeyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Stt 4.8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20-21">2Sto 24.20-21</ref></char></note>Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Aibele">Aibelene</char> ibi sagalu amifia maugafia inigia, Belekiane faibe Sekalaeane ibi sagalu ami elosia, isolu galagololu inolone ibi helefealu iwi sagaba dedalelu amohe, gilifea egedidiba oloba koweba saeyobafe. Sekalaea amo, gilihe sebele moloda, <char style="w" lemma="Soba meyone defene olabolu">soba meyone defene olaboiya</char> elala ami dufa olalu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yudane Baibolo Maugaba Seleiya ami, inolo dufa olalu agelemo, Aibele. (Stt 4.8) Baibolo seleiya amifia, dufa olalabia inigia, elosiamo, Sekalaea. (2Sto 24.20-22) 2 Stori bugomo, Yudane Baibolo seleba eloba kaalu. Aibelene ibifea maugafia inigia, Sekalaeane ibi eloluba selefe ewenemo, isolu inolone ibi sunia sagalu amone iminife.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Na seale koleba gilifea selesu, mana wolu mololu sunia amone naga amo, gine mosomufea meyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Yelusalame yagunagalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Lugu 13.34-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:41-44">19.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Yelusalame-eee, Yelusalame-eee. <char style="w">Saaba ofolo</char> inoloda dufa danelo ga. Aufia, ga labea hilibaisalu inoloda abane odo, ga. Hilia wedinale ami, gogono edobeyohe ene edo ene awi sisa gagaiyoba ofolo amogubasu, Nahe gine faibili gagaiyobaiyeba hiliseluso, ga hamefale. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:7-8">1Kin 9.7-8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:5">Jer 22.5</ref></char></note>Doma. Ge molo elabu miliyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Sng 118.26</ref></char></note>Na gafea eweguba selesu, gahe Na saabia no baabale ligiasu, abia hilia ga selesia, ‘<char style="qt"><char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> wi saabia saabe amofea wabialesia, Ene wi digimaba’ </char> saeyomo eloyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Sebele molo woyobafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maga 13.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Lugu 21.5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yesuhe <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yalaiya amo afasia daalu. Auba aasi, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> E labea milibaifia, selesia, “Wae, sebele molo yogoleba diaba yaalu ewe, Ga besela?” <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:44">Lug 19.44</ref></char></note>Ausi, Ehe ilifea wanesia, “Gilihe molo anogo momoleba besela? Na gilifea seale koleba selesu, dufia gisa inolone sone alefasia, molo ewe olaboba dafaliba yaasimo, hodobaisasia, abane suniamo no no saabia sesagulaba diba ufulu dobu amogulu miliyobafale.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Higinilu wedinale holobagaeyobafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maga 13.3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Lugu 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Yesu abia, Olifi galea felafia, ami yoba saabi, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ilibisu milibaifia, Efea eweguba doba abulu. “Ga sebele molofea holobagaeyobafeba selefe ogo, hilia halayago moloyobafebi, ninifea saaba mema. Ga miyo amone hiliada, aleba eloyo hiliamoda, hagoale adefebamo, nini eneba eloba babiyobi? Ga ninifea saaba mema.”<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Ausi, Yesu obegeba selesia, “Inolo ulenohe gili gegesia, heleba luba dia anosi, gili nafuluba yasimale. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:23-24">Mad 24.23-24</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 2:18">1Yon 2.18</ref></char></note>Enebamo, inolo wedinale milibaifia, Ne wi saaba selesia, ‘Na <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisoba</char>’ gegesia, idele inolo wedinale heleba luba dia dedaleyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Gilihe sulu gi dobelesia, yobofeba solu dubiyobafe. Aufia, ili yobofe galada, gili dubiyobafe. Amo nafuluba, gili hidigifia sagilimabiyo. Kegele amo moloyobafeso, aleba eloyo hilia aso. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Hele nolobalo idele inolohe, hele nolobalodai gisa diaba yaeyobafe. Kini yasiba ado nohe, kini yasilo nodai yoboyobafe. Aufia, mamia gi bule adesia, heleli sigiba yaeyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Kegele amo sunia eweguba, idohe faibe haseyone maugaba naga bologuba besabe.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mad 10.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ne wi gilifea dobune, helefealu sunia gilifea gogoloba bisigia, ilihe gilifea naga meyosia, ulubia abia, inolone sone saabia ofelesi, ilihe gili yasoba daneyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Fogo amo adesi, idele inolo wedinale Nafea asigi ule ufulu mana amo afelesia, ine geleba gogoloba bisigia, holonoyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:5">Mad 24.5</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 24:24">24</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 4:1">1Yon 4.1</ref></char></note>Aufia, masega saaba ofolo inolo wedinale degeba yaafia, idele inolo wedinale gegesia, heleba luba dia dedaleyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Mana wolu moloyomo bulesia, idele inolo wedinale ine hameselomo badiyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mad 10.22</ref></char></note>Auluso, idele inolo kiwigaaba kalugalabia abia, aleba elofefea elofe ili amo, siba dafaliyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Mad 28.19</ref></char></note>Auba ausi, ilihe Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone awalu sulu nafulu amo, helefealu sunia walelabia sisi, idele inolo mosomu sunia dobolaba labi, aleba eloyo hilia amo holobagaeyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelusalame ami higinilu bule koleba holobagaeyobafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Maga 13.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Lugu 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15-16" />“Gilihe <char style="qt">kegele kalemolu wolu koleba</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">24.15-16</char> <char style="fq" closed="false">Kegele kalemolu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo, dawalolu inolo ili eweda kegele amonebuba fadaba asigibuale. (Dan 9.27; 11.31; 12.11 ami bamale.)</char></note>, woba dafiyone kegelemo, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> Daniele soluguba, sebele molo <char style="w" lemma="Noekene">noekene</char> ami labi besenaga, amo Yudia helea alebaibu gili amo, hele galea ami fisaba dedalemale. Inolo sulu eweda alegafemo, nafuluba asigiba dimale. <verse eid="MAT 24:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Lug 17.31</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, inolo molo saabia lagi labemo, e ene kegele molo usu dobumo, diyone huga abiale, fisaba malale. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Inolo edo geiya labemo, ene fagulo selale diyone, moloa obegeba abiale, fisaba malale. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Hilia fogo amo, idele faibeda kakainabumoda, enaedali faibefea bu meba yaafemoda, ili amofea yeele! Yagunagalu bule. <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Gilida fisaba maiyo hiliamo, kene badi gia amida, <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> amida, holobagamesiale, Godedai koleba sulu saamale.<verse eid="MAT 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fogo amoyamo, higinilu bule koleba holobagaeyobafe. Helefealu maugaba hili moloiya amifia, inigia, aga labea iwi, higinilu amoguluda samini abuluale. Dufiada, higinilu amogulu haiba no babiyobafale. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Godehe fogo amo aboboba ufulualebiaga, amo idele inolo sunia siba dafaiyale. Auluso, Godehe idele inolo Ene-ba molobebelelu amone hilisesia, fogo amo aboboyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:5">Mad 24.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fogo amoyamo, inolo uleno gilifea selesia, ‘Bama, Keliso iwi labe,’ me ‘E anigi labeba’ selesenaga, gilihe ene sulu amo sigiba domabiyo. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:1-3">Lo 13.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 2:8-9">2Des 2.8-9</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:13-14">MUU 13.13-14</ref></char></note>Maumo, hilia amoyamo masega kelisoda, masega saaba ofolo inoloda, wedinale holobagagafia, idele inolo gegemesinene, <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> nokene nokeneba wedinale moloyobafe. Ilihe auba moloba ligia, Godene molobebelelu idele inolomo, heleba luba dibia dedaleyo lilibubiaga, amo ili molobaiye. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Doma. Kegele ewe aso holobagabale labi, Na gilifea samini waagi saaba melu.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24.26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 17:23-24">Lug 17.23-24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, inolo uleno gilifea selesia, ‘Bama, Keliso falaiya helea anigi labeba’ selesenaga, amo gili ami malabiyo. Aufia, no gilifea selesia, ‘Bama, E molo usu iwi saabeba’ selesenaga, amo gilihe e selefe amo sigiba domabiyo. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27-28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27-28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.27-28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:37-39">Mad 24.37-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:37">Lug 17.37</ref></char></note>Gili asigibu, haga uso amaleba hauba siba adefea ami, gili hilisesia, kelebulu olalu ami dobububa hiliselo. Aufia, halo holobagalofealo ami yabagelesimo yane amo neeba sigilabia aasi, halo hugalofealo amida babiyobafe. Amogubasu, <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> miyo adesi, idele inolo sunia fadaba babiyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 24:27-28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dufia Inololene Faibe miyobafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maga 13.24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Lugu 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />Yesuhe saabia selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 24:29" />
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Ais 13.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“<char style="qt">Higiniluda besabe fogo amo samodosimo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="qt">alebale ami, halo nigiligagasia, aubeda neeyobafale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="qt">Ausi, sigabimo anakiwi afasia, dogolobaisasi,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="qt">anakiwi lagone kiwimoda bubuliba yaeyobafe.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24.30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Sek 12.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">MUU 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7.13</ref></char>
    </note>Hilia fogo amo, <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> miyone eloba babiyo anakiwi holobagasi, helefealu idele inolo sunia yegilisia, ine hamesa doweba yaeyobafe. <char style="qt">Aufia, ilihe Inololene Faibemo kiwigagalu bule alefasia, <char style="w">elalelu</char> nokenedai anakiwine iwa aleba suga saabi babiyobafe.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:52">1Kld 15.52</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 4:16">1Des 4.16</ref></char></note>Ausi, belo koleba fuuba dafogosi, Ehe Ene sulu dia ano hilibaisaeyobafe. Ausi, ilihe hele kulia biniba ami dedaleyobafe. Ilihe amifia idele inolo Godehe Ene molobebelelumo sunia, anakiwi kulia nolobalofia, nolobalo molalabia abia, gagaiyoba waaleyone dedaleyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gili koleba olono ifea asigilo dimale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maga 13.28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Lugu 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Gilihe <char style="w" lemma="Olono i - Olono sebe">olono ifea</char> asigilo eweguba dimale. Ene odo besegegenefia, komo gagasi besenaga, amo heleso gi hagoale adefebuba eloba bolo. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Amogubasu, gilihe higinilu kegele amo auba holobagagasi besenaga, gili hilisesiamo, E hagoale, eno saliba mulu labebuba hilisemale. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:28">Mad 16.28</ref></char></note>Na seale gilifea selesu, idele inolo saladegelu aga kakainabu ewe, aso danebale alebaibi, kegele ewe sunia holobagaeyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:18">Mad 5.18</ref></char></note>Helefealuda anakiwida asigileyobafe. Auluso, Ne sulu mana asigileyobafale.”<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kegele amo moloyobafemo, hiliada, halosida, inolo ulenoda asigibuale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Maga 13.32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Lugu 17.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">17.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24.36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:7">HD 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:1-2">1Des 5.1-2</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Kegele amo asiga moloyobafebibamo, hiliada, halosida, inolo ulenoda asigibuale. <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">Hebenene</char> sulu dia ano ilida asigibuale, aufia Faibe Eneda asigibuale, Enao ule elebisu asigibu.<verse eid="MAT 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24.37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Stt 6.5-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Noa aloiya hilia ami, mana mololu amogubasu, <char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> miyobafe hilia amoda, mana aubasu moloyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Hano galuiyo hilia amo aso holobagabale labi, idele inolo ili naiyoda, hanoda, nabia waalesia, inolo ido disia, ido inolofea ifolabia dedaleba labisu, Noa hano sibi sugafe hiliamo elolu. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:21-23">Stt 7.21-23</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, ilihe kegele ilifea holobagaeyobafemo asigibale adabia daaba labi, hano bule galusia, idele inolo ili amo sunia hano galuba mololu. Mana amogubasu moloba labi, Inololene Faibe miyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Inolo aida edo geiya labi, uleno diba disia, no afiyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Ido aida naiyo madeneba labi, ulenomo diba disia, nomo afiyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24.42 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 25:13">Mad 25.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gilihe gine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> miyobafemo hilia amo asigibualene, gili nafuluba yasimale. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:39-40">Lug 12.39-40</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:15">MUU 16.15</ref></char></note>Gilihe kegele ewe nafuluba asigima. Molo bisohe fadilo inolo halosi amo miyobafebuba asigisiabiaga, e hanebale si kolafia sigia, ene molo fa olabolosi yasiba alebaiye. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Aulugulu, gilida koleba madenefia melale. Maumo, gilimo Inololene Faibe fogo amoyamo miyobafeba hilisebale labi, E miyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dabalu mololo nafuludai, woludai amone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:42-46">Lugu 12.42-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Sulu solu sigi doba <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">mololo faibe</char> nafulu ewegulu labe. Ene bisohe efea dabalu gadefasiamo, ehe ene dabalu mololo faibe noolomo uluba yasimesi gadefalo. Ausi, dabalu mololo faibe nafulu ehe, naiyoda meyone iminilu fogo ami koleba, ili amofea naiyo sagalo. <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Ene bisomo hele hago daafia, obegeba inigia, ehe ene dabalu mololo faibe auba moloba labi besenaga, amo faibe amone henelo wasigaeyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:21">Mad 25.21</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 25:23">23</ref></char></note>Na gilifea seale koleba selesu. Bisohe dabalu mololo faibe ewegulumo, ene kegele sunia yasimesi iminifia gadefaeyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 24:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48-49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48-49" />Auluso, dabalu mololo faibe wolu e ewegulu labe. E hilisesiamo, ene bisomo alebale miyobafaleba hilisefia, ehe ua dabalu mololomo yasofia abia, kagoalo inolo galiba yoba sigia, naiyoda, hanoda, maugaba naba miliyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 24:48-49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Auba moloba ligia, dabalu mololo faibe amohe, bisomo hiliada, halosida, amoyamo miyobafeba hilisebale ligia, babeaba labi, obegeba miyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Aufia, ene bisohe efea naga mefia, ehe e-mo masega sodo inolo ili amodai hele ua melesi gadefaeyobafe. Amimo, ili bese hegelesia, yegiliba ligia, kudumaneba miliyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Ido budasile daabulubane besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 19:7">MUU 19.7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:35">Lug 12.35</ref></char>
    </note>“Fogo amoyamo, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amo, ido budasile daabuluba amogulu labe. Ilihe ine naafa difasia, inolo idoda diyomo milesi yasiba miliyone dedalelu amogulu. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Ili aleba amimo, bia asigidale, bia asigida alolu. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Asigidale ilimo, naafa dia abiaso, wele hano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">25.3</char> Fogo amohe, Isolaele idele inolo ilihe ine naafamo <char style="fq">wele hano</char> hogoniafia yaalo.</note> huliane bodolo wasiba sebale daalu. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Auluso, asigida ilimo, naafa dia abia, wele hano hulianeda, bodolo wasiba sefia daalu. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Inolo idoda diyomo, fogo selale ufia ligia, alebale mulualene, ili hanemiasi fufunalolu.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Nigili dogolea adesi, wuaaba selesia, ‘Idoda diyomo saabe-eee! E wakaliyone milibaimo-ooo!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Ausi, ido budasilemo degeba yaafia, ine naafamo momololu. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Aufia, asigidale ilihe, asigida ili amofea selesia, ‘Wae, nine naafa usufebu, gine wele hano noolo ninifea mema.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />‘Meyaleba’, obegeba solu. ‘Nineda, gilidaba hogoniasimo, lilisiale samodolosi. Aulugulu, wele hanoda elegela ami dedalefia, gine elegeyo malale.’<verse eid="MAT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Ili wele hano elegeyone dedaleba labi, idoda diyomo goalu. Ausi, ido budasile madeneba alolu ili amo, e galiba abia, ifosia naiyo naiyone madeneba ufuluiya molo usu sugalu. Sugafia labi, eno kaaba dafalu.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Lug 13.25-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dufia, bia nomo ilida goasia, selesia, ‘<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, saminilo, ninida suga miyoba eno sogoma!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:23">Mad 7.23</ref></char></note>Auluso, e obegeba selesia, ‘Na gilifea seale selesu, na gili bolale.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:42">Mad 24.42</ref></char></note>Yesuhe sadalu ewe saaba samodosia selesia, “Aulune, gili hiliada, halosida, asigibualene, gili madenefia yasiba melale.”<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dabalu mololo faibilifea mole melumone besi sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Lugu 19.11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />Yesuhe saabia selesia, “Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amo, ewegulu labe. Elebeda inolo uleno hele hago maiyo ligia, ene<char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">dabalu mololo faibili</char> milafia, ilifea ene kegele yasimesine iminifia gadefalu. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:6">Lom 12.6</ref></char></note>Ili moloyodolu lililuguba sagasia, ehe nofeamo, mole saii bia, nofeamo, mole saii aida, nofeamo, mole saii ule melu. Auba mefasia, e hele hago daalu. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Hele hago daafia labi, mole saii biada dulu inolo amohe, alebale abia, mole amohe dabalu moloba ligia, huliane disia, haiba saii bia no dulu. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Aubasu, saii aidada dulu amo eda, huliane disia, haiba saii aida no dulu. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Auluso, mole saii uleda dulu inolomo, abia, hele walifasia ene yasilone molemo, hele usu ami muguba ufulu.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />Fogo selale alefasia, dabalu mololo faibene yasilomo obegeba milifasia, ine dabalu mololumone mole isoyone ilidai asulu. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Mole saii biada dulu inolo amo, huliane saii bia noda sefia inigia, selesia, ‘Yasilo, ga ewe bama. Ga nafea saii bia mesomo, na huliane bia no dulu. Gafea mesu ewe.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:45-47">Mad 24.45-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:10">Lug 16.10</ref></char></note>Ene yasilomo obegeba selesia, ‘Nafulu, ga ne sulu solu afelesiale, sigi doba mololo faibe nafulu. Gahe kegele wedino afelesiale, sigi doba mololugulu, nahe ga kegele wedinale amoda yasimesi iminisia gadefaeyobasu. Ga ge yasilo galiba heneba misiyone mila.’<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Mole saii aidada dulu amo eda inigia, selesia, ‘Yasilo, ga ewe bama. Ga nafea saii aida mesomo, na huliane aida no dulu. Gafea mesu ewe.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Ene yasilomo obegeba selesia, ‘Nafulu, ga ne sulu solu afelesiale, sigi doba mololo faibe nafulu. Kegele wedino afelesiale, gahe sigi doba mololugulu, nahe ga kegele wedinale amoda yasimesi iminisia gadefaeyobasu. Ga ge yasilo galiba, heneba misiyone mila.’<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Aufia, saii uleda dulu inolomo mulu. E selesia, ‘Yasilo, amo na asigilu. Ga inolo kolelu ligia, sebe edo ga gelualemo susia, naiyo sebe ga fifilualemo, gagaiyoba ado. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Aulugulu, na ga baaba sagilisia abia, ge mole hele usu muguba ufulu. Aga bama, ge mole ewe.’<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26-27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26-27" />Ene yasilo obegeba selesia, ‘Ga habaloba dabalu mololo faibe wolu. Ga hilisesia, na sebe edo gelualemo susia, naiyo sebe fifilualemo, gagaiyoba adomo inolo lolububa hilisefela? Ga auba hilisefe ogo, ga ne mole bengi ufulubiaga, amo na obegesia mole hulianeda dibaiye. <verse eid="MAT 25:26-27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Aulune, ene mole saii ule efea sagoba difasia, saii daabuluba sefia labe amofea mema. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mad 13.12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mag 4.25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Lug 8.18</ref></char></note>Enebamo, inolo kegele sefia labemo, ili amofea gegoaba mesi, ili wedinale seba ligia wasigaeyobafe. Auluso, inolo kegele sebale labemo, kegele wedino ili sebumo amoda, ili amofea sagoba diyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Mad 8.12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Lug 13.28</ref></char></note>Aulune, eleda moloyodoluale faibe ogo, egeisialo nigili gagaiya ami saidafogoma. Amimo, e bese hegelesia, yegiliba ligia, kudumaneba miliyobafe.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inololene Faibehe idele inolo sunia osolaeyobafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31-32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31-32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25.31-32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 34:17">Ese 34.17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mad 16.27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:28">19.28</ref>; <ref loc="REV 20:11-13">MUU 20.11-13</ref></char>
    </note>“<char style="w">Inololene Faibe</char> <char style="w">elalelu</char> usu amifia inigiamo, Ene sulu dia ano sunia E galiba saabi, E Ene asefalu ailalu elalelu saabia yoba aselesi, helefealu mosomu sunia Ene olegia gagaiyoba yaeyobafe. Ausi, <char style="w">dofene sibi</char> uluba ado ulenohe sibimo, nolobalo osolaba waalesia, mememo nolobalo osolaba waaleloguba, E idele inolo aubasu osolaeyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 25:31-32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Ehe dofene sibimo ene sone lilibefealo waalesia, mememo fofonaloafealo waaleyobafe.<verse eid="MAT 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Auba waalefasia, Kinihe lilibefealo ili amofea eweguba saeyobafe. ‘Ne Nao gilifea <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">ediliba ufulu</char> amo gili, milibaifia, gine daalo dima. Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami melesine, amo gine daalo labe. Gili ami melesine, helefealu dofeleiya amifia, inigia, madeneba ufulubiyo. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 58:7">Ais 58.7</ref></char></note>Enebamo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 25:35">Na mamiasi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 25:35">gili Nafea naiyo meso.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 25:35">Na hano nabaisi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 25:35">gili Nafea hano meso.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 25:35">Na misi bolale inolo ligia, gili labea saabi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 25:35">gili Na heneba luba diso.<verse eid="MAT 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Na abagudoa labi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 25:36">gili Nafea fagulo kaaba ofeleso.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 25:36">Na walefa dobi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 25:36">gili Na luba miliyone bea saabeo.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 25:36">Na dibolo labi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 25:36">gili Na bea saabeo.’<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Auba selesi, <char style="w">isolu galagololu</char> ilihe Efea eweguba obegeba saeyobafe. ‘Saminilo, halayago Ga mamiasi, nini Gafea naiyo melu? Halayago Ga hano nabaisi, nini gafea hano melu? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Halayago Ga misi bolale saabi, nini Ga heneba luba dulu? Halayago Ga abagudoa labi, nini Gafea fagulo kaaba ufulu? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Halayago Ga walefa dobi, nini Ga luba miliyone bea mulu? Halayago Ga dibolo labi, nini Ga bea mulu?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 19:17">Snd 19.17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:42">Mad 10.42</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mag 9.41</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Kinimo eweguba obegeba saeyobafe. ‘Na gilifea seale koleba selesu. Kegele sunia gilihe ne damene wida male ili amofea mololumo, gili amo Nafea mololu.’<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25.41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:23">Mad 7.23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba safasia, Kinihe ene fofonaloafealo labe ili amofea, eweguba saeyobafe. ‘Godene kanolo gilifea dobu amo gili, Na gadefia afa dedalema! De usulale, <char style="w">henane</char> amoneda, ene sulu dia ano ili amoneda, madeneba dobia ami dedalema! <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Enebamo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 25:42">Na mamiasi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 25:42">gili Nafea naiyo mesale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 25:42">Na hano nabaisi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 25:42">gili Nafea hano mesale.<verse eid="MAT 25:42" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Na misi bolale inolo ligia, gili labea saabi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 25:43">gili Na heneba luba disale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 25:43">Na abagudoa labi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 25:43">gili Nafea fagulo kaaba ofelesale.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MAT 25:43">Na walefa dobida, Na dibolo labida,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="MAT 25:43">gili Na luba miliyone bea saabeale.’<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Auba selesi, ilida eweguba obegeba saeyobafe, ‘Saminilo, Ga mamiasida, hano nabaisida, misi bolale saabida, abagudoa labida, walefa dobida, dibolo labida, halayago nini Ga auba bisigia, sagoba ufuluale?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Auba selesi, e eweguba obegeba saeyobafe. ‘Na gilifea seale selesu. Kegele sunia gilihe wida male ili amofea mololuale amo, gili amo Nafea mololuale.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12.2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 5:29">Yon 5.29</ref></char></note>Auba saaba samodosi, ili naga gelelale nabasu miliyo dobia ami dedalesi, isolu galagololu ili amo <char style="w">miliyolu miliyo</char> dobia ami dedaleyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Guni inolo ilihe Yesu dufiyone sulu daiyaba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maga 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Lugu 22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yone 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1-2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26.1-2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kis 12.1-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:18">Mad 20.18</ref></char>
    </note>Yesu sulu auba saaba samodofasia, Ehe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> selesia, “<char style="w">Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo</char> maugaeyomo, aso hilia aida dobuba, gili asigibu. Hilia ami, <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> <char style="w">imolane</char> luba homesine, gisa inolone sone saabia ufiyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3-4" />Fogo amoyamo, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, Isolaelene guni inoloda, ili soba melone yasilo inolo amone molo yogoleiya ami gagaiyolu. Fogo ami, soba melone yasilo inolo, ene wimo, Kaiafase. Ili ene moloa ami gagaiyofia ligia, Yesu muguba sefasia, dufa olaeyone mumuguba daiyalu. <verse eid="MAT 26:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Auba daiyasia, ili selesia, “Sigilo hilia aga ewe, auba auyobale. Maumo, auba ausenaga, idele inolo bule belaguyo degeba yaeyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ido uleno walea hano kasineda nokene koleba Yesune gunia sagalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maga 14.3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yone 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6-7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26.6-7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:37-38">Lug 7.37-38</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu E Bedani ami ligia, inolo Saimono, samini yolida alolu amone moloa ami sigia, naiyo naba yoba saabi, ido uleno abane bodolo yogolelu, walea hano kasineda nafulu selumo, dibia inigia, Yesu saabea milifasia, Ene gunia sagalu. Walea hano amo mole ana dulu. <verse eid="MAT 26:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" /><char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">Walelu faibilihe</char> amo baafia, ili kanoba selesia, “Ido ogo walea hano enesi balu weasefebu? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Walea hano ewe elegesiabiaga, mole bule difasia, weagulu inolofea meyone diba ofaiye.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yesuhe ili auba selefebuba asigifia, selesia, “Gilihe ido ogofea habolu sulu samabu. E Nafeamo mana nafulu heafuba moloso. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Lo 15.11</ref></char></note><char style="qt">Helefealu iwi, weagulu idele inolo ili amo hilia sunia gilidai miliyobafe.</char> Auluso, Na gilidai hilia sunia miliyobafale. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Ido ewe walea hano Na domala sagasomo, Ne domala dana usu diba ufiyomone madenesia auso. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Aulugulu, Na sulu ewe gilifea seale koleba selesu. Awalu Sulu Nafulu helefealu sunia walelabia sifea ami, idele inolo suniahe ido ewe auba mololuba asigimesine selabia daabasu miliyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudasahe Yesumo yasilo inolofea holonoba meyoba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maga 14.10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Lugu 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14-15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26.14-15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 11:12">Sek 11.12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:57">Yon 11.57</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, hugulubamone uleno, ene wi <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[1]], Isakaliodo">Yudasa Isakaliodo</char>, abia, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> alebaibia goafia, wanesia, “Na E-mo gine sone saabia ofelesenaga, gili nafea halagia meyoba hilisefe?” Auba selesi, ilihe silifa mole iso daabuluba osoloa efea meyone alegalu. <verse eid="MAT 26:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Fogo amifia, Yudasahe E ine sone saabia ufiyone eno keleba isaba alolu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E Ene walelu faibilidai naiyo mololu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maga 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Lugu 22.7-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">22.21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yone 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Boledi Yisida Ofale Subulumo Naiyone Sigilo Hilia">Boledi Yisida Ofale Subulumo Naiyone Sigilo</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr">26.17</char> <char style="fq" closed="false">Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hilia adesi, Yuda mosomu ili boledi yisida ofale subulu amosu nolo. (Kisim Bek 12.15-20 ami bamale.) Aulugulu, ilihe Obegeba Dulumone Henelo Sigilo amone wi no Boledi Yisida Ofale Subulu Naiyone Sigiloba sodo. Ili hilia domoba henelo. </char></note> amone hilia agele adesi, Yesune <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ili Efea wanesia, “<char style="w">Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo</char> naiyo naiyone Ga nini wagi daafia, madeneba homesiba hilisefe?” <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />E obegeba selesia, “Gili abia, sidi ami suga daafia, inolo ewe labea goafia, efea eweguba saamale. ‘Walelo selesia, Ne fogo iminiba ufulumo hagoalefe. Nahe Ne walelu faibilidai, ge moloa ami Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo naiyo naiyobasu.’ Efea auba saeyo malale.” <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Auba selesi, walelu faibilihe Yesu ilifea molomesi soluguba molosia, Sigilo naiyo madeneba ufulu.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Geidesi, Yesuda, inolo hugulubamo ilida, milibaifia, ailalu naiyoda ufuluiya ami, amaleba ua yoba kakainalu. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Naiyo naba ligia, E selesia, “Na gilifea seale koleba selesu, gili aleba uleno Na holonoyobafe.” <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Auba selesi, ili asigi higinifia, ule uleba Efea eweguba selaba yaalu. “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, ogo na dagulo?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Sng 41.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yesu obegeba selesia, “Nadai fofo ule naiyo diyone sone sugalu amo e, Na holonoyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" /><char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char>, E saaba ofa sulu selelu dobuguba olaeyobafe. Auluso, inolo abehe Inololene Faibemoda gisa inolofea holonoba seba mefe amo, yeele, efea woba ufiyobafe. Enae e seba dulualebiaga, amo e nafulubaiye.” <verse eid="MAT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Auba selesi, <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[1]], Isakaliodo">Yudasa</char>, Eda holonoyobafemo, selesia, “Walelo, ogo na dagulo?” Yesu obegeba selesia, “Gene ga selefe waaga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">
    <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo asigisia naiyo nolo">Yesuhe boledidai, waini hanodai, Ene walelu faibilifea namenesi melu</char></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maga 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:15-20">Lugu 22.15-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kolidi 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Ili naiyo naba ligia, Yesuhe <char style="w">boledi</char> difasia, Godedai henelu sulu saafia, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> gogoleba sagasia selesia, “Ewe Ne domala, gili difasia namena.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Aufia, Ehe waini hano gaabu wasulu difasia, Godefea henelu sulu saafia, ilifea mesia selesia, “Gili sunia gaabu difasia, ewe nabaima. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:11">Sek 9.11</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 24:8">Kis 24.8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:16">1Kld 10.16</ref></char></note>Waini hano ewe, Ne ibi. Ne ibi ewehe <char style="w">oloba huliale dabalu</char> iminisia, idele inolo wedinale sagoba ofelesia, ine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> heesia galimesine sagaeyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Na gilifea selesu, Na <char style="w">waini</char> hano saabia no nabale ligiasu, hilia Na gilidai Ne Naohe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami ligia, hili nabiamo naiyobasu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26.30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:39">Lug 22.39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:1">Yon 18.1</ref></char>
    </note>Ili naiyo amo naba samodosiamo, Godene wi digisia gasa saafia, ili degeba yaafia, hele gale Olibifealo dedalelu.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fidahe Yesu bolaleba saeyobafeba Yesuhe saaba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maga 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Lugu 22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yone 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26.31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Sek 13.7</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 16:32">Yon 16.32</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea selesia, “Nigiliba agayagi, Nafea moloyobafe amo alefasia, gili sunia gelebaisaeyobafe. Enebamo, saaba ofelesia, eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 26:31" />
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">
    <char style="qt">Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Dofene sibi">dofene sibida</char> uluba adomo dufelesi,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">
    <char style="qt">dofene sibi fisaba dedaleba yaeyobafe.</char><verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26.32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 28:7">Mad 28.7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 28:16">16</ref></char>
    </note>Auluso, dufia Na <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degefasiamo</char>, Galili helea ami Nadale saminiba dafasia, gili ami wakaliyobasu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Yesuhe selefemo dofasia, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidahe</char> obegeba selesia, “Gafea moloyobafe ogo alefasia, ili sunia gelebaisasenaga, na aubada gelebaiyale koleba!”<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mad 26.69-75</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba selesi, Yesuhe efea selesia, “Na gafea seale koleba selesu. Aga nigiliba iwi, gogono aso galabale labi, ga koleba Na waaselaba bisigia, Na bolaleba mofebu osoloaba saeyobafe.” <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Auluso, Fidahe Efea selesia, “Na Gadai olaeyodolunaga amoda hama, na-mo Ga bolaleba aubada saeyale.” E auba selesi, <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ili suniada sulu aubasu solu.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E Gesemani geiya ami Godedai sulu solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maga 14.32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Lugu 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Yesu Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilidai</char> hele Gesemaniba selefea ami goafia, ilifea selesia, “Na abia, anigi Godedai sulu selaba miliyogulu, gili yagi mesale.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37-38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.37-38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:27">Yon 12.27</ref></char></note>Auba safasia, ili noolo waagi mesalefia, Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidada</char>, Sebedine faibe aidada, ilisu luba dibia daalu. Daaba ligia, Ene libo higinifia, keleba hilisefia, selesia, “Na libo bule higinisia, olaeyo adefegulu, gili yagi sigia, si kolafia nadai yasiba melale.”<verse eid="MAT 26:37-38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />E aleba asogofia, helea sauba hanefia ligia, Godedai sulu selesia, “Nao-ooo, eweguba moloyodolunaga, gaabu naga wasulu ewe na namenesialene diba damale. Auluso, Na hamefegubale, Ga hamefegubasu molomale.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Auba saafia, obegeba inigia, bosolufalumo, Ene walelu faibilimo hanefia labi bisigia, E Fidafea selesia, “Halosi ule gili si kolafia ligia, Nadai yasiyodolualebula? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Dedeba babiyo holobagasi, gili gelebailosine, enogele ligia, Godedai sulu selaba melale. Seale, asubanemo moloyo hilisefeso, domalamo kiwidale adefe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Auba safasia, Yesu E aganebo saabia aleba asogofia, Godedai sulu selesia, “Gaabu naga wasulu ewe, na naasimo, amisu diba dafiyodolunaga, amo waagi, Ge hame molomale. Na amo naiyo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Aufia, E obegeba inigia, bosolufalumo, ili si hanemialugulu, saabia hanefia labi abulu.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Aufia, E ili gadefia abia, haiba aleba asogofia, Godedai sulu osolo selesia, E solugubasu solu. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Aufasia, E Ene walelu faibili labea obegeba inigia, selesia, “Gili aso hane gagalifia ligia, halemane elela? Bama. Halosi daiyaba ufulumo holobagafe. <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> holonofia, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu mololone</char> sone saabia ofelefe. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:31">Yon 14.31</ref></char></note>Degema, nini aasu, Nada holonoyomo e saabe ewe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudasahe Yesu holonofia, gisa inolofea seba melu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maga 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Lugu 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yone 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Yesuhe auba selaba labi, <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[1]], Isakaliodo">Yudasa</char> faibe hugulubamone uleno e, ami goalu. Inolo wedinale helebesida, digaluda, sesaifia milibailu. <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">Soba melone guni inoloda</char>, Isolaelene guni inoloda, ili hilibaisasi, ili amo Yudasa galiba milibailu. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Holonoba melo inolohe gisa inolofea samini eweguba eloba bamalelu. “Inolo na mimiyobasumo amo e. Gili amone semale.” <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Auba solugulu goasiamo, Yudasa alebale abia, Yesu labea goasia, E mimifia selesia, “Walelo, ga nigiliba nafulu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yesu efea selesia, “Damene, ga moloyone hamefia muluguba, moloma.” Auba selesi, inolo ilihe migagaba inigia, Yesu fafuasia selu. <figure style="fig" alt="Kiss of betrayal" file="C084.JPG" size="col" copy="© 1997 New Tribes Mission/Foreign Mission Board, Southern Baptist Convention." ref="26.47-50">Yudasahe Yesu holonosia mimife.</figure> <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:26">Yon 18.26</ref></char></note>Ausi, inolo uleno E aniba alolumohe, helebesi selale sigiba difasia, soba melone yasilo amone dabalu mololo uleno dufelesia, ene koneni geleba dafogolu.<verse eid="MAT 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26.52 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 9:6">Stt 9.6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:10">MUU 13.10</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, Yesu efea selesia, “Ge helebesi ogo obegeba seba homa. Enebamo, helebesida sigiba dilo ili amo, helebesi amofea alefasia daneyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Ga hilisesia, Na Ne Nao weyodolualeba hilisesela? Na Efea sagoba homasenaga, Ehe Na sagoba homesine, Ene sulu dia ano saii huguluba sunialu amogulu hilibaisaeyobafe. <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Auluso, auba molosiabiaga, eweguba holobagaeyobafeba sulu selelu saaba ufulumo, halaguba wakalibaiye?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26.55 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:47">Lug 19.47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21.37</ref></char>
    </note>Fogo amoyamo, Yesuhe inolo wedinale milibailu amofea doba bisigia selesia, “Gili helebesida, digaluda, sesaifia milibaisego, Na fadilo labebuba hilisefia, Na seyone milibailula? Hilia sunia, Na <char style="w">sebele molo</char> yalaiya ami waleba labimo, gilihe Na sesale. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Auluso, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> selelu dobumone wakalimesine, aga auba molofe.” Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> sunia E gadefia fisaba dedalelu.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ili Yesu lubia Yudane galisolo si saabia godolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maga 14.53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Lugu 22.54-55</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">22.63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yone 18.13-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Yesuda selu ili amohe, E lubia abia, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone yasilo</char> inolo Kaiafase labea dedalelu. Kaiafasene moloa ami, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu inoloda</char>, inolo asidaluda, milibaifasia, gagaiyofia kakainalu. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Yesu lubia aasi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> Eda faisa faisaba abia, soba melone yasilo inolone moloa goalu. Molo amone yala usu ami, sebele molone ibolo selu ili amo galiba, yoba sigia, halaguba moloba asufelaba babiyone, yasiba asulu.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Molo usu ami, soba melone guni inoloda, galisolo inoloda, Yesu dufa olaeyone godomesine, wolu E mololumo, masega si abuluba samesine olofa inolo isalu. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60-61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60-61" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.60-61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19-21">Yon 2.19-21</ref></char></note>Masega olofa inolo wedinale migagaba milibailuso, Yesu dufa olaeyone godomesine, kegele si abuluba uleno saeyodoluale. Afelesia, inolo aida no migagaba inigia, selesia, “Inolo ogo eweguba seleso. ‘Nahe Godene <char style="w">sebele molo</char> bididafasia, saabia haiba hilia osoloa diyodoluba’ seleso.”<verse eid="MAT 26:60-61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Inolo aida auba selesi, soba melone yasilo degefia, Yesufea selesia, “Aalu olofa ligia, Gafea egedidiba selefe ogo, Ga sulu obegeba saeyalebula?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.63 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Ais 53.7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:12">Mad 27.12</ref></char></note>Auluso, Yesu saufia alolu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:63">Ausi, soba melone yasilo efea selesia, “Na Gafea koleba selesu. Ga Gode bebeada labe amofea aiisia saama. Godene Faibe, <char style="w">Keliso</char>, Ga-la?”<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26.64 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sng 110.1</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7.13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:30">Mad 24.30</ref></char>
    </note>Yesu obegeba selesia, “Gene selefe waaga. Auluso, Na gili suniafea eweguba selesu. Aga amifia, gilihe <char style="qt"><char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char> Kiwigagalu Amone sone lilibefealo yoba asefia, <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenene</char> iwa saabia alefasia, saabi babiyobafe.</char>”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65-66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65-66" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26.65-66 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 24:16">Wkp 24.16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:3">Mad 9.3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:33">Yon 10.33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:7">19.7</ref></char>
    </note>Yesu E auba selefe dofasia, soba melone yasilo inolo e kanosia, ene fagulo kaalumo gagalaba dafasia, selesia, “E Godegulu loluba selefe ogo, Ehe samabiyolu muguli sulu gelefe. Olofa inolo noolo, nini aso eneyone isaeyo? Gode Maleelumone wimo, Ehe Ene meleba selefe ogo, gili dubulugulu, gili Efea eneba moloyoba hilisefe?” Ausi, ili obegeba selesia, “Muguli mana selesia, E olaeyo dobu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:65-66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67-68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67-68" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26.67-68 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 50:6">Ais 50.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 53:5">53.5</ref></char>
    </note>Auba safasia, ilihe Ene mia gau fodosia, sone musu naga sodoba dowesi, noolo sone kaabe dowesia selesia, “Saaba ofolo, Keliso, Ga! Inolo gada dowefe ogo, wi abe? Gene saaba ofa saama!”<verse eid="MAT 26:67-68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fida e Yesu bolaleba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maga 14.66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Lugu 22.56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yone 18.15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> e molo amone yalaiya usu ami yoba saabi, dabalu mololo ido uleno e saabea inigia, selesia, “Ga wagada, Galili inolo Yesudai adomobu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Auba selesi, Fidahe ami kakainalumo suniane si saabia, naaleba selesia, “Sulu ga selefe ogo, na hilisebuale koleba.”<verse eid="MAT 26:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Aufia, e gigiliba abia, eno anibafealo daafia labi, ido nohe e baafia, inolo noolo ami alebaibumofea selesia, “Inolo ogo, Nasaledene inolo Yesudai silomobu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Auba selesi, ehe saabia naaleba <char style="w" lemma="Aiiba sodo">aiiba</char> selesia, “Seale koleba, inolo ogo na bolale.”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Fogo wedino alefasia, ami alebaibumo ili Fida labealo inigia, efea selesia, “Seale, Edai silomo ulenomo, ga. Enebamo, ge dogaeyo ogohe gada Galilifia muluba eloba dobelefe.” <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Ausi, ehe <char style="w" lemma="Aiiba sodo">aiiba selesia</char>, “Seale koleba, inolo ogo na bolale. Na seale selesalenaga, amo Gode na woba ufiyobafe.” Fida e auba saabagosi, alebale hamagi, gogono galalu. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.75 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:34">Mad 26.34</ref></char></note>Gogono galasi, Fidahe Yesu sulu samini saaba ufulumo ami asigiba obegelu. “Gogono aso galabale labi, ga Na bolaleba mofeobu osoloaba saeyobafe.” Auba hilisesia, Fida e baea daafia, yuasia, kudumaneba yeelu.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Ilihe Yesu gafena Filadusu labea lubia daalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maga 15.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Lugu 23.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yone 18.28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Keafa hiliasi, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, Isolaelene guni inoloda, ili sulu nenefia, Yesu dufa olaeyoba sulu ule ufulu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Aufasia, ilihe Yesu dofafia, ulubia abia, gamanene yasilo <char style="w" lemma="Filadusu">Filadusufea</char> seba melu.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudasa e ene meleba kolofolo seba olalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Hilibaisi Daalu 1.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[1]], Isakaliodo">Yudasa</char> Yesuda holonolumo ehe, Yesu dufa olaeyone godoluba solu dofasia, ene meleba yuasia kudumaneba alolu. Ausi, ehe silifa mole iso daabuluba osoloa sefia abia, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolofeada</char>, inolo asidalufeada, obegeba meyo daalu. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />E ilifea selesia, “Woluda mololuale inolomo, nahe E dufa olamesi holonolumone, wolu mololu.” Auba selesi, ili obegeba selesia, “Amo nine kegelela? Ga gene meleba keleba hilisema.” <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">HD 1.18-19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:14-15">Mad 26.14-15</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yudasahe mole amo <char style="w">sebele molo</char> usu saidafogolu. Aufasia, e abia, ene meleba kolofolo selu.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Soba melone guni inolo ilihe, mole iso amo molaba difasia, selesia, “Mole ewehe, inolo uleno dufa olamesine elegelune, ibi baabu. Aulune, nini sebele molone samolo usu ami ofelesenaga, amo muguli mana geleyobafe.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Aulugulu, ili nenesia, mole ewehe, gofoda mololo ene hele haisi amone elegeyoba sulu ule ufulu. Elegefasia, ilihe yau idele inolo olafe amone, hele haisi ami baliba ufiyone gadefalu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">27.7</char> Yuda mosomu ili olafemo, yau inolo olafedai, ua gegoaba baliba ofolale. Aulugulu, ili mole amo, yau inolo olafe baliyone hele elegelu.</note> <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Fogo amifia inigia, agamo Yuda ili hele haisi amone wimo, Ibine Geluba sodo. <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.9-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12-13">Sek 11.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:6-9">Jer 32.6-9</ref></char></note>Ausihe, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Yelemaia">Yelemaia</char> saaba ufuluguba wakaliba sugalu. Saaba ufulu sulu amo ewe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 27:9" />
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 27:9">
    <char style="qt">“<char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomuhe, inolo ogo elegeyone elebe amo iminiba ufulumo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 27:9">
    <char style="qt">silifa mole iso daabuluba osoloa amo difasia,</char><verse eid="MAT 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />
    <char style="qt">ilihe gofoda mololo amone hele haisimo elegelu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 27:10">
    <char style="qt">
      <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> nafea soluguba, ili auba mololu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu gamanene yasilo Filadusune olegia ifoba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Maga 15.2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Lugu 23.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yone 18.33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Fogo hamagi, Yesu gamanene yasilo olegia degeba labi, ehe Yesufea doba bisigia, “<char style="w">Yuda</char> mosomune kinimo, seale Ga-la?” Yesuhe obegeba selesia, “Sulu amo, gene ga selefe waaga.”<verse eid="MAT 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:7">Ais 53.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">Soba melone guni inoloda</char>, asidaluda, ilihe Yesufea fadaasia, oloba koweba sulu wedinale selesi, E sulu uleno obegeba soluale. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Filadusu">Filadusuhe</char> Yesufea wanesia, “Ilihe olofa ligia, gafea egedidiba selefe ogo, ga dobelefalela?” <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Auluso, Yesuhe sulu ulenoda obegeba saeyale adefe baafia, Filadusu e momoleba abulu. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus before Pilate" file="IB04161.TIF" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="27.11-14">Yesu gamanene yasilo Filadusune olegia ifoba ufulu.</figure><verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filadusu selesia, Yesu imolane uluba homaba solu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maga 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Lugu 23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:38-19:16">Yone 18.38–19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Hamu sunia, Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo adesimo, gamanene yasilohe dibolo dafalibagolu inolo uleno sububa dafogoba ado. Idele inolo wamili ilihe, inolo amo sububa dafogomesine iminisia, wi selefeguba, ehe inolo amo sububa dafogolo. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Hilia amimo, inolo wolu koleba uleno, amone wi Balabasa, dibolo ami asulu. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Aulugulu, idele inolo wamili gagaiyofia labi, <char style="w">Filadusu</char> ilifea wanesia, “Gili inolo halane sububa dafogomesi hamefe? Balabasala? Me <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisoba</char> solu Yesu amola?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:47-48">Yon 11.47-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:19">12.19</ref></char></note>Enebamo, Filadusuhe bisigia, <char style="w">soba melo inolo</char> ilihe, Yesufea waaselaba bisigiane, E seba mefebuba eloba abulu.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Filadusu ene osolaeyone ailaiya yoba saabi, ene eamono sulu eweguba efea seleba mebailu. “Inolo woluda mololuale ogofea, kegele uleno molomabiyo. Mau enebamo, aga nigiliba na inolo ogofea wobasubale udiasi, yagunagalu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Filadusu ehe ene eamono sowi seleba mebailu amone alegaba labi, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> ilihe idele inolo eweguba saamasia saaba sagalu. “Balabasa subu dafogomaba saama. Aufia, Yesu dufa olamaba saamaba” solu.<verse eid="MAT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Ausi, Filadusu wanesia, “Gili inolo aida ewe no halane sububa dafogomesi hamefe?” Ili obegeba selesia, “Balabasa ogo!” <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Idele inolo auba selesi, Filadusu selesia, “Balabasasenaga, na Kelisoba solu Yesu amofea, eneba molosu?” Ili obegeba selesia, “Ogo <char style="w">imolane</char> uluba homa-aaa!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Auba selesi, Filadusuhe ilifea wanesia, “Enesi? E wolu amene mololubiyo?” Auluso, ili koleba wuaaba selesia, “E imolane uluba homa-aaa!” <verse eid="MAT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:6-9">Lo 21.6-9</ref></char></note>Ili auba koleba wuaaba selesi, e sulu saeyodoluale adesi, idele inolo belaguba yaeyo weiyaafe baafia, Filadusuhe disi hano hululumo difasia, idele inolone si saabia ene sone heeba ligia, selesia, “Inolo ogone ibi sagaeyone heleba mololu kegele uleno nafea male. Amo gine kegele.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">27.24</char> Filadusuhe idele inolo si saabia ene sone heelumo ewegubane aulu. Yesu amone dufa olaeyone, efea heleba mololu uleno maleba hilisemesine aulu.</note> <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:28">HD 5.28</ref></char></note>Ausi, idele inolo sunia selesia, “Ene ibi ogo, ninifeada, nine faibefeada, nine kegele miliyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Auba selesi, Filadusuhe Balabasamo ilifea sububa dafelagofasia, ene ibolo selu inolohe Yesu efolo fegomesi gadefalu. Auba molofasia, E imolane uluba homesi yobolo inolone sone saabia ufulu.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yobolo inolo ilihe Yesufea baaba galulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Maga 15.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yone 19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Gamanene yasilomone yobolo ilihe, Yesu E gamanene molo amone usu ami lubia hugafia, ibolo selu sunia E hegoba amaleyone wafe dulu. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28-29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.28-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:11">Lug 23.11</ref></char></note>Ilihe E auba hegofia ligia, Ene fagulo huba dafalifasia, fagulo genelu, kini kaalogulu, Yesufea kaaba ufulu. Aufia, efolo aiye gagalu mabufia, Ene gunia, kinine habugagulu saligaba ufulu. Aufia, ene sone inaloalo kaidamo, kinigulu bamesi, seba ufulu. Aufasia, ilihe E sisa emo hugulumo sagaba sigia, Efea baaba gaidesia, selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> kini, Ga! Keafa nafulu! Nini ga wabialesu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:28-29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 50:6">Ais 50.6</ref></char></note>Aufia, ilihe Efea gau fodosia, kaidamo amo difasia, ene gunia saabia saabiaba doweba dalelu. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Aufasia, fagulo genelu kaalumo huba ofelesia, fagulo enemone kaaba ofasia, E <char style="w">imolane</char> uluba ufiyone baea lubia daalu. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus carries cross" file="IB04164.tif" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="27.27-31">Yesu E imolane digifia aafe.</figure><verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu imolane uluba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maga 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Lugu 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yone 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Ilihe Yesu ulubia daaba ligia, Salini inolo uleno, ene wi Saimono, amo eno aiba miliba labi wakalisia, Yesune <char style="w">imolane</char> efea digimesi egedidilu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Aufia, ili dedalesia, hele <char style="sls">Gologoda</char>ba soiya ami goalu. <char style="sls">Gologoda</char> amone sulu kiwi sisamo, Guni Kiwi Hele. <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Sng 69.21</ref></char></note>Naga gelemesi <char style="w">waini</char> hanodai ede hanodai besifia, Efea namenesi meluso, E naba baafia, naiyalesia afolu. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Sng 22.18</ref></char></note>Aufia, ilihe E <char style="w">imolane</char> baaba dofafia, uluba ufulu. Imolane uluba ofasia, ibolo selu inolo ilihe Yesune fagulo dugulumo osolasia, abe difelaba babiyone sadu dailu. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Ili ami yoba sigia, E yasiba alolu. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Uluba ofasia, E godolumone maumo eweguba seleba ufulu, <char style="sc">Ewe Yesu, <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> Kini.</char></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 27:37">Beba gelelu auba selelumo, ilihe imolanefea ene guni saabia baaba ufulu.<verse eid="MAT 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27.38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:12">Ais 53.12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Yesu E imolane uluba ofelesiamo, fadilo inolo aidamo E aniba imolane uluba ofelesia, nomo inaloalo, nomo fofonaloaloba uluba ufulu. <verse eid="MAT 27:38" /><verse number="39-40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39-40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.39-40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Sng 22.7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109.25</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mad 26.61</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Yon 2.19</ref></char></note>Idele inolo Yesuda imolane uluba ufuluiya amolo suniaba dedaleba ligiamo, ine guni folalelabia dedaleba ligia, baaba gaidesia, soaneba selesia, “Ha ha! <char style="w">Sebele molo</char> bidifasia, hilia osoloa diyobasuba solu inolo amo, Ga! Ga Godene Faibenaga, Gene meleba gasiba dafogosia, imolane afasia, helea sugama!”<verse eid="MAT 27:39-40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41-42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41-42" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">Soba meloda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu inoloda</char>, asidalu ilida, saaba dafalisia, aubasu baaba galiba selesia, “Ehe inolo noolo <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba diloso</char>, Ene meleba gasiba dafelagoba diyale adefe. <char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaelene</char> kini lago, E imolane afasia huga esenaga, amo nine si bisigia, Efea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufiyobasu</char>. <verse eid="MAT 27:41-42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:8">Sng 22.8</ref></char></note>Ehe asigi ule ofelesia, Godefea anifia ado. Aufia, Ehe Na Godene faibeba solugulu, Godehe E gasiba obegeba diyo hamefelaba, nini baaba mela.” <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Ili auba agogosi, fadilo inolo aida, E aniba imolane uluba ufulu amoda, aubasu nagamesi kanoba ofa selaba alolu.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu olalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maga 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Lugu 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yone 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Halo dogo amifia abia, nigiligagalu hele sunia gasiagufia ligiasu, halosi osolo elolu. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Sng 22.1</ref></char></note>Halosi osolo amogulu adesi, Yesu koleba wuaasia selesia, “<char style="sls">Eloi, Eloi, lama sabagadani.</char>” Sulu amo eweguba besife. “<char style="qt">Ne Gode, Ne Gode, Mau enene Ga Na gadefia daalu?</char>” <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Idele inolo imolane aniba alebailumo, sulu amo dofasia, selesia, “Doma, E Elaiya wefebu.”<verse eid="MAT 27:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48-49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48-49" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27.48-49 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:21">Sng 69.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, inolo uleno naguba daafia, fagulo gelelu uleno difasia, kaiamesi waini hano besegililu gefia, i aafo dofafia inigia, Yesufea sunimesi mesi, noolo selesia, “Aso baaba mela. Elaiya milifasia, E sububa dafogofelaba babiyone.”<verse eid="MAT 27:48-49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Aufia, Yesu koleba galagilisia, Ene asubane Enaofea meba lagolu.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51-52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51-52" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27.51-52 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Kis 26.31-33</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:19-20">Hib 10.19-20</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, fagulo sebele moloa ami goloba helelumo, anafia sunia aidaba sosoaba helea asuba dafogosi, helefealu heleli sigisi, abane baliama haganaba dafalisi, dana sogoba ofelesi, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene idele inolo</char> samini danelu ili amone, noolo haiba bebea degeba yaalu. <verse eid="MAT 27:51-52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Ili dana suluba dafelagofia, Yesu haiba bebea degefia labi, ili sidi <char style="w" lemma="Noekene">noekene</char> ami suga abia, idele inolo wedinalefea holobagagaba yaalu.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Yobolone yasilo inoloda, noolo edai Yesuda yasiba alolu ilida, heleli sigife amoda, kegele sunia molofe amoda, bisigia, ili wobasubale sagilisia selesia, “Seale, lago Godene faibe kolebabu.”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27.55 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 8:2-3">Lug 8.2-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba labi, idele wedinale wedino hago ligia, sidafia alolu. Ilihe Galili amifia, Yesu sagoba ufiyone E kuliba milibailu. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Idele ili aleba ami alolumo, ido nomo, hele Magadala ido, <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[2]], Magadala ido">Malia</char>. Aufia, enesaiyo nomo, Yemesedai, Yosebedai, aine enaemo, <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[4]], nooloda alolu">Malia</char>. Aufia, ido nomo, Sebedine faibe aida amone enae.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesune domala abane waali nagelelu usu baliba ufulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maga 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-55">Lugu 23.50-55</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yone 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57-58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57-58" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27.57-58 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 21:22-23">Lo 21.22-23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Geidesi, Alimadia elebeda ufulu inolo uleno, eda Yesune <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibe alolumo</char>, ene wi <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[4]], Alimadia dauno inolo alolu ">Yosebe</char>, inigia, <char style="w">Filadusu</char> labea daafia, Yesune domala diyone eemesi doba abulu. Ausi, Filadusu ehe yobolo inolofea domalamo efea memaba solu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57-58" /><verse number="59-60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59-60" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.59-60 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">Ais 53.9</ref></char></note>Yosebehe Yesune domala difasia, fagulo hagaea nugumadale masofia, ene dana abane waali hili nageleiya ami baliba ufulu. Auba ofasia, ehe abane bule bebelolabia abia, abane nagelelu enomo kaaba dafalu. <verse eid="MAT 27:59-60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />E auba moloba labi, Magadala <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[4]], nooloda alolu">Maliada</char>, Malia enesaiyo noda, dana amo baaba anogoba yoba asulu. Aufasia, ili afa dedalelu.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filadusuhe yobolo inolo dana yasiba melalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Sabadane kegele madeneyo hilia samodosi, adigi keafa <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Falisi">Falisida</char>, ili ua <char style="w">Filadusu</char> labea daalu. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.63 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:40">Mad 12.40</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:21">16.21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">Mag 9.31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33-34">10.33-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Lug 9.22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-33">18.31-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19-21">Yon 2.19-21</ref></char></note>E labea goafia, selesia, “Yasilo, masega sodo inolo ogo aso bebea ligia, sulu solumo nini asigiba obegefe. E eweguba solu. ‘Hilia osoloa alefasia, Na <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeyobasuba</char>’ solu. <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Aulugulu, ga ge yobolo inolofea dana amo yasiba ligiasu hilia osoloa melaleba saamale. Auba molosalenaga, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> milibaisia, Ene domala fa difasia, idele inolofea E olafasia haiba degeluba sodosi. Auba masega selesenaga, amo samini masega solumo suniaba wasiyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Auba selesi, Filadusuhe obegeba selesia, “Dana amo yasimesine yobolo noolo difasia abia, gine asigifeguba kiwigaafia yasiyo malale.” <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Ausi, ili abia dana eno ami, inolo sugalulaba eloba babiyone efolo suu eno kaaba ufulu, abane amofea adagiliba ofasia, yobolo inolo ami yasiba melalelu.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Yesu haiba degelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Maga 16.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-10">Lugu 24.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-18">Yone 20.1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />
    <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> amone faisa hilia agele adesi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">28.1</char> Yudane sogo alegalu hilia agelemo, Domo. Aulune, Yesu hilia Domo haiba degelu.</note> keafale koleba, Magadala <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[2]], Magadala ido">Maliada</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[4]], nooloda alolu">Malia</char> enesaiyo noda, aalu dana babiyone daalu.<verse eid="MAT 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Helefealu heleli bule sigisi, <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">Saminilone sulu dia ano</char> <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefia</char> huga inigia, dana ami goafia, abane eno kaalumo bebeloba dafogofia, amo saabia yoba asulu. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Ene misi yabagelesia yane amogulu abulu. Ene fagulumo, iwa hoolugulu abulu. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Yobolo inolo ami yasiba alolumo, ili amo bisigia wobasubale sagilifia, bibilisia olalugulu alolu.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5-6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28.5-6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:40">Mad 12.40</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:21">16.21</ref></char>
    </note>Auba labi, Godene sulu dia anohe ido aida amofea selesia, “Aali sagilimabu. Aali Yesu <char style="w">imolane</char> olalumo babiyone mulu. Auluso, E iwi male. E samini soluguba, degefia bebea labe. Mila, Ene domala ufuluiya ewe bama. <figure style="fig" alt="Empty tomb" file="18_FB_GNPI_101_Jesus_Resurrection_1024.jpg" size="col" copy="Free Bible Images" ref="28.2-8">E iwi male. E samini soluguba, degefia bebea labe.</figure> <verse eid="MAT 28:5-6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mad 26.32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mag 14.28</ref></char></note>Aufia, aali ogoba sisiba abia, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilifea</char> eweguba saamale. ‘E olaiya amifia degefia bebea labe. Edale saminiba abia, Galili helea maiyone aafegulu, gilida ami dedalefia, E babiyone malale.’ Aalihe ilifea auba saeyo malale. Na aalifea ewe saeyone mulu.” Godene sulu dia ano aalufea auba solu.<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Aufia, ido aidamo danamo afasia, sagilisiaso, henelo nokene wasigafia, ogoba sisiba abia, Ene walelu faibilifea auba saaba meyone daalu. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Alebale hamagi, Yesu aalu wakalisia, “Keafa nafuluba” selesi, aalu Ene emo fafuasia, Efea gulugululu. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mad 26.32</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesu aalufea selesia, “Aali sagilimabu. Aali abia, Ne nelewodalifea Galili ami dedalemalemale. Ami ilihe Na babiyobafe.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yobolo inolofea eweguba awamaleba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Ido aidamo auba daaba labi, yobolo inolo danada yasiba alolu amone noolo abia, sidi ami hugafia, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> ilifea kegele holobagalumo sunia awaba melu. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12-13" />Ausi, soba melone guni inolohe inolo asidalu weba gagaiyofia, nenesia daiyafia, yobolo inolofea mole bule mesia selesia, “Gili eweguba saamale. ‘Nini hanefia labi, nigiliba Ene <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> milibaifia, Ene domala fa dia daalubiyo.’ Auba saamale. <verse eid="MAT 28:12-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Gamanene yasilo awalu ewe dobelesenaga, gili higinilu dilosine, nini edai isoyobasu.” <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Auba selesi, yobolo inolohe mole dibia, ili saaba meluguba mololu. Aulune, masega awalu amo, <char style="w">Yuda</char> mosomu aleba ami, saaba sigilabia abia, agada dobu.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Ene walelu faibilifea dabalu ili molomesi saaba melu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maga 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Lugu 24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yone 20.19-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mad 26.32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> kilelebamo Galili abia, hele galeda Yesu ilifea ami malaleba soiya ami goalu. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Ili E baafia, Efea gulugululuso, noolo asigi dabagalaba alolu. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:3">Yon 13.3</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:20-22">Efe 1.20-22</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yesu E ili labea inigia, selesia, “<char style="w">Hebene</char> lagone kegele suniada, helefealu iwine kegele suniada, yasiyone wida solu kiwigagalumo, Nafea melu dobu. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19-20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.19-20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:15-16">Mag 16.15-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:8">HD 1.8</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:16">8.16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:5">19.5</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 6:3">Lom 6.3</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:13">1Kld 1.13</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:2">10.2</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:27">Gal 3.27</ref></char></note>Aulune, gilimo dedalesia, helefealu mosomu suniane idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geba</char> waalemale. Na gilifea molomaleba solu amo sunia, ili kuliba malesine, gilihe sulu amo ilifea walemale. Aufia ilida Ne <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili melesi</char> moloba waalemale. Aufia, gilihe ili hano geba waalesiamo, Naoda, Faibeda, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekeneda</char>, amone wi alefasia, hano geba waalemale.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 28:19-20">Seale koleba, Na gilidai hilia sunia lolu. Helefealu ewe aso fogo asubale labi, Na koleba, gilidai adabia daabasu miliyobafe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 28:19-20">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="End of Book OnobasuluNarrativeGreen.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="28.19-20" /><verse eid="MAT 28:19-20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>